ācāryaharibhadraracitā
ratnaguṇasañcayagāthāvyākhyā

aparimeyaguṇadhāraṇaparivartas tṛtīyaḥ

darśanamārgānantaraṃ bhāvanāmārgābhidhane sati svalpavaktavyatvena phalanimnatvena ca vineyajanapravṛtter vakṣyamāna(ṇa)sya atyantaviśuddhibhāvanāmārgasya mukhyatas tāvat kāritraṃ kathayann āha - ya imām ityādi / yatra prajñāpāramitāyāṃ bhāvanāmārgasvarūpāyāṃ tādātmyayogena viharanti jagatparitrāṇāśayān nātho(thā) mañjuvākprabhṛtayā(yo) bodhisattvāḥ / tām imāṃ yo grahīṣyati granthato 'rthataś ca jñānena śrutacintāmayena bhāva[39b]nāmayena paryavāpsyati ca sarvakālam / tasya dharmatattvavināśād bhāvābhinive"o viṣam / dahanātmakatvād rāgo vahniḥ, pīḍātmakatvāc chastraṃ dveṣo moho 'pi śaityenānarthakāritvād udakam na kramati bhāvanāmārgeṇātyantaṃ vināśān na samudācarati / āvṛtinyāyeṇa(na) bāhyam api viṣādikaṃ na krāmati na prabhavatīti bodhavyam / evam evam avatāraṃ doṣa~ cchidraṃ(?) māro naiva labhate tatparivāro 'pi  mārapakṣo yatra gṛhītvā viheṭhayed iti bhāvaḥ / kāritrānantaraṃ bhāvanā[mā]rgo vaktavyaḥ / sa ca sāsravānāsravabhedena dvividhaḥ / tatra sāsravo 'dhimuktipariṇāmanānumodanāmanaskāralakṣaṇas trividho bhavati / anāsravaḥ punar abhinihārātyantaviśuddhisvabhāvo dvividhaḥ syāt / ataḥ prathamato 'dhimuktimanaskāreṇa sāsravebhyo 'pi dharmebhyaḥ puṇyam abhisaṃskaroti / kāñcanapiṇḍam iva dhātubhya i[40a]ty apariniṣpannasvarūpā sāmānyena yathādhimokṣadṛṣṭakuśaladharmālambanā 'pi sati samastārthasaṃgrahāt prādhānyena prajñāpāramitāviṣaye 'dhimuktir likhanādikāriṇī(?) bahupuṇyopacayabhūtā vaktavyā / sāpi svārthā svaparārthā parārthety aprahīṇāhaṃ mānavāsanatvena // 
svārthādhimuktiṃ vaktum āha- parinirvṛtasyetyādi / nirvāṇavineyasattvānugrahāṃ(hārthaṃ) nirmāṇakāyenopadarśitanirvṛtes tathāgatasya yaḥ kaścid evaikaḥ sattvaḥ/
musāragalvavaiḍūryarūpyasphaṭikahāṭakam / 
saha lohitamuktābhiraśmagarbhaiś ca saptamam // iti //
saptaratnamayaṃ stūpaṃ caityaṃ kārayati pūjayati ca / krameṇaivaṃ taiḥ saptaratnamayair yathā gaṅgāvālukātulyaiḥ sugatasya stūpaiḥ prapūrṇāḥ syuḥ lokadhātūnāṃ kṣetrasahasrakoṭyas tathā stūpaṃ kārayati pūjayati ceti sambandhanīyam / evaṃ krameṇa yāvanta[40b]ḥ sattvāḥ punara[na]ntakoṭyaḥ parikalpyeti sambandhā(ndhaḥ) stūpāṃs tāvataḥ kṛtvā te sarve pūjāṃ kuryur anyakarmāṇo divaiḥ puṣpādibhiḥ kalpāṃs traiyadhvikāṃs tataś ca bhūyo 'py uttarakālaṃ pūjāṃ kuryuḥ / yaś cānyo janaḥ svārthasaṃpatsampādanāya adhimuktim utpādya sthānāsthānajñānabalādiyogena daśabalānāṃ nānārūpeṇārthakaraṇād vināyakānāṃ bhagavatām / yataḥ sakāśād utpanistām imāṃ granthātmikāṃ sugatamātaraṃ pustakaṃ likhitvā granthārthadhāraṇād dhārayati / puṣpādibhiś ca pūjanāṃ satkaroti /
puṇyasya viṣayabhedam evaṃ nirdiśya prakṛtārtham upasaṃharann āha-kaletyādi / pūrvokte stūpe pūjāṃ kṛtvā yādṛśaḥ puṇyaskandhaḥ parigṛhītaḥ sa yātuḥ(?) pūjākāriṇaḥ puṇyasya kalām vikṛṣṭo 'pi bhāgo na bhavati / tasmāt prajñāpāramitāyām eva svārtham icchatādhimuktir u[41a]tpādanāyety uktaṃ syāt // 2-4//
ato 'nantaram ātmaparasamatayā svaparārthādhimuktiṃ kathayann āha-mahāvidyetyādi / yasmād daśasu dikṣu samu[pa]rataśāsanatvena ye 'tītāḥ / ye 'saṃprāptaśāsanatvenānāgatā / ye ca ghniyamāṇaśāsanatvena lokanāthās te sarve vidyāyām iha śikṣatvā 'viparītasavāsanasarvāvaraṇavyadhipraśamanopāyakathanāt / anuttaravaidyanāyakā bhūtā bhaviṣyanti ca / tasmān mahāvidyeyaṃ prajñāpāramitā bhagavatāṃ sambandhanī / duḥkhasya tāpādinā (kā)yikāsātaveditasya dharmasyābhogādinā vāgvikṣepasya śokasya samīhitārthaviyogādinā (SAMAAHITA°?) cittavaimanasya syād apanayanāc chamanī niravaśeṣasya jagato 'śeṣasya sattvarāśer buddhatvaprāpaṇād iti yāvat // 5 //
yady evaṃ tathāgatānām evotpādanād arthakārikā na bodhisattvādinām iti ced āha-(41b] ye cetyādi / ye vā bodhisattvāś caranti dānādicaryāyāṃ sattvānāṃ hitāḥ santaḥ sānukampakatvāt sada yās te 'pīha vidyāyāṃ śikṣitvā vidvāṃso 'dhigamiṣyanti bodhim / yāni saukhyāni saṃskṛtāni devādīnām asaṃskṛtāni yāni saukhyāniśrāvakānāṃ(ṇāṃ) sarvāṇi tāni saukhyāni prasūtāni mātur itaḥ sakāśād veditavyāni ato māteyaṃ teṣām apy arthakārikety uktaṃ syāt // 6//
kathaṃ punar ekāpy anekārthakārikety āha-bījā ityādi / harītakyādibījāni pṛthivyāṃ prakīrṇāni pūtībhāvādinā 'vinaṣṭatvāt sthitāni krameṇotpadyante / punar api vṛkṣāyurvedanyāyena sahakārikāraṇakalāpaṃ prāpyānekarūpāṇi phalāni prasravanti / evaṃ yathā sahakārikāraṇabhedād bhedas tadvad ekāpi jinajananī tathāgatatvādyanekārthakāriketi mati[ḥ] / nanv anyeṣām api maitryādī[42a]nāṃ buddhatvādau kāraṇatve kathaṃ mātur eva ekasyāḥ kāraṇatvaṃ kathyata iti ced āha- yāvantetyādi / sāmānyena yāvante(nto) maitryādayo bodhyāvāhakatvena abhyasa(sya)nta iti bodhiguṇā / viśeṣeṇa pāramitāś ca pañca dānādyā dharmāḥ saṃvidyante / yasmāt te sarve prajñāpāramitā [a]ta eva kartṛkarmakriyānupalambhād aviparyāsā bhavanty asau sātaiva(?) pradhānaṃ kāraṇam ityarthaḥ // 7 // 
na tu (nu) teṣām anuyāyinī kasmād iyaṃ notpadyata ity āha-yenaivetyādi /
pratyudā(dyā)na svayaṃ  yānakalahāstrajito 'vidhāḥ /
suvarṇarūpyatāmnāyaś cakriṇas te 'dharakramāt //
ekadvitrircaturdvīpāḥ // 
itivacanāc caturṇāṃ cakravartinām anyatamo 'pi rājā cakravartī yenaiva mārgeṇa vajrati tenaiva tatpuṇyādhipatyanirjātatvāc cakraratnādisaptaratnānāṃ balakāyo hastyādisamūhaḥ / sarvo 'py evaṃ [42b] yenaivāviparyāsarūpeṇa mārgeṇa prajñāpāramiteyaṃ jinānāṃ jagannairātmyasaṃvittir yogisantāne samutpadyate / tadādhipatyanirjātatvāt tenaiva sarvaguṇā maitryādayo 'viparyāsarūpadhāraṇād dharmāḥ / samyag ābhimukhyenotpadyante 'to 'viparītajñānapūrvaṅgamatvāt sarvadharmādhigamasya na mātā kasyacid anuyāyinī tvenotpadyata iti / evaṃ sarvaprakāreṇa svaparārtham icchatādhimuktir utpādanīyā mātarītyuktaṃ syād iti // 8 //
ratnaguṇasañcaya[gāthā]vyākhyāyām aprameyaguṇadhāraṇapāratvenamitāstūpasatkāraparivartas tṛtīyaḥ //

guṇaparikīrtanaparivartaścaturthaḥ
ato 'nantaraṃ svātmīkṛtajagatsvabhāvatvena parārthādhimuktiṃ vaktum āha- śakra ityādi / anayor dvayor bhāgayoḥ sthāpitayoḥ katara(raṃ)tvaṃ kauśikka bhāgaṃ gṛhnīyā iti jinena paripṛṣṭaḥ praśnaṃ [43a] yadi jinadhātu sarve sarvair bhūbhāgavyāpanāt paripūrṇāni śikhāparyantakaraṇāc cūḍikā baddhāni gaṅgānadīvālukasamāni syur buddhakṣetrāṇyeko bhāgaḥ / tadā imām eva prajñāpāramitāṃ bhāgam ahaṃ gṛhnīyām ity evam uktavān iti gāthārthaḥ //
tathāgatagrahaṇaṃ pratyagauravo ko hetur ity āha-kiṅkāraṇam iti / pariharann āha-netyādi / na me tathāgataśarīreṣvagauravam / api tu khalu punar yathā rājānaṃ niḥśrito naras tadanubhāvād eva labhate sarvatra tadvijine deśe pūjām / tathā prajñāpāramitāṃ niḥśrito buddha evāryadharmāṇāṃ hetutvena dhātus tadadhipatyāl labhate sarvatra traidhātuke pūjām / yatas tasmāt prajñāpāramitāyāḥ paribhāvitatvān māhātmyayogena sarvathā parivāsitatvāt tāni śarīrāṇi prāṇabhṛtaḥ pūjanti / evam ahaṃ prajñāpāramitāṃ svīkuryām // 2 //
yady evaṃ [43b] parinirvṛte bhagavati niḥśritvābhāvān na pūjety aśaṃkya dṛṣṭāntapūrvakaṃ kathayann āha- maṇītyādi / yathā maṇiratnam amanuṣyādi apanayanāt sarvaguṇair yuktam ata eva mūlyātikrāntatvād anarghaprāptam / yasmin karaṇḍake sthitaṃ sakaraṇḍako ratnānubhāvād vandanīyo bhavet / tasmāt karaṇḍakād uddhṛte 'smiṃs tasyaiva maṇiratnasya te sarve guṇahetutvād guṇamayā bhavati / evam e(m ī)dṛśāḥ prajñāyā varapāramitāyā guṇā yasmād abhyupagatanirvāṇe 'pi bhagavati mātur ādhipatyena bhavyānāṃ prātihāryakaraṇān manaḥprasādahetutvena jinadhā[tu] / tathā dhātuparīkṣāsūtralakṣaṇopetā labhante pūjām / tasmād yo jinaguṇāt parārthyādhimuktyā pari[44a]gṛhītukāmaḥ sa prajñāpāramitāṃ likhanādyabhiyogena gṛhnantu sarvopadravapraśamanād enāṃ mokṣam nirvāṇam iti yāvat / anena parārthādhimuktinigamatā bhavet // 3-4 //
nanv anyāsvapi dānādipāramitāsvadhimukto  kasmāj jinajananyām eva prādhānyena trividhādhimuktir nirdiṣṭety āha-pūrvaṅgametyādi / prabhedena yasmāt kartṛkarmakriyānupalambhena dāne dīyamāne prathamataḥ pravṛttatvāt pūrvaṅgamo prajñā bhavati / eva(vaṃ) śīle kṣāntau vīrye tathā dhyāne /pūrvokta ca (ktasya) śabdasya bhinnasambandhatvāt / parigrāhikā copalambhakārikā ca bhavati / kuśaladharmāṇāṃ dānādīnāṃ paripuṣṭatvāpādanād (°APADAANAAD?) avipraṇāśe śrāvakādibodhāv aniryātanāc cirasthāyitve kartavyaḥ / etan nimittam ekā ca sā karuṇāgarbhatvāt saṃkṣepeṇābhyasyamānā sarvadharmān api citto[44b]tpādādīn nidarśayati pratyakṣavat / atraivādhi(atas tatra trividhādhi)muktir nirdiṣṭeti bhāvaḥ atha vā prajñāpāramitāyāṃ yā ādhimuktiḥ saiva sarvatrāviśeṣād iti // 5 //  
dṛṣṭāntapūrvakam āha-yathetyādi / yathā jambūdvīpe bahavo vṛkṣāṇāṃ sahastrakoṭyo yathākramaṃ kāryakāraṇavaicitryān nānāprakāravividhāḥ svarūpavailakṣaṇyād anekarūpāś ca bhavanti / tāsāṃ nāpi chāyāyā nānāṃ (nātvaṃ) bhaved bhinnaśabdavācyatvān na viśeṣatāpy acchāyāmātraparāvṛtarūpatvād yadi paraṃ cchāyākāyety evaṃ saṃkhyā vyapadeśaṃ gacchati pratilabhate / kāyasvarūpe 'bhidhīyamāne nirdiśyamāna iti yāvat / tathā prajñāpāramitayā trimaṇḍalaviśuddhyāviparyāsarūpāntarakaraṇāt pariṇāmitatvena bhavanti // 6 //
pañcaime dharmā dānādayaḥ pāramitā jinānāṃ sarva[jña]tā[45a]yāś ca buddhatve vakṣyamāṇapariṇāmanāmanaskāreṇa pariṇāmyamānāḥ sarve dānādayo bhavanti pāramitā / jinānām iti pūrveṇa sambandhād evaṃ prakāradvayena dānādayaḥ pañca pāramitāḥ prajñā tu gauṇī pradhānārthānukūlatvāt pāramitātipratītety evaṃ ṣaḍ api pāramitāḥ prajñāpāramitāyāṃ mukhyāyām apāramitāvyavacchedāt pāramitāvyavacchedāt pāramitāśabdavācyatvena nānā viśeṣarūpavirahād ekanayam ekasvarūpaṃ gacchanti pratipadyante / yad uta bodhisattvarūpamato 'viparītadharmatattvadyota[nā]nmātari yaivādhimuktir likhanādināśayapariśuddhiḥ saiva sarvatreti sthitaṃ bhaved iti // 7 //
ratnaguṇasañcayagāthāvyākhyāyāṃ guṇaparikīrtanaparivartaś caturthaḥ ///
puṇyaparyāyaparivartaḥ pañcamaḥ
trividheyam adhimuktiḥ prativarṇakā[45b]doṣarahitatvenābhyasanīyeti jñātvā prahāṇāya prativarṇikārtham anvayamukhena tāvad āha- sa cītyādi / sa ced yo bodhisattvaḥ kalpitaṃ rūpaṃ yāvaccittaṃ abhāvād anityam āvṛttinyāyena vikalpitaṃ rūpādikaṃ kṣaṇād ūrdhvam anavasthitatvenānityam / dharmatātmakaṃ tu grāhyagrāhakādivigamād anityam adhimuktyādhimucya prakāśayati / sa prativarṇikāyāṃ prakrāntārthatiraskāre carati / padārthasvarūpam aprajānāno yamān na dharmamāyopamatvāvayodhāt paṇḍito jano vināśaṃ karoti vyavasthāpayati kadācit / vidharmino 'sattvād iti bhāvaḥ //
vyatirekamukhenāpy āha-yasminn ityādi / yasmin vastutattvādhimokṣe na rūpaṃ yāvan nāpi vedanām upalabhate / kintu tattvato 'nutpādena śūnyatārūpāṃ jānāti sarvadharmān eṣā sā prajñā[46a] yā varapāramitāyāś caryā samyagadhimuktiḥ prativarṇikā rahiteti yāvat // 2 // 
ato anantaraṃ trividhādhimukter bhāvakabodhisattvasyottarapravṛttiṃ pratyutsāhanāya sadbhūtaguṇābhinandanād yathākramaṃ stutiḥ stobhaḥ prasaṃśā(śaṃsā) ca buddhādibhiḥ kriyata iti stutyādikaṃ vaktum āha-yāvantetyādi / yāvanto gaṅgānadībālukātulyeṣu buddhakṣetreṣu sattvās tān sarvān arhatve pratiṣṭhāpayati kaścit / yaś cemāṃ prajñāpāramitām akṣarātmikām anyatamayādhimuktyā likhitvā parasattvebhyaḥ pustakaṃ dadyād ayaṃ tato viśiṣṭaṃ puṇyaṃ prasavet // 3 //
prativiśiṣṭapūrakārthakāriṇaḥ sakāśāt pustakamātradātur viśiṣṭapuṇyatve ko hetuḥ kiṃ kāraṇam iti / pariharann āha- ta ihetyādi / vyastasambaddhād evaṃ gātho 'yaṃ prajñāpāramitā śrutvā śrāvakāḥ svavimuktiṃ tathā pratekabuddhāḥ svabodhiṃ tathāgatāś ca buddhabodhiṃ cintābhāvanābhyāṃ śīghraṃ spṛśanti / tatreha te mātuḥ pustakagrahītāraḥ śikṣitāḥ kutīrthyavādibhir anabhibhūyamā[46b]natvād vādiśreṣṭhāḥ / yasmād buddhyante dharmān akhilāṃ śūnyatāyām iha bodhitraye tan nimmittam / tasmād vikalakāraṇadānād bodhitrayadānaṃ pustakamātradātur adhikapuṇyatve hetuḥ / asyopalakṣaṇatvān mātari yāpi kācid bodhisattvānām adhimuktiḥ sarvāśā(sāṃ) prativiśiṣṭapuṇyahetuketi grāhyam / bodhicittātmakatvād bodhisattva eva sarvadharmāṇām āśrayo nānya[:] // 4 // 
śūnyatā tasmāt stutyādibhir utsāhita ity āha-asata ityādi / yathāṅkurasyopādānahetor asattve drumasambhavo nāsti loke / kutaḥ śākrādīnāṃ tadāyattavṛttīnām utpādaḥ / tathā vinā bodhicittam upādānakāraṇaṃ jinasambhavo nāsti loke / kutaḥ punaḥ śakrādīnāṃ tathāgataparyupāsanādhyāyanta(tta)vṛttīnāṃ prādurbhāvaḥ // 5 //
nanv etad asiddhaṃ bodhicittam antareṇa sattvānāṃ buddhatvādau pravartanād iti ced āha- ādityetyādi / yathādityamaṇḍalaṃ yadā prabha(bhā)sahastraṃ muñcati tadāndhakārāpagamena samyag arthāvagamāt kartavyakriyāsu sattvāḥ parākrāmanti / tathā bo[47a]dhicittasya śūnyatākaruṇāgarbhasya jagatsvarūpaparijñānāt sadā lokaviduṣo jāto tena jñānena duḥkhārṇavanimānasya jagato dharmatattvāvabodhād abhyuddharaṇasāmarthyena śataguṇadharme buddhatvādau samācaranty anyathā 'kāruṇikasyānupāyavato buddhatvādāv apravartanād ity abhiprāyaḥ // 6 //
anvayamukhena bodhicittāyattatvaṃ saradharmāṇāṃ nirdiśya tad abhāve teṣām abhāva iti vyatirekamukhenāpi dṛsṣṭāntapūrvakam āha-yathetyādi / yathānavatapte sarasi bhujagādhipasyāsata(tta)sāmarthyanirjātaḥ kuto gaṅgānadīpravāho bhaved iha jambūdvīpe 'pi tu naiva / tataś cāsatīṣu nadīṣu phalapuṣpāṇi tadudaka[a]pyāyanābhāvān na saṃbhaveyuḥ / na ca sāgarāṇāṃ ratnāni bhinnodakasaṃsparśayogād bhavanty anekarūpāṇi / tatheha pravacane bodhicitte śūnyatākaruṇāgarbhe 'sati tathāgatānāṃ sambandhini tatsāmarthyanirjātaḥ.......[47b] to hitāhitaprāptiparihārajñānapravāho bhaved iha sarvaloke 'pi tu naiva / tataś cāsati jñāne nāsti dānādipāramitā pāramitāguṇānāṃ vṛddhir na ca durāgāhatvād bodhiḥ sāgarasamā svārthasampat / na ca buddhatvottarakālabhāvino dharmāḥ parārthasampadaḥ // 7-8 //
vistareṇa māhātmyam evaṃ nirdiśyopasaṃharann āha-yāvantītyādi / yāvanto loke kvacij jyotīṃṣi bṛhaspatyāditārakāḥ khadyotakādayaḥ prāṇakabhūtāś ca jagadavabhāsanārthaṃ prabhayā saṃsaranti sarve / yadā ca sūryamaṇḍalāt pramukto bhaved ekaraśmir tadānavasthābhāsamātram api pūrvoktatārakādigaṇe syur ābhāḥ sarvāḥ / tadvac chrāvakādigaṇā na kalām api pratipadyante / tasmād bodhisattvānāṃ buddhādibhiḥ stutyādayaḥ kriyanta iti bhāveti // 9 //
ratnaguṇasañcayagāthāvyākhyāyāṃ puṇyaparyā[48a]yaparivartaḥ pañcamaḥ //
anumodanāpariṇāmanāparivartaḥ ṣaṣṭhaḥ
sarvabuddhastutastobhitapraśastasyādhimuktimanaskārasyedānīm anumodanāvidheyetyato 'nantaram anumodanāmanaskāro vaktavyaḥ / sa ca pariṇāmanāpūrvakatvena dvividhas tathā hi yadātmanaḥ kuśalamūlaṃ pariṇāmya pṛṣṭhacittaparipuṣṭaye 'numodate tadā prathamo / yadā tu mātsaryādicittanigrahāya parikīyaṃ (°rikīye) dānādi anumodate tadā dvitīyo bhavet / ataḥ prādhānyena dvitīyam anumodanāmanaskāraṃ vaktum āha-
yāvantītyādi / yāvanti śrāvakagaṇāḥ prasavanti puṇyāni dānaśīlabhāvanāmayāni tāni yadi bodhisattvo 'syopalakṣaṇatvād baddhādīnām api / a
[FŏŏTNŏTĕ:[48b]patrāṃ ke citraṃ vartate atha ca [49a-b]patraṃ nopalabhyate]
[50a]pariṇāmayāmīty cintayati karmakartṛkriyopalambhena sarvābhiniveśasthānaprāptatvāt saṅgasaktaḥ / tasmāt pramāṇavyāhatatvena viparyāsarūpatvāt pariṇāmitaṃ na bhaved upalabhyamānam // 5 // 
katham evaṃ tarhi pariṇāma[nā] ity āha / sa cītyādi / yady evaṃ bodhisattvo jānāti niruddhān imān pariṇāmakān dharmān prakṛtivināśena kṣīṇānupacayavināśān tam eva dharmaṃ kṣīṇaṃ jānāti pariṇāmayiṣyati / yatra buddhatve na ca dharmapariṇāmanāmaskāro dharmaṃ puṇyakriyāvastu pariṇāmayatīty api pratipadyate / tadā māyāpuruṣasyaiva pariṇāmanān tena pariṇāmitaṃ bhavati // 6 //
evaṃ sarvadharmānupalambhena kartṛkarmādau prajñāyamāne sati kim arthaṃ tarhy upalambhaḥ kvacid uktaḥ /praṇīta ity āha-sa cītyādi / yadi bodhisattvo māyoopamatvāvabodhe 'pīdam eva satyaṃ moho 'nya (na anya) ity ekāntagrahaṃ karoti / tadā naiva pariṇāmayaty upalambhasya vipa[50b]ryāsarūpatvāt / athānimittam ekābhiniveśaṃ na karoty evaṃ parṇāmitaṃ bhavati bodhiṃ samyakpravṛttatvāt / yasmād yathā viṣamṛṣṭaṃ bhojanaṃ paryavasāne duḥkhavipākam api svāde sukhakaratvāt kiyanmātreṇa praṇītam uktaṃ tathā śukladharmasya pariṇāmanāder upalambho bodhibhraṃśahetur apy ādikarmikāṇāṃ manaḥprasādakāritvāt kiyanmātreṇoktaḥ praṇīto bhagavatā tasmāt tatrābhiniveśo na vidheya iti bhāvaḥ // 7 //
sarvo 'yaṃ nyāyaḥ pariṇāmanāmanaskārokto 'numodanāmanaskāre 'pi grāhyo 'ta eva vistareṇa nirdiśya manaskāradvayam upasaṃharann āha-tasmād modetyādi / yasmād yena kenacit prakāreṇopalambhe doṣas tasmān māyopamatvāvabodham antareṇāpy evam agatyā yathā te buddhā bhagavantaḥ kuśalam avicāraikaramyakāraṇādhīnatvāt / yaj jātikaṃ vicārāsahiṣṇukāryotpādanād yat prabhavam ekānekasvarūpavirahād yallakṣaṇaṃ ca [51a] prajānanti / tathāham anumodayāmi tathāhaṃ parṇāmayāmīty evam anumode pariṇāme ca śikṣatavyam / evam apy aviparyastatvāt samyakpravṛttir iti matiḥ // 8 //
tataḥ ko [gu]ṇaḥ syād iti ced āha / evaṃ cetyādi / evam evānabhiniveśayogena puṇyaṃ parṇāmayamāno bodhāv asyopalakṣaṇatvād anumodamāno naiva so 'viparītapravṛttatvena phaladarśanād baddhaṃ pratikṣipaty ata etad uktakrameṇa vihitānumodanādivacanatvāj jinānām uktavādī bhavati / yāvantaṃ ca jagaty opalambhikā bodhisattvās tāṃś ca sarvān abhibhavati puṇyabahutvaparigrahāt / yathoktanyāyena pariṇāmayamāno 'numodanaś ca sarvopalambhabhayābhāvena śūro nirbhā[kaḥ] bodhisattva iti yāvat / anayoś ca manaskārayoḥ pūrvvaparyāniyamajñāpanāya śatasāhasrikāyāṃ prathamataḥ pariṇāmanāmanaskāram abhidhāya paścād anumodanāmanaskāro 'bhihi[51b]to 'tra tv anyatheti pratipattavyam iti // 9 //
ratnaguṇasañcayagāthāvyākhyāyām anumodanāpariṇā[manā]parivartaḥ ṣaṣṭhaḥ //
nirayaparivartaḥ saptamaḥ 
trividhasāsravabhāvanāmārgānantaram anāsravāṃ bhāvanāmārgo bhāvayitavyaḥ / sa ca hetuphalabhedena dvividha iti / prathamam abhinirhāralakṣaṇaṃ bhāvanāmārgaṃ vaktum āha-jātyandhetyādi / yathā jātyandhānāṃ koṭiniyutāni sārathibhāvarahitatvād avināyakānāṃ mārgasvarūpāparijñānād akovidāni kuto nagarapraveśe paṇḍitāni api tu naiva / tathā vinā prajñām abhinirhāralakṣaṇāṃ pañcaimā dānādipāramitāś cakṣuṣā rahitatvena jātyandhabhūtatvād acakṣuṣo buddhatvaprāpakamārgapramuditādibhūmiṣv avatārāya pariṇāyakābhāvād avināyakā na prabhavanti spraṣṭaṃ bodhim adhigantuṃ sarvākārajñatāmahānagaram iti yāvat // 1 //
kutra tarhy āsāṃ cakṣuṣo lābha ity āha- yatretyādi / yasmin darśanātyantaviśuddhibhā[52a]vanāmārgayor antare madhye 'nāsravahetvavasthābhāvanābalād yadā bhavet pragṛhītā prajñā dānādinā / tadā traiva sarvasampattihetoḥ prajñācakṣuṣo lābhāl labdham cakṣur bhavet / ata eva buddhatvagamanāt pāramitānāmadheyaṃ dānādikaṃ syāt / anyathā cakṣuṣo 'lābhe tu yathā citrakarmaṇi pariniṣṭhataḥ sarvathā samāptir nayanāc citrakaraś cakṣuṣā hīnas tadakaraṇātraiva tāvatpuṇyaṃ tanmūlyaṃ sampatyupāyaṃ labhate 'kṛtvā cakṣus tadvat sarvasampatyabhāva iti matiḥ // 2 //
yady abhinirhāraprajñābalena dānādīnāṃ pāramitārūpatvaṃ tasyāstu kuta ity āha- yadā dharmetyādi / yadā dharmān kāmadhātvādīn saṃskṛtāṃ śūnyatādīn āsaṃskṛtāṃ (ASA.MSKṝTAA.M?) heyatvena śrāvakādisambandhinaḥ / śuklāṃś cānu(ṇu)mātrān nopalabhate prajñayā 'bhinirhārātmikayā / māyopamatvena vibhāvaṃ bodhisattvas tadā prajñā svata eva pāramiteti gacchati saṃkhyāṃ vyapadeśam / loke kiṃ bhūte yatrākā[52b]śamātraṃ na pratiṣṭhitaṃ kiñcidekāntarūpeṇa tatra pariśuddhair buddhabodhisattvajanair iti yāvat // 3 //
itthaṃbhūtaṃ dharmatattvepy (dhātv) (DHARMATATTVĕ 'PY?) abhiniveśo viparyāsa ityāha- sa ci manyata ityādi / sa cen manyate 'haṃ carāmi jinānāṃ prajñāyām evam abhinirhārasvabhāvāyāṃ mocayiṣyāmi bahutvopalakṣaṇatvāt sattvānāṃ niyutāni bahubhir jātyādiduḥkhaiḥ spṛṣṭāni ceti manyate /
tadāyaṃ viparītapravṛttatvena sattvasaṃjñāyāḥ parikalpako bodhisattvo na bhavati / na cetyasyāpy uttareṇābhisambandhān na caiṣā prajñāyā yathoktarūpāyā varapāramitāyāś caryāpratipattir iti yāvat // 4 //
tadanantaraṃ dvitīyo 'tyantaviśuddhilakṣaṇo  bhāvanāmārgao bhāvayitavyas tadutpādānupādahetvor yathākramam ādānaparityāgeneti / utpādahetuṃ tāvat pratipādayann āha- yo bodhītyādi / yo bodhisattvaḥ prajñāpāramitām iha tathāgatārādhanādipūrvakam ābhimu[53a]khyena cīrṇṇaś caritāvī(vān) pūrvacārikayopāyakauśālyabalena sa jinajananyām idānīṃ vimater akaraṇātra kāṃkṣeti samyagdharmatattvāvabodhabalāt pāṇḍityenāpi tu śrutvānantaraṃ tasyeha punaḥ śāstṛsaṃjñābhaviṣyaty ataḥ sa evotpādahetusadbhāvena viśuddhilakṣaṇabhāvanāmārgaprāptyā śīghram anubhotsyate 'khiladharmatattvādhigamād bodhiṃ copadravapraśamanāc chāntām // 5 //
utpādahetvanantaram anutpādahetukaṃ kathayann āha-satkṛtyetyādi / sampūjya parivārādi pradānena buddhānāṃ niyutāni pūrvañcārikāyāṃ caryāyāṃ na cedānīṃ prajñāpāramitā / skandhābhiniveśenāsanmitrasamparkeṇa māsa(rā)dhiṣṭhānenāśraddhayā jinānāṃ mātaraṃ so 'nutpādaheutsāmarthyanābhimatabhāvanāmārgatrāṇābhāvād atrāṇabhūta iti sambandhanīyam / tathā śrutvā ca yo mātaram imāṃ pratikṣepsyati gambhīradharmāvabodhavaikalyād alpabuddhiḥ sa pratikṣipya yāsyati avī[53b]ciṃ mahānarakam / prajñāpāramitāpratikṣepād eva buddharatnādiparigrāhakābhāvād ātrāṇabhūta iti yojyam // 6 //
upasaṃharann āha-tasye(me)tyādi / yata evam aśraddhāyāṃ doṣaḥ tasmād yūyaṃ bodhisattvāḥ śraddhvam enāṃ prajñāpāramitāṃ jinānāṃ mātaraṃ yadīcchadhvaṃ spraṣṭuṃ sākṣāt kartum uttamaṃ buddhajñānam / yathā svārthakauśalyād asau vaṇignaro gatvā ratnadvīpaṃ na mūlāt sakāśāc chedaṃ kṛtvā punar āgacchati / tadvat prajñāpāramitā ratnadvīpaṃ prāpya pūrvāpārjitakuśalamūlo 'nucchedenādhikyaṃ gacchateti bhāva iti // 7 //
ratnaguṇasañcayagāthāvyākhyāyāṃ nirayaparivartaḥ saptamaḥ //
viśuddhiparivarto 'ṣṭamaḥ
adhigamānadhigamahetuṃ prāptiparihāraviṣayam uktvaivaṃ prakṛtasyātyantaviśuddhilakṣaṇabhāvanāmārgasya sāmānyena tāvadviśuddhiṃ vaktum āha-rūpasya viśuddhi phalaviśuddhita veditavyeti / rūpasya svabhāvasya pañcaskandhādeḥ/ kāraṇasyātmātmīyādyabhinive[54a]śavigamāt māyopamatāśuddhiḥ prathamaphalādiśuddhito veditavyānyathā viśuddhikāryodayāsambhavāt / tathā phalaśuddhi rūpaśuddhito veditavyetyādy āhāryam / kāraṇāt tu vidhāyitvāt kāryasya sāmānyena viśuddhim evam abhidhāya viśeṣeṇāha-phalarūpaśuddhita sarvajñataśuddhim āhur iti / yadānāgamyasthānam ārabhya yāvadākiñcinyāyatanabhūmiko (°KI~NCINNYAAYATANA°?) bhāvanāmārgo nirātmānaḥ sarvadharmā ity evaṃ sāmānyena punaḥ punar ālambanāt pratyekaṃ bhūmāv adhimātrādhimātrādinavaprakārakleśaprahāṇaye mṛdumṛdvādikrameṇotpadyamānaḥ sarvatropāyapāramitāviśuddhyā vaśitvam āpādayati / tadā mūrdhnā(rdhā)vasthayoḥ phalarūpayoḥ śuddhito 'tyantaviśuddhilakṣaṇabhāvanāmārgalābhena trisarvajñatāsāmānyān mārgajñataiva sarvajñatā tasyāḥ śuddhim uktavanto buddhā bhagavantas tathā sarvajñatāśuddhitaḥ phalarūpaśuddhim āhur ity api grāhyam /
śatasāha[54b]srikāyāṃ tathā vidhānāt / evaṃ tarhi śuddher bhedād viparyāsa iti ced āha-sarvajñatā cetyādi / sarvajñatā cetyādi yogisaṃvṛtyā śuddhibhedavyavahāro 'yam uktam anyathā saṃvṛtyādhigamasya pratipādayitum aśakyatvena / nyāyatas tu sarvajñatāśuddhiś ca phalaśuddhiḥ rūpaśuddhiś cākāśadhātor iva samatayā śūnyatayā svalakṣaṇabhedābhāvād abhinnā / sāmānyalakṣaṇacchedābhāvād acchinnety uktā mārgajñatā / tathā coktam-
dhyāmīkaraṇatādīni śiṣyakhaḍgapathau ca yau /
mahānuśaṃso dṛḍmārga ehikāmutrikair guṇaiḥ // 
kāritram adhimuktiś ca stutastobhitaśaṃsitāḥ/
pariṇāme 'numode ca manaskārāv anuttamau // 
nirhāraḥ śuddhir atyantam ity ayaṃ bhāvanāpathaḥ / 
vijñānāṃ bodhisattvānām iti mārgajñatoditā // iti // 1 //
(abhisamayālaṅkāra 1.8-10)
sarvavastuparijñānaṃ vinā na mārgajñatāparijñānaṃ samyag iti sarvajñatāṃ vaktum āha-traidhātukam ityādi / yathābhūtaprajñayā saṃsārādīn avadarśanāt traidhā[55a]tukaṃ kāmārūpārūpyalakṣaṇaṃ samyagatikrāntavanto bodhisattvāḥ kṛpayā ca sattvārthakaraṇapāratantryād vaśiddha(tva)lābhena kleśebhyo 'panītātmbhāvatvāt kleśāpanītāḥ santo jagaty ātmabhāvaparigrahād upapattiṃ nidarśayanty anityatāvainayikasattvānugrahāya ca tatsaṃvartanīyakarmavigamāj jarāvyādhimṛtyuvigamā, jarādipūrvakaṃ vināśaṃ kathayanti / prajñāpāramitāyāṃ yatra caranti nimittavikṣepair aprakampyatvād dhīrās tasyāḥ sarvathopāyakauśalabalenāsannībhāvalābhād iti matiḥ / evam āsannībhūtāyā jinatanayānām upāyakauśalyād viparītaprajñāpāramitāyāḥ saṃsāre nirvāṇe cānavasthiteḥ pratipādanāt sarvajñatādhikāre vyatirekanirdeśenānupāyakauśalyāt samyakprajñāpāramitāyā dūrībhāvena śrāvakādīnāṃ svādhigam yamātrā(nā) prajñāpāramitā kṛpāprajñāvaikalyāt saṃsāre nirvāṇe ca yathā[55b] yogam avasthitā vastvavastūpalambhatayeti jñeyam // 2 //
ataḥ śrāvakādīnāṃ pratipakṣo bodhisattvānāṃ vipakṣa ity āha-kāme cetyādi / kāmyata iti kāme 'nityatvādyākāropetatvena śrāvakādīnām abhilaṣaṇīye / rūpasyātra sāmānyena svabhāvābhidhāyitvād rūpe svabhāve jagati ca sattvabhājanaloke yo 'yaṃ bodhisattvādijano duruktatvāt paṅke saṃgasthāne śa(sa)kto 'bhiniviṣṭaḥ / sa yataḥ dhvaṃsati ke (ṣaṭgatike) saṃsāracakre viparyāsāprahāṇād bhramati / aniyatavṛttitvād vātacakratulye 'janitatvād bhrāntimatadrūpe  jagati dharmadharmirūpeṇa grahaṇāt / mṛgo vāgurāyām iva tasyāṃ tatra vipakṣatvāt na pravartitavyam iti bhāvaḥ / 
kathaṃ tarhi jinaputrāṇāṃ pratipakṣa ity āha-ākāśetyādi / yathākāśe haṃsaprabhṛtayaḥ pakṣiṇo vicaranti / na ca tatra niśritā vastubhūtākāśasyāsattvādevam ākāśapakṣisadṛśā vicaranti rūpādau prajñābodhisattvā / na ca tatra [56a] dharmadharmirūpeṇa niḥśritā rūpāder asattvāt / ato 'nupalambha eva nirdoṣatvāt pratipakṣa ityarthaḥ // 3 //
tayor vipakṣayor heyopādeyavibhā[va]nāyāṃ (vibhāvitāyāṃ) katham anukrama iti / prayogasamatāṃ ca vaktum āha-rūpasmītyādi / rūpādipañcaskandheṣu yo bodhitsattvaḥ samatāvabodhabalāt pariśuddhacārī bhāvanāprārambhe na caraty abhiniveśayogāt / evaṃ saṃ(sa)krameṇa śūnyatābhyāsāt parivarjayati / pratipakṣalābhād vipakṣaṃ sarvapaṅkanataḥ(ṅkataḥ) paṅkebhyaḥ sarvaśa(sa)ktistānebhyo vimuktaś carati sugatānāṃ prajñāyām / śrāvakādis tu rūpādāv anityatvādyavagrahāc caratīti vyatirekamukhenoktaṃ syād iti // 4 //
ratnaguṇasañcaya[gāthā]vyākhyāyāṃ viśuddhiparivarto 'ṣṭamaḥ //
samatayā vibhāvitaprayogeṇa dṛṅmārgo bhāvayitavya iti tadartham āha-evam ityādi / evaṃ prayogakrameṇa caran vidvat paṇḍito bodhisattvo rūpādikaṃ na nityaṃ nānitya[56b]mityādi vipakṣapratipakṣapratiṣedhān nairātmyākāreṇa bhāvayan / darśanamārgalābhe sati tat prahātavyakleśabandhanavigamena saṃgāc chinno mukto vrajaty uttarottarādhigamayogena jagaty asaktaḥ / ataḥ sūrya iva rāhugraham ukto virocate yathā cāgniḥ prayuktatṛṇakāṇa(ṇḍaṃ) kāṣṭhavanaṃ dahati / tadvac cāsau bhāvanāyāṃ prayuktas tat prahātavyakleśagaṇaṃ dahatīti śeṣaḥ / śrāvakādis tu nityatvādibhi[r ākārapratiṣedhe anityatvādibhi]r ākāraiḥ svadarśanamārgaṃ bhāvayatītyarthād uktaṃ syāt / ityuktā sarva[jña]tā / tathā coktam-
prajñayā na bhave sthānaṃ kṛpayā na śame sthitiḥ /
anupāyena dūratvam upāyenāvidūratā //
vipakṣapratipakṣau ca prayogaḥ samatāsya ca /
dṛṅmārgaḥ śrāvakādīnām iti sarvajñateṣyate // iti // 1 //
(abhisamayālaṅkāra 1.11-12)
trisarvajñatām evam adhigamya vaśitvārthaṃ punar viśeṣamārgeṇa tasyā eva manasikaraṇāt sarvākārābhisambodha ity ākāraṃ vaktum āha-prakṛtītyādi / prakṛtyā sva[57a]bhāvena buddhva bhāvanāmāyopamatvāt pariśuddhānimān sarvadharmān prajñāpāramitāṃ sarvākārābhisambodhasvabhāvān paśyati adhigacchati / bodhisattvo yato naiva paśyakaṃ parikalpitam ātmānaṃ nāpi ca sarvadharmān rūpādīn svayūthyair avasthāpitān avidyamānatvāl labhate / ato pudgaladharmanairātmyākāradvayāvagamaneva sarvākārādhigamanād eṣā sā prajñāyā yathoktābhisamayarūpatvād varapāramitāyāś caryāpratipattir iti yāvad iti // 2 //
ratnaguṇasañcaya[gāthā]vyākhyāyāṃ stutiparivarto navamaḥ //
dhāraṇaguṇaparikīrtaparivarto daśamaḥ
viśiṣṭaprayogair ākārā bhāvayitavyāḥ / te ca prayoktāraṃ vinā kathayitum aśakyā iti prayoktāraṃ nirdiśann āha-śakro jinasyetyādi / śakro jinaṃ paryapṛcchat devānāṃ gaṇe caran prajñāpāramitāyām ākārātmikāyāṃ mukhyataḥ kathaṃ yujyate prayogam āpadyate bodhisattva iti praśnaḥ / bhagavān āha-aṇumātram upalambhayogena [57b] yo na khalu yujyate skandhadhātvāyataneṣu dharmeṣu na ca dharme anityatvādike yujyate sāviparītapravṛtatvād yujyate bodhisattva iti // 1 //
pariharan...ity āha-cirayānetyādi / dīrghakālam asmin mahāyāne 'bhyāsayogena pravṛtto veditavyaḥ / sattvā bahubuddhakoṭiniyute ca vihārādikaraṇāt kṛtādhikāro yaḥ śrutvā mātari dharmānimān rūpādīn svahetumāyākāreṇa nirmitatvān māyākalpān naiva kāṃkṣati / punar api yujyate ca śikṣamāṇānyathaiva pravṛtter abhāva iti bhāvaḥ // 2 //
samprati prayogāṃ jinajananyāṃ śrāvakādikāriṇo 'viśiṣṭaviśiṣṭamanaskārasvabhāvān anyathā pratipāditum aśakyatvāc chravaṇāder antarāyadharmātikrama...pratipādanena dṛṣṭāntapūrvakaṃ tāvad vaktum āha-kāntāretyādi / yathā sarvopadravabāhulyatvāt tān mārge puruṣo bahuyojanapravṛttaḥ sann ābhimu[58a]khyena yadā yatnāntarabalād gopālanasīmāsampadoo vanasampado vā paśyet tadāṭavībhayābhāvād aśvāsaṃ prāpte bhaven na cāsya cauratrāso yasmād abhyāsan na grāmanagārāṇaṃ imāni pūrvanimittanigopālādīti paśyet / evam eva yadā prajñāpāramitāṃ śrā(śra)vaṇāyāsyopalakṣaṇatvāc cittanārthanāṭyarthaṃ yo bodhisattvo bodhiṃ tatprāptidharmānuṣṭhānād gaveṣamāṇo labhate tadā samyaṅmārgalābhād āśvāsaṃ prāpto bhaven na ca tasya yānāntarapātatrāso yasmān mātari śravaṇādiyogasampatyā nārhatvabhūmiṃ nāpi pratyekatvabhūmiṃ labhate // 3-4 //
idānīṃ mātuḥ śravaṇādeḥ sarvasampatsamarpaṇavyāpārakathanenāpi vaktavyatvād dharmakāyārpaṇavyāpārakathanamukhena tāṃ prayogād dṛṣṭāntapūrvaka pratipādayann āha-puruṣo hītyādi / tathā kaścit puruṣaḥ sāgarajalaṃ vrajan darśanāya sa yadi paśyet vṛkṣān sarvatas tadādyāpi tāvan mahāsamudro [58b] dūr iti tena veditavyam / atha yadā na paśyati nimittāni viṭapādīni tadā nirvicikitsatvān niṣkāṃkṣo bhaved abhyāsanno mahāsamudro na so 'ti dūr iti / evam eva tatprāptyabhiprāyād bodhivaraprasthito veditavyaḥ / śṛṇvann asyopalakṣaṇārthatvāc citta(nta)yan bhāvayaś ca prajñām imāṃ pāramitāṃ jinānām / yady api saṃmukhaṃ na vyākṛto 'nuttarabodhau nāyakena bhagavatā tathāpy atra śravaṇādiprayogasāmarthyenādhigamiṣyaty acireṇāyaṃ buddhabodhiṃ dharmakāyābhisambodhim iti yāvat // 5-6 //
sambhogakāyārpaṇavyāpārapratipādanadvāreṇāpy āha-suvasantetyādi / yathā śobhanetyādi / yathā śobhane vasantasamaye patite jīrṇapatre [jī]rṇaśākhā na cireṇa patrāṇi phalāni puṣpāṇi ca samyag ānayanti / tathā prajñāpāramitā yasyeyaṃ grahaṇayogyatvena hastaprāpyā na cireṇāsau bodhivaraṃ sambhogakāyamatra śravaṇādiprayogabalāl lapsyate nāyakā[59a]nām // 7 //
nirmāṇakāyasamarpaṇavyāpārakathanamukhenāpy āha-ythetyādi / yatheṣadkutsitā strī jātagarbhatvād gurviṇī yadāsannaprasavakālatvenāṅgaṃ vijṛmbhamāṇā ceṣṭate vedanābhir abhibhūtā satī / tadā jñātavyaḥ kālo 'yam asyāḥ prasavanāt prajāyanāya / tathā bodhisattvaḥ śṛṇvan pūrvavac cintayaṃś ca jinānām prajñāpāramitāṃ yadottarottarābhilāṣayogāc chandam eva darśayati / tadātra śravaṇādi prayogalābhena sprakṣyati bodhiṃ nirmāṇakāyādhigatiṃ śīghram // 8 //
kathaṃ mātuḥ śravaṇādinā heyopāyeyadharma[a]dharmās tyāgopādānatayā labhyanta ityāha-caramaṇvityādi / śravaṇādinā caran prajñāyāṃ varapāramitāyāṃ yogī yasmān naiva sarvadharmarūpāṇāṃ tattvato vṛddhim utpādaṃ paśyati / na ca parihāṇiṃ vināśaṃ tasmāddharmādharmāś cemāṃ pratibhāsaprāptāṃ paśyati bhāyopamatayā dharmadhātum / śūnyatākaruṇāgarbha[59b]jñānasabhāvān ato yathābhūtapratipattibalān naiva nirvṛttiṃ śrāvakādyabhisambodhiṃ spṛśati / yo viharati ca sa kāyatrayādhigamadharmānuṣṭhānena prajñāyāṃ yathoktāyām ity evam aviparītamārgābhyāsāt sarvam etat phalaṃ syāt / ato prayogā vidheyā iti matiḥ // 9 //
akāra(rā)ṇāmatiśayena māhātmyakhyāpanād guṇam anuktyā(?) taddarśanapūrvakaṃ sutarām abhyasyante paryogā iti tad guṇān vaktum āha-caramāṇvityādi / prayogānuṣṭhāne caran bodhisattvo dharmapudgalanairātmyākārabhāvanāyām iha na vyavasthāpayati / sāmānyena buddhadharmān hetuphalabhūtān viśe[ṣe]ṇa balāni śraddhādīni pañca cchandādisahagatān ṛddhipādāṃś caturo 'syopalakṣaṇatvāt smṛtyupasthānādīn api kāraṇabhūtān vikalpayati / bodhiṃ ca sakalaviparyāsopa[śa]manāc chāntāṃ phalabhūtāṃ prayogabalāt sa nirvikalpakasavikalpakajñānayor viṣayabhāvamāpannānām ekāntāva[60a]sthāpitarūpasya māyopamatayā vitatharūpeṇāvabuddhatvāt / akalpakalpavigato māraśaktivyāghātādiguṇodayena svātantryacaraṇād adhiṣṭhānacārī bhavaty ata evaiṣā sā prajñāyāḥ prayogasvabhāvatvād varapāramitāyāś caryānuṣṭhānam iti // 10 //
ratnaguṇasañcayagāthāvyākhyāyāṃ dhāraṇaguṇaparikīrtanaparivartaḥ daśamaḥ //
mārakarmaparivarta ekādaśaḥ
guṇānantaraṃ ke punaḥ gryogāntarāyakarā doṣā yatparivarjanena prayogā bhāvayitavyā iti doṣān vaktum āha-buddham ityādi / buddhaṃ subhūtiḥ paryapṛcchaddharmadeśanāyā viduṣāṃ viparyāsatāpā(tāyā a)panayanād vādicandram / kiyanto 'ntarāyā bhaviṣyanti guṇahetutvāt guṇe prayoge ratānām iti praśnam / bahavo 'ntarāyā bhaviṣyanti tato 'lpamātram upalakṣaṇatayā parikīrtayiṣyāmi tāvad iti śāstā parihāram // 1 //
etad evāha- pratibhānetyādi / pratibhānāni mātāri viśiṣṭajñānarūpāṇi[60b] anekaprakārāṇi upapatsyante / granthārthāl likhanāl likhitāṃ prajñām imāṃ pāramitāṃ jinānāṃ paurvāparyanirūpaṇād adṛḍhībhūtatvena punaḥ punas tāni śīghraṃ vidyud iva parihāsya(hīya)tyakṛtārthajagatīdaṃ (?) tāvanmārakarma buddhabhāṣitatattvasandehākaṃkṣāpi keṣāñcid atra bhaviṣyati bhāṣyamāṇāyāṃ yato 'parijñānāt na mamātra nāma parikīrtitaṃ bhagavatā na ca jātibhūmiḥ parikīrtitā nāpi gotram ato naiva śroṣyatyapi tu nedaṃ buddhavacanam iti pratikṣepsyatīdam api mārakarma // 2-3 //
tataḥ kiṃ kariṣyantīty āha-evam ityādi / eva mārādhiṣṭhitas te pudgalā mūlaṃ prapāṇaṃ (pradhānaṃ) kāraṇaṃ parityajya buddhatvārthino yathābhūtabodhavigamād aparijñānānāṃ śākhāpalāśabhūtaṃ śravakādisūtraṃ paryeṣayiṣyanti / hastinaṃ labdhvā yathā kecit tadarthino hastipadaṃ gaveṣante / tathā prajñāpāramitāṃ śrutvā sūtrāny anyāni gaveṣayiṣyanti / yathā ca bhojanaśatarasaṃ la[61a]bdhā kaścin mārgayet ṣaṣṭikodanam labdhvā ca sa bhojanāgraṃ manyata iti bhāvaḥ / tathā bodhisattva imāṃ pāramitāṃ labdhvārhadbhūmau gaveṣayiṣyati anuttarāṃ bodhim / tatra ca sārabuddhim utpādayiṣyatīti śeṣaḥ // 4-5 //
prakārāntareṇāpi mārakarma kathayann āha-satkāretyādi / pratītimātrābhilāṣitvāt sa[t]kārakāmā dhanānveṣitvāl lābhakāmāḥ pariṣkārāpekṣaṇāt sāpekṣitāḥ piṇḍpātādyarthaṃ gṛhijanasaṃvāsāt kulasambhava(saṃstava)sampray
uktāś ca bhaviṣyanti / parityajya dharmām imāṃ mātaraṃ kariṣyantīṣaddharmasaddbhāvāt adharmaśrāvakayānādau kāryam anuṣṭhānaṃ panthānaṃ hitvotpathagatā ivetīdaṃ mārakarma / ye cāpi tamin samaye 'nāgatajinajananīm imaṃ dharmaśreṣṭhaṃ śrotum abhilāṣayogāc chandikāḥ karmaphalābhisampratyayād utpādayiṣyanti śraddhāṃ te ca dharmabhāṇakam viditvā svābhiprāyād asatkāryam uktam / apaga[61b]taśraddhatvāt premāpanīta gamiṣyanty anyatra prārthitārthaprāptivirahāt sadharma sa(sadurmana) itīdam api mārakarma // 6-7 //
sarvathā vaktumānantyād aśakyatvena kiyanmārakarma nirdiśyopasaṃharann āha-imi mārakarmetyādi / imāni tāny antarotktāni mārakarmāṇi bhaviṣyanti / yāni tasminn anāgate kāle 'nye vānekaprakārā bahavo 'py evaṃ jātīyavighnakaraṇād antarāyāh samutpatsyante / yair doṣair vikṣepalābhāt samākulīkṛtā bahavo bhikṣavas tatra kāle prajñāpāramitām enāṃ granthārthadhāraṇābhāvān na dhārayi(ya)nty anye tūpāsakādayo nitarām eveti bhāvaḥ // 8 //
bahūpadrave kiṃ kāranām ity āha-ye te bhavantītyādi / yāni tāni bhavanti ratnāni mūlyātikrāntatvād a[n a]rghaprāptāni duṣprāpyatvena durlabhāni tāni dharmatayā sarveṣām abhilaṣaṇīyatvād bahupratyarthikāni sarvakālam / evam eva prajñāpāramitā jinānāṃ durlabhaṃ dharmara[62a]tnaṃ bahūpadravaṃ syāt // 9 // 
kiṃ sarveṣām eva mārakarma netyāha-navayānetyādi / pratyagrapravṛttatvān navayānasaṃprasthitās te bodhisattvāḥ svalpapuṇyatvāt parītabuddhayo bhavanti ye mātaram imām durlabhaṃ dharmaratnaṃ mārādhiṣṭhānabalān na prāpsyanti / yadyevaṃ sarveṣām ādāv asambhave nāstyeva tarhi prāptir ity āha-māro 'tretyādi / yadyapi māro 'tra jinajananyāṃ katham ahaṃ vighnaṃ kariṣyāmīti udvegaprāptatvād utsukā bhaviṣyanty antarāye pravṛttivicchedakartavye tathāpi buddhā bhagavanto daśasu dikṣu vyavasthitā mahāpuṇyaupacittānāṃ mātuḥ parigrahe samanvāhāreṇa sā nāthyakaraṇāt samprayuktā ity asyāḥ prāptir iti gatir iti // 10 //
ratnaguṇasañcayagāthāvyākhyāyāṃ mārakarmaparivarta ekādaśaḥ //
lokasaṃdarśanaparivarto dvādaśaḥ
bhagavatāmātra samanvāhāre kiṃ kāraṇam iti dṛṣṭāntapūrvakam āvedayann āha-mātetyādi / mātur ye putrā baha[62b]vaḥ santi glānāyāt tasyānte sarve durmanaso yathā tatra jvarādyantarāyāpanayane kṛtakṛtajñatayā yatnakaraṇāt prayujyante / tad[vat] buddhā bhagavanto daśasv api dikṣu lokadhātau kṛtāvasthitayo mārakarmāntarāyanirākaranai[ḥ] kṛtaveditayodyogāpatter imāṃ prajñāparamitāṃ mātaraṃ samanvāharanti / guṇadoṣādānatyāgapūrvakaṃ lakṣaṇajñānamukhena prayogā niścitā bhāvanīyā iti lakṣaṇamuktatvāt / tatra tāvat lakṣyate te matikaraṇa(?)sādhanaparigraheṇa j~ñānaṃ viśeṣaṃ kāritram iti trividhaṃ lakṣaṇaṃ lakṣyate / tad iti karmasādhanāśrayād svabhāvalakṣaṇaṃ caturthaṃ bhavati // 1 //
tatra tāvajjñānalakṣaṇaṃ trisarvajñābhedena bhidyamānaṃ sarvajñatādvāreṇa tathāgatanirvṛtyādijñānaṃ tāvat kathayann āha-ye 'tītetyādi / ye 'pi ca vartamānā daśasu dikṣu lokanāthā bhagavantaḥ prajñāpāramitā ato mātur itas te sarve yathākramaprayogā[63a]bhyāsena prasūtāḥ prasavanti prasaviṣyanti cānāgatās teṣāṃ ca buddhānāṃ yathābhūtatattvadarśanāl lokasya darśikā saṃvarddhanāj janayitrī samutpādanān mātā jagatāṃ ca cittacaritāvabodhanāt parasattvacittacaritānāṃ nirdarśikā ca /
yukto 'viparītamārgaprayogabalād atas tathāgatānām utpādo lokadarśanādikaṃ tv ānantyāt katham ity āha-lokasyetyadi / lokasya sattvadhātor yā māyopamatvāt tathatā yā ca tathatārhatāṃ pratyekabuddhānāṃ ca yā tathatā yāvitathatā tathāgatānām ekaikaśā padārthopādhibhedābhāvāt / bhāgabhaga[va]tā tathā svarūpabhedāpratipatter ananyā prajñāpāramitayā hetubhūtayā / nirvikalpajñāne bhāvagammad buddhāḥ / yasmāt tathāgatenāto dharmadhātuvinirmuktatvenānupapatter lokadarśanādikaṃ tu bhavaty evānyathā sarvajñatasya vyavasthāpayitum aśakyatvād iti bhāvaḥ // 3 //
tadanantaraṃ mārgajñatādvā[63b]reṇa śūnyatādijñānalakṣaṇakathanārtham āha-tiṣṭhantetyādi / pratyutpannatvena tiṣṭhatāṃ anāgatatvena lokaviduṣām atītatvena parinirvṛtānāṃ bhagavatāṃ yasmāt sthitaivaiṣā dharmānāṃ dharmatā dharmaniyamarūpatānyathā pramāṇavyāhatatvena viparyāsarūpatvāt muktyanupapatte[ḥ] yad uta śūnyadharmas tatas tām anutiṣṭhitaprayogatvena śūnyatādijñānasvarūpāṃ bodhisattvās tathatām anyathārthena tattvam adhigacchati(nti) / tasmād eva ca tathatāvabodhena sarvadharmādhigamād buddhā iti kṛtaṃ nāma tathāgatair jinaputrāṇām // 4 //
yady evaṃ teṣāṃ śūnyatādijñāne kathaṃ sattvārtha ityāha-ayu gocaro daśetyādi / ayam asādhāraṇadharmādhigamo viṣayabhāvāpannatvād gocaro bhaviṣyad buddhatvāj jinaputrāṇām eva daśabalānāṃ vināyakānāṃ prajñāpāramitāṃ manonukūlatvād ramyām atyuccai[ḥ] sthānatvād girim āśritāṃ tāṃ veditavyau(vyam) / yad uta mahākaruṇāsaṃ[64a]mukhībhāvena jātyādiviparyāsaduḥkhitāṃś ca sattvāṃs tribhyo narakādyapayebhyaḥ śūnyatādidharmadeśanayā vinayanāt samuddharanti / na ca śūnyatādijñānasampattyā sattvasaṃjñāpi teṣāṃ kadācid bhavati // 5 //
nanūpalambhādhiniviṣṭāt kathaṃ śūnyatādidharmadeśanayā vinayatīty āha-siṃho yathaivety āha / tathā siṃho girigahvaraikadeśaṃ niśritya bhayotpādanaparaṃ nādaṃ muñcati / svayaṃ sarvabhayavigamād acchambhī svasthāne mṛgakṣudrakāṃs trāsayan tathā prajñāpāramitām aupalambhikair alabdhagādhāniḥśritya narāṇāṃ siṃho bodhisattvo 'vyāhatapramāṇopetaśūnyatādidharmadeśanayā nādaṃ muñcaty upalambhayābhāvād acchambhī pṛthutīrthikānāmātmīyādyabhiniveśe mukter abhāvād trāsa[ya]nn ato vinayatīti bhāvaḥ // 6 //
tad anantaraṃ sarvākārajñatādvāreṇa svadharmopaniḥśrayavihārādijñānalakṣaṇakathanārtham āha - ākāśvityādi / akāśaṃ niśritya yathā sūryo raśmisaha[64b]srair udkātapādātāpayatīmāṃ  dharaṇīm andhakāravigamena darśayati ca sarvavastūnāṃ svarūpaṃ tathābhyasataprayogatvena prajñāpāramitāṃ svadharmopaniśrayaṃ vihārādijñānena niśritya sanmārgeṇa pratiṣṭhāpanena niyamānād dharmarājo bhagavān jagato 'vagrahaśoṣaṇāntāpayati tṛṣṇānanadīṃ dharmāś ca niścitya pratipattyā darśayati // 7 //
kathaṃ dharmāṇāṃ darśanam ity āha-rūpetyādi / pañcaskandhaiḥ sarvadharmasaṃgrahād rūpasya darśanaṃ yatra māyopa[ma]tve nāsty evaṃ vedanāyāḥ saṃjñāyāś cetanāyā vijñānam eva kuśalādidharmavāsanābhiś cittatvāc cittam / tāsya cānudarśanaṃ yatra nāsty ekānekasvabhāvavirahād idam evādarśanaṃ prajñācakṣuṣā dharmāṇāṃ darśanaṃ nirdiṣṭa tathāgatena / ato viparyāsavinivṛttena tu nimīlitākṣajātyandhādīnām iva pratyayavaikalyād amanasikārato vādarśanam eva darśanam uktaṃ tato 'sa.jñisamāpattyādivyutthitasyaiva yoginā bhāvābhāvābhiniveśam[65a]lasya kleśajñeyāvaraṇasyotpattir i[ti] matiḥ // 8 //
kim ivādarśanaṃ dharmāṇāṃ darśanam ity āha / ākāśv ityādi / yathākāśaṃ sarvadravyābhāvamātratvenātikrāntapratyakṣānumānapramāṇaviṣayatvād adṛṣṭam iti sattvāḥ saṃvṛtyā vyavaharanti / tattvataḥ punaḥ khasyāvidyamānatvān niścitaikāntarūpeṇa darśanam ukta[m a]to 'pi tu naiva tasmād yuktyā nirūpaṇāt vimr.śyatainam artham ākāśadarśanavyavahāram adarśanam eva darśanapāridaśaṣyāt(?) (°PAARIDAR"SA°?) pratipadyadhvam / tathādarśanam eva dharmāṇām darśanaṃ nirdiṣṭaṃ tathāgatena yasmān na darśanaṃ bhaṇituṃ śakyate niścittaikāntarūpadarśanena mayopamatvāt sarvavastūnām iti // 9 //
ratnaguṇasañcayagāthāvyākhyāyāṃ lokasandarśanaparivarto dvādaśaḥ //
acintyaparivartas trayodaśaḥ
jñānākāreṇa sāmānyarūpatayā paricchinnānāṃ viśeṣo jñeya iti viśeṣalakṣaṇaṃ vaktavyam / tac ca śrāvakādimārgebhyo viśeṣamārgātmakam acintyādi vi[65b]śeṣaviśiṣṭair duḥkhādisatyaviṣayair duḥkhe dharmajñānakṣānntyādilakṣaṇair veditavyam ity āha-yo evetyādi / yo bodhisattvo 'cintyātulyatvādibhir evākārair manasikaraṇāt mātaraṃ paśyati / sa paśyaty adhigamād atra prayogabalena sarvadharmān viśeṣalakṣaṇasvabhāvāt duḥkhe dharmajñānakṣāntyādin atra pratibaddhasarvakāryatvena yataḥ sarvakāryaṃ yathā 'mātyo mantrimukhyaḥ karoty upekṣako bhavati rājā tadvad yāvanto ye buddhaśabdasya sāmānyavācitvāt samyaksambuddhānāṃ pratyekabuddhānāṃ ca vyāpāradharmās tathā śravakāṇāṃ prajñāpāramitā sarvāṇi karoti tāni kāryāṇi // 1 //
tad eva spaṣṭayann āha-na cetyādi / na ca rājānaṃ vaidehādikaṃ nāpi deśaṃ magadhādikaṃ rāṣṭraṃ ca rājagṛhādikaṃ viṣayaṃ gacchati sarvaṃ cādadāti sa rājā viṣayāt pratyāyan caran tathā naiva bodhisattvaś calati kvacid dharmatāyāṃ sthitaḥ / sarvāṃś cādadāti ye gu[66a]ṇā duḥkhe dharmajñānakṣāntyādayo viśeṣamārgasvabhāvābuddhabhūmer iti // 2 //
ratnaguṇasañcayagāthāvyākhyāyām acintyaparivartas trayodaśaḥ //
aupamyaparivartaś caturdaśaḥ
kadā punarviśeṣeṇa buddhaguṇā labhyanta ityāha-yadyastītyādi / yadyasti śraddhā buddhakarakā(kāraka)dharmā buddha iti vacanāt sugate buddhadharmair vipakṣān abhitattve(bhave)na dṛḍhā bodhisattvasya varaś cādhimātratvāt prajñāpāramitāyām āśayasaṃprayogo 'nuṣṭhānaṃ vidyate tadā satyadvayān atikrameṇa pravṛttatvād atikramya bhūmidvayaṃ śrāvakapratyekabuddhānāṃ śīghraṃ prāpsyati māratīrthikādibhir anabhibhūtānāṃ jinānāṃ bodhihetudbodhiṃ (bodhihetuṃ) viśeṣalakṣaṇam / ataḥ śraddhāprajñāviṣaye tīvrasampratipattiḥ kāryety uktaṃ syāt / na tu śraddhāpūrvaṅgamatvāt sarvadharmāṇāṃ // 1 //
katham atra prajñāyā vyāpāra iti dṛṣṭāntapūrvakam anvayavyatirekamukhena pariharann āha-sāmudrītyādi / sāmudrikāyāṃ yathā nāvi pralugnāyāṃ mṛtakaṃ ma[66b]nuṣyaṃ tṛṇaṃ kāṣṭhaṃ vā 'lambanaṃ kaścid agṛhṇan vināśaṃ prayāti jalamadhye aprāptatīraḥ / yas tu punarmrṭakādikaṃ gṛhṇāti sa sukhena vrajati pāramata eva sthalaṃ prayāti / evam eva śraddhām upagatā ye prasādamātrāt prajñāpāramitāṃ mātaram anālambanād yadā vivarjayanti / rāgādiduḥkhaduravagrāhatvena saṃsārasāgare tadā sarvakālaṃ śraddhāmātreṇa viparyāsāprahāṇāt te saṃsaranti / jātir utpādo jarā purāṇībhāvaḥ svanikāyavicchedo maraṇaṃ putradārādiviyogād vaimanasyaṃ śokas tat eva taraṃgās teṣāṃ bhaṃgo yasmin saṃsārasāgare sa tathokto 'tas tasminn iti yojyam / ye te punaḥ śraddhābalo bhavanti varaprajñaparigṛhītā viditamāyopamavastusvabhāvatvād bhāvakuśalāḥ /pratītyasamutpādadharmatābalena nirvāṇasyāpi darśanāt paramārthadarśinas te śraddhāprajñābalād yathākramaṃ puṇyajñānasaṃbhṛtaṃ paripūrṇaṃ...[67a] yānapātrapramuditādibhūmisvabhāvam eṣāṃ vidyata iti / tathoktāḥ santaḥ śrāvakādyaviṣayatvena paramādbhutāṃ sugatānāṃ bodhiṃ tathaiva spṛśanti śīghraṃ / ato viśeṣalakṣaṇārthinā dvayaṃ nirantaram ālambanīyam ity uktaṃ bhavet / ālambanānālambanodāharaṇaṃ ca yathāyogaṃ sāntaranirantarakāriṇau vipakṣabhāvaparidīpanārtham // 2-4 //
etad eva dva[ya]m adhigamya viśiṣṭam ādhārabhūtam iti pūrvavat kathayann āha-ghaṭetyādi / ghaṭakenāparipakvena yathodakaṃ parivahati / kasmiṃścit sati jñātavyaṃ kṣipram ayaṃ ghaṭe nāsty atyudakavahane 'kṣamatvena du[rba]latvāt paripakvena tu ghaṭenodakaṃ parivahan mārge na ca bhedanād bhayam upetyasyāpy uttareṇāmi(pi) sambandhād gacchati cāntaropadravāt svastinā gṛham / tathā yady api śrāddhaḥ samparigṛhṇan dharmavicaya[67b]lakṣaṇaṃ prajñām atikramya śrāvakādibhūmidvayaṃ viśeṣamārgalābhāt prāpsyati agrabodhim // 5-6 //
paripakvām aghaṭau pratipatyapratipattidharmayor ādhārabhāvasandarśanārthau nanv anyeṣām apy ādhārabhāve katha[m a]nayor eveti prādhānyāt tathaiva pariha[ra]nn āha-nāvetyādi / naur yathā pūtikāṣṭhādi-apanayanād aparikarmmakṛtā mahāsamudrai(dre) vilayaṃ prayāti sadhanā saha vaṇigbhiḥ / sā caiva nauḥ parikarmakṛtānukūlavātatvāt suyuktā na ca vi(bhi)dyate dhanasamaṃginī copaiti tīram / evam eva śraddhāparibhāvito bodhisattvaḥ prajñāvihīno laghv anuttarabodhitaḥ sakāśādaprāptapariṇyāma(?)m upaiti hāniṃ sa eva śraddhāparibhāvanto bodhisattvaḥ prajñāyāṃ varapāramitāyāṃ śobhanaṃ yuktaḥ sannakṣato  anyatra pātābhāvāt / anupahataś ca svayāne samyakpravṛttatvāt spṛśati / tathaiva jinānāṃ bodhimato dvayam eva pratipatteḥ sākalyam iti jñāpitam / ākoṭitānāṃ [68a] koṭitānāṃ naugrahaṇaṃ pratipatyapratipattisākalyajñāpanārtham etad eva dvayaṃ samparigraha iti // 7-8 //
tathaivāha-puruṣo hītyādi / yathā kaścit puruṣo jarājarjaritagātratvāj jīrṇo bhojanādivaikalyena duḥkhitah śatādhikaviṃśativarṣo yady api kaścid āsanād uttiṣṭhati svayaṃ tathāpi krośam arddhakrośaṃ vā sahāyābhāvenāśaktatvād yo na prabhavati gantum / sa yadā vāmadakṣiṇabāhudvaye puruṣair gṛhītaḥ syāt tadā vā patanād bhayaṃ na bhavati / yāvad gantavyañ ca sthānaṃ vrajati sukhena / evam eva prajñāyām anadhimokṣād iha yo durbalo bodhisattvo yady api śraddhāmātreṇa gantuṃ pratiṣṭhate / tathāpi dharmatattvasānāthyavirahāc chrāvakādibhūmau pātena bhagnatvād bhajyate 'ntarāle / sa eva yathopāyabhūtayā varaprajñayā parigṛhītas tadā na bhajyate spṛśati ca viśeṣalakṣaṇādhigamān nararṣabhāṇāṃ bhagavatāṃ bodhimato jīrṇapuru[68b]ṣasya parigrahāparigrahodāharaṇaṃ prajñāpāramitopāyakauśalyaparigrahāparigrahābhyāṃ yathā yogaṃ saṃsāranirvāṇaikāntapātāpātaparidīpanārthaṃ...bhaved iti // 9-10
ratnaguṇasañcayagāthāvyākhyāyām aupamyaparivartaś caturdaśaḥ //
devaparivartaḥ pañcadaśaḥ
yathoktena nyāyena viśeṣamārgaprāptāv āsvādanopalambhaḥ kalyāṇamitrabalān na kārya ity āha-ya ityādi / ye bodhisattvāḥ prathamaṃ viśeṣala[kṣa]ṇai[ḥ] pravṛttatvād ādikarmikabhūmau sthitāḥ kalyāṇakāśa(ma)tvād adhyāśayena varāyāṃ buddhabodhau prasthitās tair doṣāgrahaṇāt suśiṣyair bahumānatayārādhanād gurugaurāsaṃyuktaiḥ / kalyāṇamitrāṇi sarvakālam upasthānādinā sevitavyāni tacccitasaṃrakṣaṇād vijñaiḥ // 1 //

kalyāṇamitrasevāyāṃ ko heur ityāha-kiṃ kāraṇam iti / pariharann āha-tatvityādi / yasmāt tataḥ kalyāṇamitrebhyo viśeṣalakṣaṇaguṇā[69a]nāṃ prāpaṇād āgamo bhavati / tadavavādānuśāsanībhyām āsvādanopalambhābhāvāt paṇḍitānāṃ  śiṣyāṇāṃ prajñāpāramitāṃ (tānāṃ) ca tāni kalyāṇamitrāṇi anuśāsayanti / tasmād evaṃ jino bhaṇitavān prahīṇasarvāvaraṇatvāt sarvaguṇāgradhārī kalyāṇamitrāṇy upaniśritā buddhadharmā viśeṣalakṣaṇasvabhāvā sati (ataḥ) tāni sevitavyānīti matiḥ // 2 //
kīdṛśī teṣām avavādānuśāsanīty āha-dānaṃ cetyādi / dānādibhiḥ sarvadharmasaṃgrahād upalambharūpeṇa pravṛtāḥ ṣaṭ pāramitāḥ karmakartṛkriyānupalambhenānyathā rūpaparivartanād āsvādanopalambhaparihāṇaye pariṇāmayitavyā bodhau tannimittam / na ca bodhiskandhā nānāsravaphalabhūtā śīlādiskandhān yuktyā ca sthāpanād vimṛśya paścāt tatparāmarṣapratyayenāsvādanopalambhā[t] yaḥ parāmṛṣed iti / deśanā ca ye prathamaṃ prayuktatvād adikarmikās teṣāṃ niśca[69b]yena yuktyā māyopamatāvabodhanād deśayitavyaiva anyathā 'nadhimokṣeṇottrāsād iti bhāvaḥ // 3 //

svārthasampatyā jñānaviśeṣalakṣaṇanirdeśānāntaraparārthasaṃpatyā prayogānāṃ hitādikāritralakṣaṇaṃ kathayann āha-evam ityādi / jñānaviśeṣalakṣaṇaparijñānād evaṃ prayogeṣu bhāvanābalād bodhisattvāś caranto dharmadeśanāyā 'nāgatasukhopasaṃhāreṇa duravagāhaguṇatvād guṇasāgarāḥ / pratyutpannasukhapratyarpaṇena santoṣaṇād vādicandrāḥ / samyagavipākadharmatāyāṃ stāpanenārthakaraṇāt trāṇā bhavanti sattvaloke / tathā 'tyantikahitasamutpādam anāśrayaṇīyatvāc charaṇā duḥkhahetunivartanārthena sevyamānatvāl layanāḥ / saṃsāranirvāṇasamatāvabodhena viśeṣagamanaparāyaṇabuddhihetutvād gatibuddhayaḥ / jalaparikṣiptasthalasādharmyeṇāntadvayaparicchannasvaparārtho 'dhi[70a]gamādhārabhāvasamarpaṇena dvīpāḥ / sāradhi(thi)bhāvena parārthapratipattyutpādanāt pariṇāyakāḥ / nirmitā bhogapravṛttasattvārthopasaṃhāreṇārthakaraṇad arthakāmāḥ / sarvayānaniryāṇasākṣātkaraṇopadeśena bodhimārgālokakaraṇāt pradyotolkāḥ / sarvadharmatattvakathanenāśrayaṇād varadharmakathino 'ta eva māratīrthikādibhiḥ kṣobhayi[tu]m aśakyatvād akṣobhyāḥ // 4 //
svaparārthasampatsampādanakāryatayaivaṃ parijñātarūpāṇāṃ kiṃ tādāmyam iti pratipattisvarūpakathanapūrvakaṃ svabhāvalakṣaṇaṃ kathayann āha-san netyādi / prasanna(prayatna)sādhyatvāt san nāham / duḥkhena kriyamāṇatvāt duṣkaraṃ prayogāṇāṃ svarūpam / prāpatamahimatvān mahāśaya(yaśa)so bodhisattvāḥ / ye bhāvanā prārambhāt sannahyaṃti 7/ vipakṣopalambhābhāvān na pañca skandhair nāpy aṣṭādaśa dhātubhir na ca dvādaśāyatanair sannaddhāḥ / pratipakṣābhiniveśavirahāt tisṛbhiḥ śrāvakādivā[70b]n asaṃjñābhir vigatās tataś ca heyopādeyadharmaparigrahaviyogād aparigṛ[hī]tāḥ / svārthasampado vivṛtyabhāvād avaivartikāḥ / parārthasampadaś calayitum aśakyatvād acalitāḥ tadubhayasampadaś cānyathā kartum ayogatvād akopyadharmāṇo bhavanti // 5 //
prakṛte kathamupayoga ityāha-ta ityādi / ta evānantaoktā bhāvanābalāt prayogānāṃ kleśavivekādibhāvalakṣaṇadharmatayā samanvāgatā nirvikalpakajñānalābhān niṣprapañcāḥ / saṃśayālīkaviparītajñānavirahāt kāṃkṣāvilekhavimatibhyo vigatāḥ / samagjñānopetatvenārthayuktāḥ / prajñāpāramitāṃ śrutvādhigamasaṃpratya yadārḍhyyān na sīdanti ata evāparapraṇeyāḥ svasthānād vivartanābhāvenāvaivartikā veditavyāḥ // 6 //
tathāgatam antareṇetthaṃbhūtaḥ svabhāvo na kenacit sarvākāram adhigantavya ityāha-gambhīretyādi / māyopamatvād gambhīradharmo 'yaṃ svabhāvo duradhigamyamānatvena durdarśo bhagavatāṃ [71a] sambandhī na kenacid anyena śrāvakādinā sarvākāram adhigato nāpi kaścit prāpnoti prāpsyati / gambhīratvād etad artham eva sattvārthaprādhānyena prāsaṃgikatathāgatatvādhigamād bodhim adhigamyāpi sakalajanānugraheṇa hitānukampī bhagavān / prayogasvabhāvalakṣaṇam antareṇa yuktyanupapatteḥ / sattvārthopasaṃhārād alpotsuko jāto yasmāt kaḥ svabhāvalakṣaṇam imaṃ dharmaṃ deśyamānaṃ jñāsyati api tūpalambhābhiniveśān na kaścit sattvanikāyo 'to na dharmadeśanāyaṃ cittam utpāditavān tathāpi brahmādhyeṣaṇā dharmacakraṃ pravartanān iti (ṣitavān dharmacakrapravartanāyeti) bhāvaḥ // 7 // 
yady evaṃ kathaṃ tarhi sattvānāṃ dharmaprāptir ity āha-sattvāś cetyādi / na(ya)dy api sattvā rāgādāv ālaye mu(su)khādyabhimānena doṣādarśanād ratā viṣayābhilāṣiṇo guṇadarśanena tanmanasikārāparityāgāt sthitāś ca grahe 'jñānayogād abudhāḥ saṃśayajñānasadbhāvātmasnehā mithyājñānasadbhāvād andhabhū[71b]tās tathāpi svabhāvalakṣaṇo dharmo rāgādyācaraṇapratipakṣatvāt anālayo jñeyāvaraṇonmūlanakāritvāt anāgraho janaṃ prāpayitavyo buddhādibhir yasmāl lokena sārddham ayaṃ viparyāsābhibhavalakṣaṇo vigrahaḥ / kṣitīse(śe) rājñīmaraṇanivedananyāyenāvyāhatanirātmakapañcaskandhādideśanayā prādurbhūta iti // 8 // 
ratnaguṇasañcayagāthāvyākhyāyāṃ devaparivartaḥ pañcadaśaḥ //
tathatāparivartaḥ ṣoḍaśaḥ
yady evaṃ pratisattvaṃ jñānābhedenādhigamyamānatvāt prayogasvabhāvo bhidyata iti cen nety āha-ākāśetyādi / yathākāśadhātuḥ pūrvasyāṃ diśi tathā dakṣiṇasyāṃ tathā paścimāyām uttarasyāṃ diśy ūrdhva[a]dho 'py ekarūpatvena prakarṣān tattvābhāvād anantaṇaraḥ(?) / tathā d aśasvapi dikṣu yāvān ākāśadhātur asti tasya sāmānyalakṣaṇavirahān nānātvaṃ na bhavet / svalakṣaṇaviyogāc ca na viśeṣaprāptatā // 1 //
laukikaprasiddhyā dṛṣṭāntaṃ nirdiśya lokottarapratītyāpy āha-[72a]atikrāntety ādi / atikrāntātītavastūnāṃ yā tathatānāgatānāṃ yā tathāprāptā / pratyutpannānāṃ vartamānānāṃ yā tathatā kṣīṇāsravatvena yā tathatā arhatāṃ tadvidparyayeṇa sarvadharmāṇāṃ [yā] tathatā / yā ca tathatā bhagavatāṃ sarvānanataroktaiṣā dharmātmikā tathatā vimukter nānākaraṇābhāvena viśeṣasādhakapramāṇavirahāt na viśeṣaprāptā tathā prayogāṇāṃ svabhāvo bahubhir api sākṣātkriyamāṇatvād eka eveti matiḥ // 2 //
yathoktalakṣaṇaparijñānaṃ mokṣabhāgīyakuśalamūlavat eveti mokṣabhāgīyaṃ vaktum āha-yo bodhītyādi / yo bodhisattvo lakṣaṇaparijñānādinā(mā)m icchati sākṣātkaraṇena prāptum/ sarvopalambhābhāvān nānātvadharmavigatāṃ sugatānāṃ bodhim / so 'nimittajñānā[nā]lambanākāreṇa dānādibuddhadharmāṇāṃ samudāgamārtham / akhilaṃ bhūtāṃ sarvākāraparijñānāt prajñāpāramitāyām adhimātraśraddhādi[72b]bhirdharmarupāyair yuktāṃ bhavet / yasmād vinā prajñām asyopalakṣaṇatvād adhimātraśraddhādīnāṃś ca nāsty adhigamo naranāya[kā]nām // 3 //
nanv anye 'pi buddhaprāptaye vidyanta e[va] kasmāt prajñopāyadvaya nirdiśyata iti dṛṣṭāntapūrvakaṃ pariharan nāha-pakṣītyādi / yathā pakṣī yojanaśatikāditvān mahātmabhāvaḥ pañcāśadyojanikā vājātapakṣatvād abalaḥ punaś channapakṣatvāc ca kṣīṇapakṣo bhavet / sa tra[a]yastriṃśato deva bhavanād iha jambudvīpe stāsyāmīty āśayena yadātmanam utsṛjet tadā patitaḥ satpakṣavaikalyād vilayaṃ vajret / tathā yady api dānādyāḥ paṃcemāḥ pāramitā jinānāṃ bahukalpakoṭiniyutāni paripūraṇāt samudāneyyā praṇidhīn anekaprakāratvād anantāt(na) / ativistīrṇadharmālambanatvāt vipulān abhyasanād āsevayet / tathāpi pūrvoktopāyavirahād anupāyoo yathoktaprajñāvihāra(rahā)t prajñāvikalaḥ / pakṣadvayavaikalyāt patec chrāvakatve tata[73a]ś cānuttarabhūmau vinaśyed evaṃ ca prajñopāyadvayam eva pradhānaṃ paridīpitaṃ syāt // 4-5 //
nirvedhāṅgaṃ vaktum āha-niyāma (ryāya)nāyetyādi / ūṣmādyadhigamān niryātuṃ yo bodhisattvaḥ samyag ihecched buddhajñāne va (v
ā) sa prathamam ūṣmotpādadanārtham anunayābhāvāt samacittaḥ / sarvasmin jagati ālambanarūpeṇa viharaṇāt parākramet / evaṃ pitṛbuddhitvāt pitṛsaṃjño mātṛbuddhitvāt mātṛsaṃjño 'nāgatārthajñānatvād dhitacittaḥ pratyutpannārthamano?bhimukhīkaraṇan maitracittaḥ parākrāmet? / pratighaviheṭhanādoṣābhāvād akhilo bhātṛsami(bhagi)nyādicittatvād ārjavaḥ parākrāmed iti pūrveṇa sambandhaḥ / mūrdhnādyadhigamārthaṃ svayaṃ pratipattiparo 'nyeṣāṃ kuśalādau niyojanādinā mṛduvacanenāmantraṇāt sadā lapet / nanu katham atra viśeṣamārgarūpatvān nirvedhabhāgīyādivyapadeśo ghaṭata iti ced ucyate [73b] aṣṭamyāṃ [a]nini(mi)ttānābhogamārgalābhena tāvat kālasattvārthavicchedasya parihārārthaṃ sakṛdutpattinirāsāya samacittatvādibhir ākārair māyopamatayā sattvālambanādau viśeṣamārga eva mṛdvādikrameṇotpadyamāno nirvedhabhāgīyādivyapadeśenātrābhihito grāhyaḥ /tathottaratrāpi yathāsambhavaṃ veditavyam iti // 6 //
// ratnaguṇasañcayagāthāvyākhyāyāṃ tathatāparivartaḥ ṣoḍaśaḥ //

avinivartanīyaparivartaḥ saptadaśaḥ 
avaivartikabodhisattvasaṃghasya yathoktanirvedhabhāgīyam anyad api darśanamārgādikam ity avaivartikabodhisattvasaṃgho vaktavyaḥ / sa tu nirvedhabhāgīyaprayogamārgasthaḥ / tathā kṣāntijñānasaṃgṛhītadarśanamārgastho 'paraś ca prābandikabhāvanāmārgastha iti vyavastho(thā) bhavati / ataḥ sāmānyenāvaivartikalakṣaṇaṃ pṛcchann āha-sthavītyādi / sthaviraḥ subhūtiḥ paripṛcchati sma lokanāthaṃ svaparavicikitsāvaraṇaprahāṇād asaṃkīrṇapratipattinimittamaraṇārtha[74a]liṅgaṃ kāyikaṃ cihnam / asyopalakṣaṇatvād ākāraṃ pratipakṣaṃ saṃgṛhītaṃ nimittaṃ copakaraṇastham / sakrḍabhidhānena bhaṇata yūyaṃ bhagavanto 'mitaguṇamayamūrttitvād guṇasaṃcayānāṃ jinaputrāṇām anuttarabodhir nivṛtyabhāvād avaivartikāḥ yena liṅgādinā yuktā bhavanti / bodhisattvāḥ svaparārthasampattiyogān mahānubhāvāḥ / tac ca liṅgādikaṃ punaḥ spaṣṭapratipattaye vyāharaṇād vyākarotu he jina bhagavan atisaṃkṣepasya vivakṣatatvād guṇānāṃ rūpādinivṛtyādyākārāṇāṃ pradeśamātram // 1 //
tatra tāvan nirvedhabhāgīyasthānānām avaivartikalakṣaṇaṃ vakrum āha-nānātvetyādi / rūpādibhyo 'vagrahavinivartanān nānātvasaṃjñayā vigatāḥ / māyopamārthaprakāśarvenārthasaṃhitāyā giro niścāraṇād yuktavaco bhaṇino vicikitsāprahāṇān na cānyān bodhisattvās te 'śravaṇāt (te śramaṇān) pa[a]ṇḍarabhikṣuprabhṛtī[n] brāhmaṇān vā śaraṇādināśrayante aṣṭākṣaṇaviyogāt tribhir apāyair asyopa[74b]lakṣaṇatvāt mithyādṛṣṭyādibhir vīji(varji)tā heyopādeyatattvaparijñānād vidvāṃsaḥ sarvasmim kāle bhavanti / svaparayor ekāntena prāṇātipātaviratyādau vyavasthāpanād daśabhiś ca te jinaputrāḥ kuśalaiḥ karmapathair yuktāḥ / sarvasattvaviṣaye dānādipāramitāpariṇāmanād dharmmaṃ phalādinirapekṣyacittatayā nirāmiṣo jagato niryātanād anuśāsayanti gambhīre 'pi dharmakāṃkṣāvirahād ekā māyopame dharme niścayena ratāḥ / maitrakāyavāṅ manaskarmopetatvena hitasukhābhidhāyitvāt sadā snigdhavākyāḥ / sthitiṃ caṃkramaṇaṃ śayyāṃ niṣadyāṃ ca smṛtisamprajñānayogena śobhanaṃ samyakprakarṣavṛttyā jānānāḥ / saprāṇakādideśaparihārārthaṃ yugamātraprekṣaṇo vrajanti / bhinneryāpathā vikṣepābhāvād abhrāntacittāḥ / akuśaladharmaviyogāc chucayo vivikta(dha)vastrādyupabhogāc chaucāmbaradharāḥ / lakṣaṇādyalaṃkṛtakāyavāṅmanoviśuddhilābhāt trivivekaśuddhāḥ / mātsaryā[75a]dicittānutpādān na ca lābhakāmāḥ / sarvatra dharmatāviruddhayogakaraṇād vṛṣabhiṇo jagadanukampayā narakādyabhilaṣaṇot(ṇāt) sadā dharmakāmā / viditasaṃpratyayadharmatvāt māraviṣayasamatikrāntā / mārasya mārarūpeṇa niścayād aparapraṇeyā / buddhānujñātacaryatvena caturdhyānadhyāyino na ca niḥśritās teṣu dhyāneṣu nirvedhabhāgīyasthitāvaivartikalakṣaṇānantaraṃ dharmatattvābhyāsena darśanamārge sthitānām avaivartikalakṣaṇam // 2-4 //
tadadhigamānurūpakāyavāṅmanovyāpārakathanena vaktum āhaṇa cetyādi / rūpādisaṃjñāvyāvartanān na ca kīrtikāmāḥ / mahāyānapravṛttatvena sarvatra dveṣābhāvān na ca krodhaparītacittāḥ / nairātmyasattvārthopāyakauśalasamarthenānabhiniveśā kāmopabhogād agṛhībhūtāḥ sarvakālaṃ viṣayādīn avadarśanena brahmacāritvād avadhyavasitāḥ sarvavastuṣu / satpuruṣadharmatvān na ca jīvikārthaṃ viṣameṇa krayavikrayādi[75b]nā bhogaṃ gaveṣante / tathā sattvāpakāraṇārthaṃ cāmuṇḍādīnām abhicāramantrakutsitatvāt strīṇāṃ ca kāmadevādimantraiḥ puruṣāṇāṃ vaśīkaraṇāt prayogamantrān na gaveṣanta iti yojyam / na vadyā(vyā?)karaṇād ādiśanti puruṣo vā strī vā te 'vaśyam icchaṅ karmakāriṇī bhaviṣyatīti / satyadvayasamāśrayaṇāt prativiviktāyāṃ prajñāyāṃ varapāramitāyāṃ cābhiyuktyāḥ(ktāḥ) kāyavāksamārambhaviyogāt kalahavivādebhyo vigatāḥ / sarvasattveṣv atiśayasukhotpādana cittatvena dṛḍhamaitracittāḥ / śūnyatāvasthitatvāt sarvajñatvakāmāḥ / dharmasyāṇumātrasyopalambhābhāvena sadā śāsane nimnacittāḥ / svotpattivaśitalābhena tatrotpatter virahāt pratyantamlecchajanena varjitās tathā varjitaśabdasyottareṇāpy abhisambandhāt parityaktāntadeśatvena varjitāntadeśāḥ / saṃjātābhisamprayayatvena trisarvajñatātmikāyāṃ svakabhūmau saṃdehābhāvāt kāṃkṣāvigatāḥ / niśca[76a]yarūpeṇāvasthānāt sadā merukalpāḥ / suṣṭhu nimnatvena sarvākārajñatādi dharmārthaś cittaparityāgāj jīvitaṃ tyajanti / prāṇo(pramāṇo)petamanasikāratvāt prayuktayogāḥ / pradeśamātrasya vivikṣatvād avaivartikānāṃ hetunā yaḥ samagreṇa kāryotpādo 'numīyate / arthāntarān apekṣatvāt sa svabhāvo 'nu(tra)varṇita iti nyāyād imāny anantaroktāni liṅgāni prajñātavyānīti // 5-7 //
ratnaguṇasañcayagāthāvyākhyāyām anivartanīyākāraparivartaḥ saptadaśaḥ //

śūnyatāparivarto 'ṣṭādaśaḥ
sampratibhāvanāmārgasthāvaivartikalakṣaṇaṃ vaktuṃ nāgṛhītaviśeṣaṇāviśeṣye buddhir utpadyate iti nyāyād bhāvanāmārgaṃ tāvad viśeṣayann āha-gambhīretyādi / yathābhūtā gambhīrā tathā tattvato 'nutpannatvena gambhīraṃ rūpam / evaṃ vedanā cetanā vijñānaṃ saṃjñā ca gambhīrety anena tathatāyāṃ na rūpādikam iti samāropāntaḥ pratisi(ṣi)ddhaḥ / tathā saṃvṛtyā rūpādīnāṃ ca prakṛtisvarū[76b]patā nyāyato 'khilanimittāpagamād animittāḥ / sarvopaplavaśamanāc chāntāḥ / ity anena ca nānyatra rūpādikaṃ tathatety apavādāntaḥ pratikṣipto bhavet / ato 'labdhapramāṇaḥ kaścit kāṇḍena kṣiptena gādhapramāṇaṃ yathā sāgare paryeṣamāṇaḥ paryeṣate tadvatprajñayā skandhāt samāropāpavādāntarahitayā(?) vimarśapratyayena vimarṣayed alabdhagādhaḥ sann iti gambhīryayogād gambhīro bhāvanāmārga ityuktaṃ bhavet // 1 //
viśeṣaṇam nirdiśyaivaṃ sānusa(śāṃ)saṃ viśeṣyaṃ bhāvanāmārgaṃ vaktuṃ tatkāritramukhena praśnayann āha-yo bodhītyādi/ yasmin bhāvanāmārge tattvato na skandhān nāpy āyatanāni na dhātavas tasya punaḥ punar abhyāsād yo bodhisattvo rūpādīn imān adhigacchati / sarvadharmān dharmapudgalanairātmyākāratayā gambhīre mahāyāne paramārthanopalambhalepābhāvān nirupalepāt / kiyatpudgalaḥ puṇyaṃ prasavati / jñānasambhārasyya ca prati[77a]lambhāt samudāgamaḥ kiyāṃś ca tasya bhavatīti gāthārtho yojyaḥ // 2 //
phala(laṃ) ced anena(?) pratipādayann āha-yathetyādi / yathā nyūne[ ']pi viṣaye 'dhikāsaṅgatvād rāgadharmacaritaḥ kaścit puruṣaḥ striyā sahāputradvayā(sahāmukaṃ tvayā) gantavyam ity abhidhānāt saṃketaṃ kṛtvā tatra gato 'labhamānaḥ sanni(nne?)yamāgatetyādi vitarkayati / evaṃ krameṇa vitarkabāhulyāt yāvanti cittasya caritānyālambane vijya(jṛ)mbhitāni sakalena divasena vartante tasya puruṣasya tāvato rāja(ga)caritapuruṣavitarkasaṃkhyāvacchinnan kalpān saṃsarataḥ pṛṣṭhīkaraṇād yāvatā puṇyajñānasambhāreṇānubuddhyate bodhisattvaḥ tāvat puṇyajñānasaṃbhāras tasya bhāvanāmārgasāmarthyena bhavatīti bhāvaḥ / bhāvanāmārgasyedānīṃ trividhavikalpaprahāṇāya mṛdumadhyādhimātraprakārabhedaḥ saṃkṣepasyātra vivakṣitatvāt vaktavyam(vyaḥ) / tatra ca mṛdunā mārgeṇādhimātravikalpasya prahāṇaṃ yāvadadhimātreṇa mṛduvikalpasyeti grāhyam ādita evādhi[77b]mātramārgasambhavād utpannādhimātramārgasya bodhi(adhi)mātrakleśābhāvāt / ato 'nyopadeśenaottarottarapuṇyādhitvarga(katva) pratipādanāt pratipakṣaprabhedam abhibhūyamānapuṇyavacanena ca vipakṣaprabhedaṃ nirdiśatam // 3 //
mṛdumārgārtham āha-yo bodhisattva ityādi / yo bodhisattvo bahukalpasahasrakoṭīr upalambhayogena buddhādibhyo dānaṃ dadyād arhatāṃ pratekabuddhānāṃ ca sambandhiśīlaṃ rakṣed yaś cāparo jinaputrah prajñāyāṃ varapāramitāyāṃ mṛdumārgasvabhāvāyām abhiyukta[ḥ] / tato vyutthāya mātaram imāṃ dharmaṃ yathāvat sattvān bhaṇedato viśiṣṭacittapūrvakaṃ dharmadānam ayaṃ puṇyam apekṣya nikṛṣṭabhāgānupapatteḥ kalāmātra. puṇyaṃ na bhavati / pūrvake dāne śīlaṃ saṃrakṣaṇe satyapi draṣṭavyaṃ tathā prakṛtatvāt // 4 //
madhyamārgārtham āha-yaityādi / yo bodhisattvo varāṃ prajñāṃ madhamārgasvabhāvāṃ vibhāvya tato vyutthitaḥ kathayed dharmam / sarvopalepābhāvān nirupalepam / taṃ ca dīyamānam api(dhi)dharmam [78a] pariṇāmayej jagatām abhyudayanaiḥ śreyas āvāptilakṣaṇasyārthasya pradhānakāraṇatvena nidānabhūtāyāṃ bodhāv evaṃ dharmadānapariṇāmanāsamuttham yat puṇyaṃ tena saha yat sambhavet tac chubhaṃ trilokyāṃ na ba.vidyata iti yojyam // 5 //
adhimātramārgam āha-taś cai(ñ cāi)vetyādi / yathoktamārgabhāvanābalād yadā tat sarvapuṇyaṃ punaḥ pratibhāsate / kalpitarūpaviyogād uktam / evaṃ vikalpitadharmavihārāc chūnyakaṃ tathā dharmatāsvabhāvavaikalyāt tucchakam evam api satsaṃvṛtyā hetupratibaddhajanmatvād vaśikaṃ māyāmayatvād asārakaṃ ca pratibhāti / tad evaṃ caraś carati sugatānāṃ prajñāyām adhimātramārgasvabhāvāyām ato 'viparītatvād evaṃ caran puṇyaṃ parigṛhṇāti aprameyaṃ na tu tattvato bhāvanāmārgabalād vipakṣapratipakṣayor yayā(thā)kramam agamodayo(heyopādeyau) na yujyete // 6 //
tat kathaṃ jinaputrāṇāṃ tāvad iti ced āha-abhilāṣetyādi / prajñaptimātrasvabhāvatvād abhilāṣamātrān imān mṛdumadhyā[78b]dhimātraprakārān sarvadharmān svaparārthobhayasampattiṣv adhikṛtatvāt / pratyakṣānumānāgamapramānaṇiścitatvāt vā bhavatā yathāsaṃkhyaṃ deśitān prayuktān prakāśitāṃś ca yo bodhisattvo bhāvanāmārgābhyāsāc chrutādijñānodayena jānāti kalpānāṃ koṭī niyutāni bahūni bhāṣyamānān sa tathaikarasattvāt dharmadhātur jinatayor vipakṣāpagamāvān naiva kṣīyate / pratipakṣodayavaikalyān na ca vivardhate tattva iti sidhyasādhyato saṃvṛtyāt tu tau (tato) bhagavat iti bhāvaḥ // 7 //
bhāvanāmārgasvabhāvatvād eva paramitānām api tattvato hānivṛddhyābhāva ity āha-ye cāpītyādi/ api śabdān na kevalaṃ prajñāpāramitā kiṃ tarhi yāś cemā dānādyāḥ pāramitā jinānām etāḥ pañcāpi viśiṣṭadharmasvabhāvāḥ parikīrtitāḥ māyopamatvān nāmamātrāḥ saṃvṛtyanuṣṭhāyātu(nu)ttarabodhau pariṇāmayati / ātmotkarṣakaraṇān na ca manyate yo bodhisattvo naiva so 'dhigamebhyaḥ [79a] parihīyate 'ta eva spṛśaty uttamabuddhabodhiṃ viśiṣṭārthatvāvabhāsinaś cittotpādāt iti // 8 //
ratnaguṇasañcayagāthāvyākhyāyāṃ śūnyatāparivarto 'ṣṭādaśaḥ //

gaṅgadevābhaginīparivarta ekonaviṃśaḥ 
pūrvāparacittakṣaṇayor yathākramaṃ niranvayavināśodayena parasparasambaddhā(ndha)t saṃvṛtyāpi kathaṃ viśiṣṭārthāvabhāsicittotpādenārthakriyeti dṛṣṭāntapūrvakaṃ pariharann āha-tailasyetyādi / tailasya vartir jvalitā pradīpena prathame nipāte jvālāvantyo(rtyo)r mīlanakṣaṇe dvitīyakṣaṇam antareṇa samānakālasaṃhatotpatyaviśiṣṭatvāt / kāraṇabhāvalakṣaṇadāhyadāhakabhāvānupapattau naiva dagdhā paścimenāpi pradīpakṣaṇena prathamakṣaṇaṃ vinā paścimakṣaṇasyodayābhāvād asatā na sā vartir daghā / nāpy arciṣā paścimābhinipāte na sā vartir dagdhā prathamakṣaṇam antareṇa nityasattvādiprasaṃgatayā saṃvṛtyutpādābhāvāt kāryakāraṇābhāvalakṣaṇadāhyadāhakabhāvānupaparasatārc/ tciṣā paścimābhinipā[79b]te na paścimakṣaṇam antareṇa prathamakṣaṇasya dāhe sāmarthyābhāvāt / na prathamakṣaṇabhāvinā pradīpena dahyate dīpavartiḥ / evaṃ pratyekam asāmārthye pratītyasamutpādadharmatayā prathamasaṃhatotpannaṃ pradīpavartikṣaṇam apekṣya saṃvṛtyā hetuphalasambandhādāhitasāmārthyātiśaya eva viśiṣṭo dvitīyapradīpakṣaṇaḥ syāt / tadā nirhetukavināśe 'pi kāryakāraṇabhāvalakṣaṇadāhyadāhakabhāvasadbhāvāt prathamapaścimakṣaṇābhyāṃ vartir dagdhety arthād uktaṃ syād iti bhāvaḥ // 1 //
yathoktam arthaṃ prakṛtārthe niyojayann āha-prathamevetyādi / evaṃ prathamam eva cittaṃ buddhabodhyāvāhakasamastārthāpratibhāsanāt spṛśan naiveha pravacane 'grabodhim / tasya ca prathamacittasya bodhiṃ spṛśatā rūpeṇa sarvathā 'vidyamānatvād asatā na punaḥ śakyā dvitīyenaiva cittenādhigantuṃ bhavati viśiṣṭātiśayādhānābhāvāt na cittaṃ paścimam eva pūrvavat sarvopadravaśamanāc chivāṃ bodhim anu[80a]prāpnoti / tasya dvitīyacittasya bodhiṃ prāpnuvatā rūpeṇa sarvathāvidyamānatvāt / asatā na punaḥ prathamenaiva cittena prāptuṃ śakyā bhavati viśiṣṭātiśayādhānābhāvāt / ato vartidāhavat pūrvāparacittakṣaṇābhyāṃ bodhiḥ prāpyata ity uktaṃ bhavet // 2 //
pūrvāparacittakṣaṇayor bodhau sāmānyena kāraṇatvān nirdiśyedānīṃ prathamacittakṣaṇasyopādānakāraṇatvā(tva)m anvayavyatirekamukhena dṛṣṭāntapūrvakaṃ spaṣṭayann āha-bījetyādi / nityasya kramayaugapadyābhyām arthakriyāvirodhena kṣaṇitkato 'śvatthādibījādeḥ cottarottarakṣaṇapariṇāmena tanukārīṇi viṭapādīni samyagātmabhāvalābhāt samāgacchanti / tacc ca bījaṃ stambhād utpattikāle niruddhaṃ tasya ca prathamato 'satve naivāśvatthādivṛkṣaḥ syāt / evam eva cittaṃ prathamam eva pradhānakāraṇatvān nidānaṃ bodhiviṣaye tata evottarottarapariṇāmayogena buddhatvaṃ sampadyate / tac ca buddhatvotpattikāle niruddhaṃ ta[80b]sya ca prathamato 'satve naiva bodhiḥ syāt // 3 //
dvitīyasyāpi cittakṣaṇasya kāraṇatvaṃ spaṣṭayann āha-bījam ityādi / dvitīyādikṣaṇabhāvi yavaśālikāder bījaṃ pratītyasamutpādadharmatābalāt pratītyaiva tat tad yavaśālikādiphalaṃ bhavati / na ca tad bījaṃ phalotpattikāle 'sti / upalabdhilakṣaṇaprāptānupalambhān na cāpi sarvathā kṣaṇaprabandho nāstīti śakyate niścetuṃ tadanukāriṇaḥ phalasyotpatteḥ / evam eva prathamacittakṣaṇabalotpannaṃ dvitīyādicittakṣaṇaṃ pratītya bhavati / bodhir iyaṃ jinānāṃ tattvato hetuphalabhāvasya boddhum aśakyatvāt bhāvasvabhāvarahitā yathā māyā jagatīha bhavet // 4 //
vistareṇaivaṃ nirdiśyopasaṃharann āha-daketyādi / yathodakabindubhiḥ kumbhaḥ paripūryate stokaṃ stokaṃ prathamato dakanipātenānupūrvyā sa paścimena tadvaccittena prathamenānuttarabodheḥ phenānupūrvyā sa dvitīyādicittakṣaṇena prayogamārgā[81a]disvabhāvatvāc chuklaguṇena prāptaparipūrṇasambhāratvāt pūrṇā bhavanti buddhaḥ // 5 //
prasaṃgagataṃ vistareṇa pratipāda prakṛtabhāvanāmārgastha[ḥ] bodhisattvāvaivartikalakṣaṇaṃ vaktum āha-śūnyetyādi / yathā nāvika[pu]ruṣo 'tiśikṣatatvāt kuśalo gacchati / nirupadravatayā pārāparaṃ mūlagrahaṇopāyatvena gamanāgamanakaru(ra)ṇān nobhayānte sthito vinipātasthānatvān na ca tiṣṭhati / arṇave 'sminn evam utpādādigāmbhīryayogād āsthāvinivṛttaye kāryakāraṇasvabhāvavirahād yathākramaṃ śūnyānimittāpraṇihitān sarvadharmān avagacchan bodhisattvo na ca nivrṭiṃ dayādhīnatvāt spṛśati sabhayatvān na ca nimittacārīti gāthārtho yojyaḥ // 6 // 
avaivartikalakṣaṇakathanena śaikṣo bodhisattvasaṃgho 'bhihitas tadanusaṃkleśavyavadān vikalpaprahāṇena tadubhayasamatādhigamād aśaikṣo bhavati / pareṇa śikṣitavyābhāvāt / ato 'śaikṣasaṃghalakṣaṇaparidīpanāya saṃsāranirvāṇasamatārtham āha-eva[81b]m ityādi / anaroktā(anantaroktā)vaivartikalakṣaṇādhigamena saṃsāranirvāṇasamatābhāvanayā caran bodhisattvo vyavadānavikalpaprahāṇān naiva manyate 'hu vyākrṭao daśabalair bhagavadbhir adhigaccheyam bodhim iti / na ca trāso bodhinimittaṃ bhavet / saṃkleśavikalpaprahāṇād ato 'nutpannatvāt sarvadharmāṇāṃ neha māyopamatve 'sti kiñcidvastujātam ity evaṃ cara[n] carati sugatānāṃ prajñāyām // 7 //
tad ubhayasamatāvabodhe vibhāvitobhayasamato buddho bhavati svabuddhakṣetra ity anantaraṃ sattvabhājanalokabhedena dvividhabuddhakṣetraviśuddhiṃ nirdiśann āha-kāntāretyādi / pānīyakāntāraṃ durbhikṣakāntāraṃ savyādhilokam asyopalakṣaṇatvāt / anyad api sattvabhājanagataṃ vipratipattisthānaṃ dṛṣṭā(ṣṭvā) kathaṃ mayā dvividhaṃ buddhakṣetraṃ pariśodhayitavyam iti / etad vikalpābhāvād gaṅgadevābhaginīvan nāsti bhayaṃ bodhisattvānāṃ pratyutorddhvaṃ dvividhabuddhakṣetrapariśodhanārthaṃ san nāhaṃ kurvan sva(nto ')parāntakoṭiṃ yāvat [82a] sadābhiyuktā mātari tadupāyaparijñānāt prajānānāḥ santo 'ṇumātraṃ ca khedaṃ manasā notpādayantīti // 8 //
// ratnaguṇasañcayagāthāvyākhyāyāṃ gaṅgadevābhaginīparivarta ekonnaviṃśatitamaḥ //

upāyakauśalyamīmāṃsāparivarto viṃśaḥ
niṣpāditabuddhakṣetraviśuddhinopāyakauśalenāsaṃsāraṃ  yathābhavyatayā buddhakṛtyaṃ svabuddhakṣetre kāryam ity upāyakauśalaṃ vaktavyam / tatrāsya viṣayaṃ tāvat kathayann āha-pūre(pune)tyādi / punar bodhisattvaś caran jinānāṃ prajñāyām anutpādena hetunā skandhān imān rūpādīṃ(dīn) bhāvanābalāj jānāti / ādiśūnyān na cādhigacchatīti matir ato māyopamaśūnyatādir upāyakauśalaviṣaya ity ākhyānaṃ syāt / kathaṃ punar abhyāse 'pi nādhigacchatīty asya parihāreṇopāyakauśalaṃ prayogaṃ nirdiśann āha-su(a)sametyādi / yathoktadharmatattvaṃ bhāvaṃ napi (vayann api) jagadarthakaraṇedaṃ tu (karaṇodita?)samādhanajñānatayā susamahitakaruṇayā duḥkhāpanayakāmatvena prekṣate sattvadhātūn evaṃ kṛpā[82b]prajñayor madhye 'vasthānād antare sthitaḥ sākṣātkaraṇakālākālaprayogasāmarthyān na parihīyate / buddhadharmebhyo 'ṣṭādaśā vai(ve)ṇikādibhya iti prayogaḥ kathito bhavet // 1 //
tatra tāvad antarāyikadharmmasamatikramaṇā(ṇo)pāyaṃ dṛṣṭāntapūrvakaṃ katha[ya]nn aha-puruṣo yathetyādi / yathā kaścit puruṣo lokavyavahāre dakṣatvāt kuśalasau(śau)ryādiguṇālaṅkṛtatve sarvaguṇair upetaḥ / kāyikyā balasampadopetatayā balavān / parair anabhibhūyamānatvena durddharṣayaḥ (durdharṣaḥ) / sarvatralakṣaṇaparija(ca)yāt kṛtayogyaḥ / parāvarjanopāye kāyādivikāre kṛtābhyāsatvāt kalāvidhijñāḥ  dhanuṣi suśi[kṣi]tatvādiṣv astrapāramigatam / citrakarmādiṣv anuṣṭhitavidhānatvāt pṛṭhuśilpayukto duṣṭajanaṃ ca naikaniṣṭhatvena māyādividhijñaparamaḥ / sādhujanaparipālanaparatvāj jagadarthakāmaḥ / evaṃ vidho[ ']pi kena[ci]d amitrādyupanipātena mātarapitaraṃ gṛhītvā svakaṃ putradārādikaṃ ca sabhayatvena kāntare mārge [83a] pratipadyāmitrabahulyād bahumitre sa eva māyāvidhijñatayā 'bhinirmāya puruṣān bahūn jīvitanirapekṣatayā śūrān parābhibhavanaśīlatayā vīrān sarvāntarāyātikrameṇāṭavīto niṣkrāntatvāt kṣemeṇa gatvā nijasthānatvāt punar gṛham upāgacchati / evam eva yasmin samaye vidvān bodhisattvo yadānālambanamaitrīsaṃmukhībhāvalābhān mahatīṃ maitrīṃ sukhasaṃyogecchācittasantatiṃ sarvan nā(trā?) māsu(mu)khīkaraṇād upabandhayet sambandhayet sattvadhātau tadā devaputrādimārāṃś caturo 'tikramya śrāvakapratyekabuddhabhūmidvayaṃ ca buddhavāhakatvād agre samādhau sthito na cādhigacchati bodhim asamāptakṛtyatvāt // 2-4 //
pratiṣṭhitavihāropāyaṃ dṛṣṭāntapūrvakaṃ kathayann āha-ākāśeṣvityādi / yathā lokābhinirvṛttikrameṇā[kā]śāṃ (śaṃ) niśritaḥ samāruto jalaskandhaḥ taṃ ca niḥśriteyaṃ suvarṇamayī mahāpṛthivī / taṃ cāśritaś cāturdvīpako lokadhātuḥ / ataḥ sattvānām upabhogasaṃvartanī[83b]yam evātra karmapradhānaṃ kāraṇaṃ draṣṭavyam / anyathā sarvopākhyāvirahalakṣaṇam ākāśam asthānaṃ sat vāyumaṇḍādeḥ stānaṃ kuto bhaved api tu naiva / atha ca tat stānaṃ pravacane 'ti pratītam ity ato yathoktahetuphalaṃ (balāt) niścayotpādanena manasikaraṇāc cittayatai(ccintayed e)nam artham ākāśasya dhātvantaram eva śūnyatāyām apratiṣṭhānayogena pratiṣṭhito bodhisattvo jagaty anekavyāpārakaraṇāt kriyāṃ vividhāṃ darśayati / nirmāṇameghene(nai)kaikaprakārasyānantyād vicitta(nta)na sattvānāṃ yathābhavyatājñānaṃ svapraṇidhijñānaṃ ca taddhetumātratvāt tadadhiṣṭhānamātrāṃ yathoktopāyasāmarthyān na ca nirvṛtim adhigacchati vastulakṣaṇasamatikramāc chūnyatāsthānaṃ na bhavati / atha ca tatra sthita iti bhāvaḥ // 5-6 // 
pūrvapraṇidhānānuvṛtyupāyaṃ nirdiśann āha-yasmiṃś cetyādi / yasminn eva kāle vipaścit paṇḍito bodhisattvo bhāvayed imāṃ sarvadharmānupalambhān (mbhāṃ) pravaraśūnyatāṃ tad eva śūraṅgamādisamādhīn akhilavikṣepo[48a] paśamanāc chāntāś ca(ntāṃ ca) bhāvayet / evaṃ samādhiśūnyatābhāvanayor madhye sthitena bodhisattvena śūnyatābalān na ca nimittaṃ prabhāvayitavyaṃ syāt / na cāsāv animittaṃ samādhibalāt sthito bhaved ato yathoktopāyasāmarthyād yāvadicchayobhayatra pātābhāvāt / yathākramaṃ nirvāṇāvāhakagrahaṇamanāc chā(nāḥ śā)nto nimitte saṃsārābhiniveśonmūlanāc ca praśānte vā nimitte vānimittacārī syāt // 7 //
asādhāraṇopāyaṃ vaktum āha-pakṣisyetyādi / yathāntarīkṣe pakṣiṇau(ṇo) gacchataḥ padaṃ pratibimbasvarūpaṃ pratiṣṭhānavirahāt nāsti nīrūpatvāt na ca tatrākāśe sthita,h pakṣadvayasāmarthyān na ca pated bhūmau / tathā bodhisattvaś caran śūnyatāvimokṣamukhadvāraiḥ sattvārthakaraṇāya dattacittatvān na ca nirvṛtiṃ spṛśati / upalambhasya prahātavyatvāt na ca nimittacārī syād iti bodhisattvānāṃ śrāvakādibhir asādhāraṇo 'yam upāyaḥ kathitau(to) bhavet // 8 //
aśa(āsa)ktyupāyaṃ dṛṣṭāntapūrvakaṃ kathaya[84b]trāha-iṣvastretyādi / dhanuṣi suśikṣito yathā kaścit puruṣaḥ samyag ūrddhvaṃ kāṇḍaṃ kṣiptvānyeṣāṃ punaḥ kāṇḍānāṃ paraspa(mpa)rayā patanāya tasya pūrvakasya kāṇḍasya na dadyād avasthānam āṅkakṣataḥ puruṣasya patet kāṇḍam / evam eva prajñāyā(yāṃ) varapāramitāyāṃ mahopāyakauśalasvabhāvāyāṃ caranto jinatanayāḥ prajñākaruṇādīn bhāvanayā vicārayantas tāvan na tāmaśa(sa)ktyupāyabalāt paramaśūnyatāṃ prāpnuvanti / yāvan na te kuśalamūlair bhavanti pūrṇāḥ // 9-10 // 
śūnyatopāyaṃ pūrvavad vaktum āha-bhikṣuya(r ya)thetyādi / bhinnakleśatvād bhikṣur yathā viśeṣamārgabalāt paramarddhibalenopetaḥ sannākāśe sthito vaineyajanārthaṃ yugapadāścaryadvayakaraṇād yamakaṃ karoti prātihāryam / yad uta sthānaṃ caṃkramanaṃ(ṇaṃ) ca śayyāṃ niṣadyāṃ ca nidarśayet svabhyastān na nivartate / vibhāvitaśūnyatāvimokṣamukhatvān nāpi ca khidyate / yāvat tatra tiṣṭhatīti śeṣaḥ [85a] // 11 //
evam eva śūnyatāyāṃ sthito vidvān bodhisattvo jñānātiśayalābhāj jñānarddhipāramigataḥ pratiniyatasthānāvagrahavirahād aniketacārī anekaprakāravyāpāra[kara]ṇād vividhā(dhāṃ) kriyāṃ jagati karuṇayā nirmāṇameghena darśayati / ekaikaprakāraprācuryād anantām / svabhyastanirmāṇatvān na nivartate śūnyatopāyabalān nāpi ca khidyate kalpakoṭīḥ // 12 //
animittopāyaṃ tathaivāvedayann āha-puruṣo yathetyādi / yathā kaścit puruṣo mahatyataṭaprapāte sthitvā hastadvayena cchatradvayam ādāyogpekṣate 'nucitakālatvād akālikaṃ vāyuṃ tataś cātmānam avasṛjya mahāprapāte na ca viṣamapāte na duḥkhotpādanāt prapātayati yāti yāvan na tatrābhimate sthāne / evam eva sthitvā karuṇāyāṃ vidvān bodhisattvaḥ prajñopāyacchatradvayaparigṛhītaḥ śūnyānimittāpraṇidhivimokṣāṃ niścayapratyayena vimarśanād vimṛśati dharmān na cānimittopāyabalān nirvṛtiṃ spṛ[85b]śati darśayati ca // 13-14 //
deśanayā parebhyaś ca tathaiva dharmān apraṇihitopāyaṃ dṛṣṭāntapūrvakam āvedayann āha-ratanetyādi / ratnārthiko yathā vrajitvā naro vaiḍūryādiratnākaratvād ratnadvīpaṃ yady api tatra sukhaṃ jīvati sārthavāhas tathāpi labhamāno ratnaṃ punar gṛham āgacchet / yat snehānubaddhād dāridryādinā duḥkhito manasi bhavaty āmukhīkaraṇāj jātisaṃgha iti vyastasambandho vidheyaḥ / evam eva śūnyatāṃ vrajitatvā (vrajitvā) naro guṇaratnākaratvād ratnam advīpalabhamāno dhyānabalendriyādīni bodhisattvo yady api nirvṛtiṃ spṛśed abhinandaṃ(ndan) tathāpi pūrvapraṇidhānabalāj jātyādiduḥkhitāḥ sarvasattvā manasi bhavanti āmukhīkaraṇād ato 'praṇihitopāyabalān naiva nirvṛtiṃ sākṣāt kuryād iti bhāvaḥ // 15-16 //
tathaivāvaivartikaliṅgopāyaṃ vaktum āha-abhyantare vetyādi / abhyantare grāmanigamanagarādāv abhimataprayojanāya vaṇigjano yathā gacchet krayavikrayamūlyaparijñānārtham / ato nai[86a]va tatra nagarādau na ja(ca) buddhyā tiṣṭhati nāpi ratnadvīpe 'pi tu sa eva caurādibhyo 'pasaraṇopāyaparijñānāt mārgakuśalo 'dhikathanopārjanakāritvād vijñaḥ / punar gṛhe svīkṛtasattvā[nu]kampayāvagamanād bhavati / tathā kṛpāprajñāyogāj jñānī vidvān bodhisattvaḥ śrāvakāṇāṃ sa pratyekabuddhānāṃ vimuktau sarvatra tadvineyasattvārthaṃ prati abhyāsakuśalo bhavati / sattvārthāparityāgān na cāpi tatra sākṣāt karaṇe na tiṣṭhati / kṛtakṛtyatvābhāvāt tathaiva na tāthāgate jñāne viditasaṃskṛtadoṣatvān na ca saṃskṛte tiṣṭhati / ato eva sarvatragamārge yathākramaṃ guṇadoṣaparijñānād vidvān vidhijño bhavatīty avaivartikānām asādhāraṇo dharmo gaditaḥ syāt // 17-18 //
apramāṇopāyārtham āha-yaṃ kālītyādi / yasmin kāle sukhasaṃyogecchākārāṃ maitrīṃ jagaty anubandhayitvā / śūnyatānimittāpraṇihitān samādhīṃ(dhīn) bhāvayati / tadāpramāṇasattvaśūnyatādyālambanabalād yathākramam asambhavo 'tra ya[86b]dy asau nirvṛtiṃ prāpnuyāt jinatanayo 'tha vāpi saṃskṛte dhātau saprajñapayituṃ śakyata iti gāthārthaḥ // 19 //
amum evārthaṃ spaṣṭayann āha-yathetyādi / yathā nirmitaḥ puruṣo mantrādyupaplutalocanānāṃ darśanapathaprāptatvān naivādṛ[śya]kāyoo nyāyato vicāraśūnyatvāt idan tayā nāmnā punaḥ saprajñapayituṃ śakyo no veti samba[ndha]nīyam / tathā bodhisattvaḥ sattvālambanapūrvakaṃ caran śūnyatādivimokṣamukhadvāre saṃskṛte asaṃskṛte vā dhātau nāmnā punaḥ saprajñapayituṃ śakyo no veti pūrveṇa sambandhaḥ / tad eva(vaṃ) pūrvapūrvopāyasya uttarottaram upāyaṃ kāraṇatvena nirdiśya prādhānyācchatasāhasrikāvatprabhedenā(no?)pātte(tto?) daśaprakāropāyo sarvopāyānām antargamāt // 20 //
na punaḥ kāraṇaṃ vācyam ity upasaṃharann āha-abhi(yadi)pṛcchetyādi / abhi(yadi) pṛcchayamāno yo bodhisattvo jinaputrāṇām anuṣṭhitacaryatvāt caritānām indriyāṇāṃ gambhīradharmāṇāṃ ca vistaranirdeśāt paridīpanaṃ yathoktopāyā(yo)pari[87a]jñānātra karoti / śūnyatānimittāpraṇihitavimokṣāt / avaivartikabhūmidharmmāṃś ca sarvasattvāparityāgacittotpādīn(tpādādinā?) saṃkṣepakathanān na ca sūcayati sa na vyākṛto veditavya ity uktaḥ sarvākārābhisambodhaḥ / tathā coktam-
ākārāḥ saprayogāś ca guṇā doṣāḥ salakṣaṇāḥ /
mokṣanirvedhabhāgīye śaikṣāvaivartiko gaṇaḥ //
samatā bhavaśāntyoś ca kṣetraśuddhir anuttarā /
sarvākārābhisambodha eṣa sopāyakauśala[ḥ] // iti // 21 //
prāptasarvākārābhisambodhasyedānīṃ prakarṣaparyanto mūrddhābhisamaya iti liṅgaṃ tāvad asya kathayann āha-arhantetyādi / arhadbhūmiṃ pratyekabuddhabhūmiṃ traidhātukaṃ ca yo na spṛhayati / sa(a)tyābhyāsāt svapnāntare 'pi buddhāṃś ca paśyati kathayati ca jagato dharmam evaṃ mūrddhābhisamayād avaivartika ity ayaṃ vyākrṭo veditavyaḥ / tathā tryapāyaprāptān sattvān svapnadarśanāt svapne viditvā praṇidadhāti / tatkṣaṇam apāyānucchoṣayeyam iti / tathā satyādhiṣṭhānena svapnāvā[87b]vasthāyām api praśamayati ca nagarādāv agniskandham evaṃ tathaivā[vai]vartika ity ayaṃ vyākṛto veditavyaḥ / tathā bhūtagrahād vividhavyārdhīś ca manya[nu]ṣyaloke satyādhiṣṭhānena praśamayati / jagadanugrahabuddhyā hitānukampī na ca tena bhūtagrahāpagamādin ātmotkarṣakaraṇāt mananā(māna)m utpādayati / nāpi parapaṃsanātmā nāmevaṃ (?) pūrvavad avaivartika ity ayam api vyākṛto veditavya iti // 22-24 //
ratnaguṇasañcayagāthāvyākhyāyām upākauśalyamimāṃsāparivarto viṃśatitamaḥ //

mārakarmaparivarta ekaviṃśaḥ 
mārādhiṣṭhānenāpakramaṇān nedaṃ liṅgam ity āha-athetyādi atha vāsya bodhisattvasya mānaḥ samupajāyate vyākṛto 'smi yataḥ satyādhiṣṭhānāni vividhān(ni) me samṛddhyanta iti / evaṃ yady anyaṃ vyākṛtakaṃ bodhisattvaṃ tiraskaraṇād avamanyate bodhisattvas tadā jñātavyo māne sthito 'yaṃ mārādhiṣṭhitatayā tanmātreṇonnatikaraṇād alpabuddhihī(hīṃ)nacitta iti yāvat // 1 //
prasaṃgāt mārakarmaprabhedaṃ nirdiśannāmamukhe[88a]na mārakarmārtham āha-nāmetyādi / mātrādikṛtanāmavyapadeśān nāmādhiṣṭhānena punar māraḥ samupāgamye(myai)vaṃ vadiṣyati / idaṃ tava nāmadheyaṃ mātāpitror vā tatparayā yāvadā saptamaḥ pudgalaḥ samupaiti vaṃśaṃ tasyedaṃ nāmadheyam iti vadiṣyati / evaṃ yadā buddho bhaviṣyasi tvaṃ tad āpīdaṃ yad eva tena manasā cintitaṃ nāmadheyaṃ tad eva bhaviṣyatīti vadiṣyati / tac chrutvā yo 'bhimānam utpādayati sa jñātavyaḥ paryutthitamāro 'yam alpabuddhir (ri)ti vakṣyamāne(ṇe)na sambandhaḥ // 2 //
dhūtaguṇadvāreṇa mārakarmārtham āha-dhūtetyādi / dhūtaguṇena yādṛśena paiṇḍapātikatvādinā sa bhaviṣyati yukto yogī pūrvam api tavāmī[dṛśāḥ] syur evaṃrūpā guṇā iti vadiṣyati / yaś caivaṃ śrutvābhimānam utpādayati bodhisattvaḥ sa jñātavyā(vyo) māropasthānāt paryutthitamāro 'yam alpabuddhir vihīnāśaya iti yāvat // 3 //
vivekavāsamukhenāpi mārakarmārtham āha-praviviktetyādi / ucchinnajanapadatvāt praviviktā[88b]ni grāmana[ga]rāṇi / śra(sra)vadudakādinopetatvāt girikandarāṇi / grāmaṃ parityajya krośamātre 'vasthānādaraṇyāni / vyāghrādirahitatvāt viviktād vanaviśeṣatvād vanaprasthān niṣevamāṇo yady ātma(tmā)nam utkarṣayati guṇādyabhimānāt parāṃś ca paṃsayati(?) vairūpyaniścāraṇāt / tadā bodhisattvo jñātavyo 'yaṃ paryutthitamāro 'lpabuddhir abhadrāśaya iti yāvat // 4 //
kathaṃ tarhi vivekavāsa ity āha-grāme vetyādi / vaidehādau grāme campādiviṣaye rāṣṭe pāṭaliputrādau ca nigame viharanto nityam arhatve pratyekabuddhatve ca spṛhāṃ na janayanti tatra / anyatra śrāvakādivineyasattvaparipācanād anuttarabodhau ca samyagāśayen pravṛttatvād bodhiyuktā viharanti / eṣo 'nantaroktaḥ / sarvākuśalebhyao vivecanād vivekaḥ / kathitasambandhidharmadhātunirjātatvena sugatātmajānām // 5 //
anyas tu viveka eva na bhavatīty āha-yo pañcetyādi / yaḥ pañcayojanaśatikeṣu girikandareṣu vyāḍaiḥ krūra[89a]sattvairahibhiś cākīrṇasthāne nivased bahuvarṣakoṭī[ḥ] ni(na) ca vivekam imam anantaroditaṃ jānāti bodhisattvaḥ śrāvakādimanaskāropetatvāt saṃkīrṇaḥ sa vihared aprāptāyāṃ bodhisattvā(ttvatā)yāṃ bodhisattvatābhimānād abhimānaprāptaḥ // 6 //
sa eva ca mānaviṣayād anatikrānta ity āha-so cetyādi / sa bodhisattvo yadi jagad artham abhimuhyena prayuktāṃ(ktān) bodhisattvān kṣāntyagradharmasvabhāvaśraddhādīni balāni ca samāpattirūpāṇi catvāri dhyānāni / ūṣmamūrddhasvabhāvaśraddhādīnīndriyāṇi śūraṃgamādīn śūnyatādivimokṣāṃś ca prāptān avamanyate / na me 'raṇyavivekacāriṇo bodhisattvā iti tiraskaroty ayaṃ māragocare sthita iti jinenoktaḥ // 7 //
vistareṇa nirdiśye(śyai)vam upasaṃharann āha-grāmāntī(nte)tyādi / grāmānte yo vihared atha vā araṇye sarvathā śrāvakatvādy abhilāṣavigamena dvayamā(yā)nacittavigato 'nuttarabodhāv ekāntaniyatatvān niyatāgrabodhiḥ sa bodhi[89b]sattvo 'nyān vivekān śrāvakādisambandhinaḥ parīttaguṇāvāhakatvāt tulayati / ata eva kṣayakaranāt kṣiṇoti / yasmād eṣo 'nantarodito viveko jagadarthābhi(rtham abhi)prasthitānāṃ jinatanayānām iti // 8 // 
ratnaguṇasañcayagāthāvyākhyāyāṃ mārakarmaparivarta ekaviṃśatitamaḥ //

kalyāṇāmitraparivarto dvāviṃśaḥ
yasya aparijñānād evaṃ doṣo 'tas tatpratipakṣo niṣevitavya ity āha-tasmetyādi / yato 'bhimānād anantarokto doṣas ta[smā]smātmānaṃ nihaty eva saṃsārapātopāyapariharaṇāt paṇḍitena abhisampratyayabahulatvād āśayaguruṇā varabodhiṃ gaveṣamāne(ṇe)na vaidya ivātureṇa rāgādisvarogacikitsanārthaṃ kalyāṇamitrāṇi paryupāsanād bhaktavyāni anālasyena // 1 //
kāni punaḥ kalyāṇamitrāṇīty āha-buddhaś cetyādi / buddhā bhagavanto varabodhau prasthitā bodhisattvāś ca kalyāṇamitram imāṃś ca ṣaṭpāramitāḥ pradiṣṭa[ḥ] / yatas te buddhadayo hitāhitaṃ prāptiparihāreṇānuśāsa[90a]kāḥ dānādyā ceyaṃ pāramitānuṣṭhīyamānatvāt pratipattibhūmiḥ / evaṃ kāraṇadvayenānubuddhyate buddhabodhiṃ tasmān nārthāntaraṃ kalyāṇamitram iti bhāvaḥ // 2 //
nanu sarvabuddhabodhisattvānāṃ pāramitaiva pratipattibhūmir na bhavati / tat katham eva yuktam ity āśaṃkyāha-atikrāntetyādi / atītatvenātikrāntaḥ bhaviṣyatkālatvenāgatāḥ vartamānatvena sthitā ye buddhā bhagavanto daśasu dikṣu sarveṣām eva teṣāṃ buddhatvaprāptaye mārgo 'yaṃ pāramitālakṣaṇo 'dvitīyatvād ananyo 'nyathā viparyāsaprahāṇābhāvāt / yataḥ kleśāvaraṇatamopanayanād avabhāso jñeyāvaraṇāndhakārāpanayanād ulkā / tathā ca varabodhaye prasthitāṃ(tānāṃ) bodhisattvānāṃ darśanamārgālokakaraṇād ālokasvabhāvā / bhāvanāmārgo tyāgotpādena cānuśāsanāc chāstṛbhūtāḥ / samyag imāḥ pāramitā nirdiṣṭās tasmād iyam eva pratipattibhūmir ity abhiprāyaḥ // 3 //
prasaṅgā[dā]gataṃ nirvartya idānīṃ prakṛta eva yathokte liṅge '[90b]bhiniveśo na vidheya ity āha-yatha prajñetyādi / yathā prajñāpāramitāṃ māyāvadekānekasvabha avavaidhūryādilakṣaṇena śūnyāṃ tathā rūpaṇādilakṣaṇān imāṃ prajānāti sarvadharmān śūnyān / ataḥ śūnyatālakṣaṇāt(n) prajāna(nā)naḥ sarvadharmān yadi yathokter li(kte li)ṅge carati tad evaṃ caraṃś carati sugatānāṃ prajñāyām (prajñām) // 4 //
yathoktaliṅgisvarūpāṇāṃ sarvadharmāṇāṃ śūnyatve kathaṃ saṃkleśavyavadānavyavastheti ced āha-āhāretyādi / ātmātmīyābhiniveśena kavaḍī(lī)kārādipramukhān āhārān kāmāṃś ca rūpādīn parikalpayamānāḥ sattvāḥ saṃsāre 'rjanarkṣaṇanāśaviṣādaduḥkhena khinnamanaso viparyastamatitayā janmagrahaṇāt sadā saṃsaranti / tattvataḥ punar ahaṃ madīyo dharma iti dvāv etāv anutpannatvād anubhūtatvena "Sūnyau tasmād ākāśe svaviparyāsabalād granthir i(r a)yam ātmano baddho janair avyavahārakuśalatvāt bālair iva durmocya iti yāvat / ataḥ saṃ[91a]kleśavyavastheti bhāvaḥ // 5 //
katham iva svaviparyāsabalāt saṃkleśavyavastheti ced āha-yathetyādi / yathāviṣe viṣaviparyāsaśaṃkayā viṣaṃ saṃja(jā)nānaṃ viṣam eṣam evābhyupeti naraṃ vyāpnoti na cāsyāvidyamānatvād udaragataṃ viṣam upapadyate / tathānutpannāryamārgatvād bālena viparyāsabalāt svīkṛto 'haṃ madīyo 'yaṃ dharma ity ātmā-
ātmani sati parasaṃjñā svaparavibhāgāt parigrahadveṣau /
anayoḥ saṃpratibaddhāḥ sarve doṣāḥ prajāyante //
ityātmasaṃjñāyā jāyate ca sa(ta)daiva samāropitadharmavivekena śūnyatvād abhūto bāla iti sāmarthyād yathoktavaiparītyena vyavadānavyavastheti bhāvaḥ // 6 //
satyadvayasamāśrayeṇobhayavyavasthām upasaṃharann āha-yathetyadi / yathodgraho 'bhiniveśaḥ saṃvṛtyā tathā prakāśitaḥ saṃkleśo vyavadānaṃ tu tathoktam abhiniveśenāhaṃ madīyo dharma iti yathā nopalabdhis tattvataḥ punar na hy atra māyopamatve viparyāsābhāvāt kaścit saṃkliśyate [91b] śuddhyate vā bandhāpanayanābhāvād iti / prajñāpāramitayā buddhyate bodhisattvo dharmatattvam iti śeṣaḥ // 7 //
liṅgenaivaṃ lakṣitasya mūrddhābhisamayasya vivṛddhir vaktavyety āha-yāvantetyādi / sattvā nikhile tiṣṭhantīha jambūdvīpe te sarve varabodhau cittam utpādya dānaṃ dattvā buddhabodhisattvādibhyo bahuvarṣasahasrakoṭīḥ sarve ca te punar api pariṇāmayanti jagatsamabhilaṣitārthanidānabhūtāyāṃ bodhau / yaś caive(vai)ko 'nyaḥ pudgalo mūrddhābhisamayā sva(yasva)bhāvayā prajñayā varapāramitayābhiyukto divasam apy ekam antaśaḥ samyag anuvartata itīha prajñāpāramitābhiyoge sarvaprakāravivṛddhyā yuktatvād anantarapudgalapuṇyam apekṣya kalāmātrapuṇyahetuḥ pūrvoktasattvānāṃ sa dānaskandho na bhavatīty atandritena sadānusartavyā prajñāpāramitābhāvanayeti śeṣaḥ // 8-9 //
na kevalam iyaṃ mātābhyasanīyāpitu kṛpāpi vibhāvanīyetyāha-carametyādi / caran yadā prajñāyāṃ vara[92a]pāramitāyāṃ yathoktasvabhāvāyāṃ dattasamādhānatayā jinaputro yogī mahatīm utpādayati karuṇāṃ na ca bhāvābhiniveśena sattvasaṃjñāṃ tadā bhavaty asau sarvasmin jagati prekṣāpūrvakāritayā vidvān / puṇyakṣetratvād dakṣiṇīyau(yo) 'taḥ sarvakālam avaśyaṃ bhāvi phaladānasāmarthyāpekṣatvād amoghaṃ paribhuṃkte viṣayān piṇḍapātam // 10 //
ataś ca sattvārthapratikṛpāprajñayor abhiyogo vidheya ity āha-ciretyādi / svaviṣayā(viparyā)sabalād dīrghakālaṃ baddhān devān manujān apāyeṣu triṣu nārakādisattvāṃś ca parimoktuṃ yaḥ samyag ihecchati bodhisattvo vipulaṃ ca mahāyānamārgaṃ saṃsārasāgaratīram upadarśayitum / sattvadhātāv icchatīti pūrveṇa saṃ[ba]ndhaḥ sa prajñāpāramitāyāṃ kṛpāsahitāyāṃ yukto divase rātrau ca syāt // 11 //
amum evārthaṃ dṛṣṭāntapūrvakaṃ spaṣṭayann āha-puruṣo yetyādi / yathā kaścit puruṣo viśiṣṭatvād agraratnam pūrvasattvo 'parasminkāle punar labhvā nuṣṭho(tuṣṭo) bhavet / labdhā(bdhvā) ca tuṣṭyā[92b]nantaraṃ nāśayet / punar api vikṣepādisamudācārāt prasā(mā)daprāptaḥ / tasmād avinākhyā(śyā)bhimatavastuno viyogena duḥkhī satataṃ manasikaraṇād ratnābhikāṃkṣī bhavet / evam eva varabodhau prasthitena durlabhatvād ratnatulyāyāṃ kṛpāsahitāyāṃ prajñāpāramitāyāṃ manasikāro na parityaktavyaḥ / ato ratnam iva vastrādinā badhvā(ddhvā)vinaṣṭaratnatvāt pratibhinnasattvo gṛhṇan prajñāpāramitāṃ yadā dīrghakālābhyāsenānubandhayed bodhisattvas tadā śīghram eva samyaṅmārgapravṛttatvāt nirvāṇam adhigacched iti // 12-13 //
ratnaguṇasañcayagāthāvyākhyāyāṃ kalyāṇamitraparivarto dvāviṃśatitamaḥ //

śakraparivartas trayoviṃśaḥ
kṛpāprajñayor eva vivṛddhyā sāmānyena phalam abhidhāya viśeṣeṇa vipakṣābhibhavanaṃ dṛṣṭāntapūrvakam āvedayann āha-udayetyādi / yathodayam āsādayati sūryo vigatābhro marīcimālābhir vidhūya sarvatamasāṃ samūham andhakāram abhibhavati ca sarvān svaprabhayā kṣudrakhadyotakādiprāṇibhūtān sarvāṃś ca [93a] śukrabṛhaspatipramukhāṃs tārakāgaṇāṃś candrasyāpi prabhān(m) / tathā prajñāyāṃ yathoktārthasvabhāvāyāṃ varapāramitāyāṃ caran vidhūya satkāyādidṛṣṭigaṇasa(ṇaṃ sa)rvān arthodayahetutvāt gahanam / vidvān bodhisattvo 'bhibhavati sarvān jagaty arhataḥ pratyekabuddhāṃś ca yathoktakṛpāprajñayor evātyantābhivṛddhyai śūnyānimittacaritaḥ prahāṇamahattayā mahāṃś ca bodhisattvo bhaved iti bhāvaḥ // 1-2 //
vipakṣābhibhavanti(vanaṃ) nirdiśyedānīṃ tathaiva pratipakṣādhigamaṃ vaktum āha-yathetyādi / yathā rājaputro bhṛtyeṣu saṃvibhāgaśīlatvād dhanadāyako nītimārgānusāreṇārthopārjanakuśalatvād arthakāmaḥ / sarveṣām eva rājaputrāṇāṃ mukhyātiśayaenopādeyatvāc chreṣṭho bhavet / sarvalokena ca sevyamānatvād abhigamanīyaḥ / yato 'yam eṣo 'dhunā ci(vi)ttahīnāvasthāyām apy āśritasattvān satkārādinā pramodayati / ato nitarām eva rājye sthito 'bhiṣekaprāptatvāt pa[93b]ṭadhāraḥ sa na bhaviṣyati sattvānāṃ pramodaka iti bhāvaḥ / tathā prajñāyāṃ kṛpāsahitāyāṃ carito vidvān bodhisattvaḥ pratipakṣādhigamaba[la]ad dharmdeśanayāparihāṇi(ṇa) dharmaka[thana]tvād amṛtasya darśanamārgāder dāyakasamprayogo bhavet devam(mā)nuṣāṇām / yato 'yam eṣo 'dhunā svalpādhigamāvasthāyām api sattvasukhābhiyukto darśanamārgādiprakāśanāt / ato nitarām eva yāvat sthito bhaviṣyati savāsanasarvāvaraṇaprahāṇād dharmarājye tadā sattvasukhābhiyukta iti pūrveṇa sambandha iti // 3-4 //
ratnaguṇasañcayagāthāvyākhyāyāṃ śakraparivartas trayoviṃśatimaḥ //

abhimānaparivartaś caturviṃśaḥ 
evam atyantapratipakṣābhivṛddhau svagocarātikrameṇa autsukyaprāpto māra ity āha-māro[ ']pītyādi / yadā pratipakṣodayas tasmin samaye māro bhavati mṛdumadhyādhimātravaimanasya prāptatvāt saśalyaḥ / śokārtto duḥkhitaś cāta evāprītamanas ko 'lpabalaś ca syāt / diśi[vi]diśi[94a] dahārtham ulkāṃ ca kṣipati na(bha)yadarśanārthaṃ kathaṃ tu nāmaiṣa pratipakṣabhāvanāyāṃ dīnamanā bhavantu (tu) bodhisattvas tathāpi na śakto 'ntarāyakaraṇa iti // 1 //
kān pratyaśakta ity āha-yadetyādi / yadā te bhavanti vidvāṃso dayāsampattyā samyagāśayena saṃprayuktā divase rātrau ca bhāvanābalād varaprajñāpāramitārthadarśinas tadā kṛpāprajñayor abhyāsāt kāyena manasāsyopalakṣaṇatvād vacasā cākāśagamanacāriṇā pakṣiṇā kvaci ekāntenāpratiṣṭhānāt samānatvena tulyabhūtāḥ / teṣvavatāraṃ kutaḥ prāpsyati kṛṣṇakarmāsahāyatvāt kṛṣṇabandhur api tu samyakpravṛttatvān naiveti bhāvaḥ // 2 //
asamyaṅmārgapravṛttānāṃ tu prabhavatīty āha-kalahetyādi / svasthāne vāksamārambhārambhāt kalaham rājakulādau vivadanād vivādam upagatā yadā bodhisattvā bhavanti / parasparavidveṣo(ṣā)dyupanipātād viruddhakāḥ / krodhotpādena ruṣṭacittāś caranti / tadāvatāralābhātmā(n mā)ras tuṣṭo bhaved ata eva sukhotpādā(do) [94b] param udaya(gra)ḥ / tataś ca dvāv etau kalahādikāriṇau va(ta)dadhiṣṭhānād dūre bhaviṣyato bhagavato jñānāt tathā dvāv etau hitāhitaprāptiparihāropāyavirahād dūre bhaviṣyato buddhadharmebhyaḥ piśācatulyo(lyā)vataś ca dvāv etau niṣiddhakalahādyāvaraṇād ātmanaḥ kariṣyataḥ pratijñāhānim / yadā ca dveṣabāhulyād duṣṭānāṃ parāpakārādyamarṣaṇāt kṣāntirahitānāṃ naiva bodhir bhavet / tadā māraḥ parivārabāhulyāt tuṣṭo bhavet mārasenā cādharme kalahādāv iti bhāvaḥ // 3-4 //
kathaṃ tarhi bodhiprāptir iti ced āha-yo bodhītyādi / yo bodhisattvā(ttvo) vyākṛto 'vyākṛtasyāsyopalakṣaṇatvād avyākṛtasya cāntike dveṣādisamudācārāc cittaṃ pradūśya(ṣya) vivādamārabhate na ca deśanādikaṃ karotīti bhāvaḥ / tena yāvantaś cittakṣaṇāḥ kuśalasyopaghātena khilabhūte(tai)r dveṣādibhir doṣair yuktās tāvataḥ kalpāt kalahādisamutthapāpāpanayārtham / pratipakṣamanā(lābhā)ya punaḥ sannāhaḥ sannaddhadyo(vyo) yadi buddhatvama[95a]parityaktaṃ bhavet / evaṃ ca bodhiḥ prāpyata iti matiḥ // 5 //
upāyāntarārtham apy āha-athetyādi / atha cittasyotpadyate matir evaṃ kala[ha]adikāriṇī bodhivibandhakatvād aśobhaneti / yataḥ kṣāntripāramitayā yuktā(ktāṃ) bodhiṃ spṛśeyur buddhā[ḥ] matvaivaṃ yaḥ pāpadeśanāgāthayā pratideśayati / kasyacid antike punar apy āyatyāmakaraṇān(t?) saṃvaram āpadyate / pratyāyanti(patti)karaṇād upayanti vā tam eva pudgalam evam iha sa śikṣate buddhadharme samyagbodhisattvamārgavid iti yāvad iti // 6 //
ratnaguṇasañcayagāthāvyākhyāyām abhimānaparivartaś caturviṃśatimaḥ //

śikṣāparivartaḥ pañcaviṃśaḥ
mārā(nā)bhimānanirākaraṇapūrvakam evaṃ śikṣāpariśodhanaṃ vidheyam ity āha-ya ityādi / yo bodhisattvo buddhatvādau śikṣamāṇau(ṇo) nopeti paramārthataḥ / kām api śikṣāṃ kriyārūpāṃ na ca śikṣakamātmānaṃ kartṛrūpaṃ labhate / nāpi ca śikṣyamānā(ṇā)n dharmān karmarūpān asyopalakṣaṇatvād aśikṣām aśikṣyaṃāṇā(ṇāṃ)[95b]ś ca dharmān nāvagacchati / evaṃ śikṣām aśikṣāṃ ca dvayaṃ trimaṇḍalaviśuddhyāvikalpayan yaḥ saṃvṛtyā śikṣate/ hitāhitaprāptiparihāratayā sa eveha śikṣate buddhatvāvāhake daśakuśalādau dharme 'tiśayaneti bhāvaḥ // 1 //
sa eva ca sarvadauḥśīlyavigamād ārādhako buddhadharmāṇām ity āha-yo bodhītyādi / yaeva bodhisattvaḥ satyadvayān atikramād imām anantaroditāṃ ja[a]nāty eva śikṣāṃ na sadā (kadā)cid avikalapratipattyā sampādanāc chikṣā vaikalyena bhavati duḥśīlo 'ta evā[rā]dhayitā sanneṣo 'yaṃ śikṣati buddhadharmān ne(ne)vaṃ yathākramaṃ śikṣāyāṃ saty advayāśritāyām atiśayena śikṣaṇakuśalo vastūpalambhāpattidoṣavigamād atīva nirupalambho bhavet // 2 //
etad eva kuta ity āha-śikṣantetyādi / sūryasyaiva gagane gacchato 'ntarokṣe raśmigate visarpati sati na tiṣṭhati purato 'ndhakāraṃ tadvadyathoktaśikṣāyāṃ śikṣamāṇānām eva viduṣāṃ prajñāyām ubhayasatyāśritā[96a]yāṃ jñānālokabahulatvāt prabhākarāṇām / notpadyate 'kuśalam adhyaikacittamatokta guṇodaya iti bhāvaḥ // 3 //
nanv anyatra dānādau śikṣāsadbhāve kathaṃ prajñāpāramitāyām eva śikṣā vidhīyata iti ced āha-prajñetyādi / prajñāpāramitāyām eva śikṣamāṇānāṃ sarvadharmāvabodhayogāt saṃskṛtānāṃ jinatanayānāṃ saparivāratvena śikṣamāṇatvāt sarvā eva pariśiṣṭāḥ pāramitā bhavantīha saṃgṛhītāḥ satkāyadṛṣṭau ca brahmajālaparipṛcchāsūtranirdiṣṭā yathā dvāṣaṣṭidṛṣṭayo 'ntargatās tadādhipatyenotpādāt / tathemā dānādipāramitāstrimaṇḍalapariśuddhatvenābhyasyamānāḥ prajñāpāramitāyām antargatā bhavanti // 4 //
anvayamukhena nirdiśyaivaṃ vyatirekamukhenāpy āha-yathetyādi / yathā pūrvaṃ janmākṣiptāyuṣo nirodhāj jivitendriye nirudhyamāne yāvān kaściccakṣur indriyādigrāmo mahānasti / sa sarvo niruddho bhavaty āśraya[a]bhā[96b]vāt / tathā prajñāyāṃ caritānāṃ viduṣāṃ bodhisattvatvenottamānāṃ yāḥ sarvā dānādipāramitā yathoktasāmarthyāt saṃgṛhītā bhavanti / tāḥ sarvāḥ prajñāpāramitāyāṃ nirūpya(rudhya)mānāyāṃ niruddhā bhavanti / ataḥ prajñāpāramitāyām eva śikṣā vidhīyata iti bhāvaḥ // 5 //
tattvevaṃ (nanvevaṃ) prajñāpāramitāśikṣāyāḥ sarvatra śikṣāyāṃ śrāvakatvādiguṇā(ṇo)dayād doṣa eveti ced āha-ye cāpītyādi / yepi ca śrāvakaguṇās taddarśanamārgādayas tathā pratyekabuddhānāṃ sarveṣu teṣu bhavati vidvān tadvineyasattvānugrahabuddhyā śikṣito bodhisattvo 'to 'nyārthatayā śikṣitatvān na ca tatra tiṣṭhati / tathā na spṛhayaty api teṣāṃ śrāvakādīnāṃ guṇān / ataḥ parārthāya śikṣitavyam iti kṛtvā śikṣaty enam artham evam asākṣātkaraṇād adoṣa iti // 6 //
ratnaguṇasañcayagāthāvyākhyāyāṃ śikṣāparivartaḥ pañcaviṃśatitamaḥ //

māyopamaparivartaḥ ṣaḍviṃśatimaḥ
vivṛddhyaivaṃ varddhitasya nirūḍhir vaktavyety āha-[97a] avivartiyasyetyādi(AVIVARTIKASYA?) /  yadāvaivartikyasya viśeṣeṇa varabodhaye prasthitasya yo bodhisattvaś cittotpādaṃ mahākaruṇayā sattvārthakarṇārtham anumodate samyagāśayena tadā trisāhasrasumeruṃ palāgreṇa tulayitvā grahītavyaṃ syāt pramāṇam / na tv eva tasya jinaputrasya kuśa[la]syānumodanāto nirūḍhasya pramāṇaṃ grahītuṃ śakyam asyopalakṣaṇatvād anyeṣām api dharmāṇāṃ nirūḍhāṇāṃ praṃāṇaṃ naiva grahītuṃ śakyam iti bhāvaḥ // 1 //
nirūḍhyaivaṃ nirūḍhasya cittasaṃsthitir vaktavyety āha-yāvantetyādi / yāvantaḥ sattvāḥ sambhārādibhūmau kuśalārthikāḥ pramuditādibhūmau ca mokṣakāmāḥ / sarveṣu teṣu yāvān anumodito bhavati puṇyaskandhas tadadhikapuṇyasvabhāvāyāś cittasaṃsthiter lābhāt sattvārthaṃ te bodhisattvāḥ krameṇa jinaguṇān anuprāpya dāsyanti dharmaṃ jagate 'śeṣaviparyāsaduḥkhāpagamanāya / etāni ca liṅgādīni yathākramam ūṣmādi[97b]caturvidhanirvedhaghāgīyasvarūpāṇi mūrddhābhisamaye veditavyāni // 2 //
nirvedhabhāgīyānantaraṃ darśanamārgam / tatra caturvidho vipakṣo grāhyagrāhakavikalpaḥ / prahīyata iti pratipakṣopādānena vaktavya ityādau tāvat sa kulo(sakala)pravṛttipakṣādhiṣṭhānaṃ prathamaṃ grāhyaṃ vikalpaṃ praheyaṃ vaktum āha-yo bodhītyādi / yo bodhisattvo darśanamārgaprayogāvasthāyāṃ yathoktavikalpaprahāṇād avikalpakaḥ sarvān eva dharmān hetuphalabhāvavirahāc chūnyānimittān parijānāti sakalasamāropitadharmavivekena niṣprapañcān ata eva na ca prajñāyā yathoktavikalpollekhena bodhiṃ paryeṣayati / hetuphalabhāvasambandhād anvayena saṃyuktaḥ prajñayā darśanamārgātmikayā varapāramitayā darśanamārgamanasikārayuktatvād yogī // 3 //
dvitīyaṃ sakalanivṛttipakṣādhiṣṭhānaṃ ca grāhyavikalpapraheyaṃ tathaiva dṛṣṭāntapūrvakaṃ vaktum āha-ākāśetyādi / ya[98a]thākāśadhātunā saha gaganasya parasparaparihārādilakṣaṇo ni(vi)rodho na bhavet yasmāt tenākāśadhātunā tasya gaganasya kvacid deśe kenacit prakāreṇaiṣa virodhaḥ prāpto 'pi tu kiṃ śabdasya kṣepābhidhāyitvena svātmani kāritravirodhāsambhavān neveti bhāvaḥ / tathā prajñāyāṃ darśanamārgasvabhāvāyāṃ carito vidvān bodhisattvo nirvikalpajñānalābhād ava(bhādā)kāśasadṛśo darśanamārgacittacaittapravṛtyavasthāyāṃ yathoktavikalpaprahāṇād upaśāntacārī syāt / ato naiva tasya kenacit saha virodha iti bhāvaḥ // 4 //
grāhyavikalpadvayaṃ nirdiśyaivaṃ grāhakavikalpadvayaṃ vaktavyam iti / prathamaṃ dravyasatpuruṣādhiṣṭhānaṃ(nān) grāhakavikalpāṃ(lpān) praheyatayā tathaivāvedayann āha-yathetyādi / yathā māyākāreṇa nirmitapuruṣasya naivaṃ cittaṃ bhavati nirvikalpatvāt toṣayiṣyāmi sannihitām imāṃ prekṣakajanatām iti / atha ca sa eva nirmitaḥ puruṣo viśiṣṭārtha[98b]nirbhāsijñānajananābhimānāt karoti kāryam ata eva paśyanti taṃ prekṣakāḥ svābhimānabalād vividhaṃ kāyaṃ(ryaṃ) nidarśayantam ekānekasvabhāvavirahāt tu punar naiva tasya nirmitapuruṣasya kāyo nāpi cittaṃ na ca vacanasvarūpaṃ nāmadheyaṃ bhavati / tathā prajñāyāṃ darśanamārgaprayogāvasthāyāṃ carite(to) bodhisattve(ttvo) na kadācid bhavati cittaṃ buddhvā bodhijagaddharmadeśanādinā parimocayiṣyāmīti / atha ca devādigatiṣu nanaupapattiṃ prakārake(vai)citryād vividhām / sattvārthakaraṇāt kriyāṃ(ṇādi nānākriyāṃ) saṃyuktān(ktāṃ) darśayati saṃvṛtimātratvān māyā sadṛśīṃ yathoktavikalpavirahād avikalpacārī // 5-6 //
dvitīyaṃ ca prajñaptisatpudgalādhiṣṭhānaṃ grāhakavikalpaṃ praheyatayā pūrvavad vaktum āha-yathetyādi / yathā buddhanirmitakaroty eva viśiṣṭanirvā(rmā)ṇasvabhāvatvād buddhakāryaṃ na ca tasyotpadyate nirvikalpatvenātmani bahumānotpādanāt madaḥ kurvataḥ kiñcit kāryaṃ / tathā prajñāyā darśanamārgacittacaittapravṛttisvabhāvāyāṃ yathoktavikalpaprahāṇāc carito vidvān bodhisattvo darśayati [99a] sarvāṃ kriyāṃ hetuphalabhāvavirahād yathākramaṃ nirmitamāyātulyām / tad evaṃ caturvidhavikalpaprahāṇād anabhiniveśayogena sarvārthakriyākārī syād iti // 7 //
pūrvavad upasaṃharann āha-paletyādi / yathā palagaṇḍena takṣakena yathopadeśaṃ śikṣitatvād dakṣeṇa svotprekṣākāritvāt viduṣā kṛtaṃ dāruyantraṃ yat strīpuruṣatulyaṃ tat karoty eva pratibhānajananāt sarvakārya(ryam) / tathā prajñāyām anantaroditarūpāyāṃ ca[tu]rvikalpaprahāṇena carito vidvān bodhisattvo grāhyagrāhakān abhiniveśajñānena sarvām eva jagataḥ kriyāṃ karoti nirvikalpaś cintāmaṇir iveti // 8 //
ratnaguṇasañcayagāthāvyā[khyā]yāṃ māyopamaparivartaḥ ṣaḍviṃśatimaḥ //

māraparivartaḥ saptaviṃśatimaḥ 
na kevalaṃ yathokta[catur]vikalpaprahaṇonāvikalatvād arthakriyākārī buddhādibhiś ca praśasyata ity āha-evamityādi / evaṃ yathoktacaturvikalpaprahāṇena caratāṃ viduṣāṃ bodhisattvānāṃ śakrādipramukhāḥ pṛthudevasāṃghāḥ kṛtāñjalipuṭāścetasā [99b]praṇamya kāyena vacasā ca namaskāraṃ kurvanti / buddhā bhagavanto 'pi yāvanto daśasu dikṣu lokadhātau vidyantau vidyante sarve ca te guṇavarṇamālāyāḥ parikīrtanaṃ kurvanti // 1 //
eta(ata) eva mārasamatikrāntaś ca syād ity āha-yāvantotyādi / yāvanto gaṅgānadībālukāsameṣu buddhakṣetreṣu sattvā vidyante sarve te parikalpam upādāya mārā bhaveyuḥ / ekaikaromakūpebhyaḥ punas te tāvato mārān abhinirmāyus tathāpi sarve na śakyate(nte) kartuṃ viduṣo 'ntarāyam // 2 //
bāhulyādevaṃ devaputramāraparivāti(?)kramaṃ nirdiśya caturmārasamatikramaṃ kathayann āha-catu kāraṇehītyādi / yathokta caturvikalpaprahāṇād eva prajñābalāc chūnyatāvihārī bhavati / mahākaruṇāsāmarthyān na ca sattvatyāgī / pratijñātapariśiṣṭārthasampādanād yathāvādī tathā satyena karoti puṇyajñānasampatyā ca sugatādhiṣṭhito bhavatīty ebhiś caturbhiḥ kāraṇaiḥ / kāyikyā balasampado tattvā(sampannatvā)d balavān [a]pratihatavacanatvād vidvān cittasyānyathā kartum aśa[100a]kyatvena durddhaṣaḥ / ataḥ skandhamārādibhir saṃprakampyo bhavatīti gāthārtho yojyaḥ // 3 //
idānīṃ yena kāraṇena sahito darśanamārgo mahābodhenā(dhāvā)vāhako mata(mātara)statkathayann āha-yo bodhītyādi / yo bodhisattvo mahābodhau darśanādimārgasandarśanenānyeṣāṃ pratiṣṭhānārthaṃ bodhinimittārtham eva(vaṃ) samyakgranthārthādidvāreṇa pratyarpaṇārthaṃ ca cittenādhimokṣād adhimuñcati bhāṣamāṇāṃ imāṃ prajñāpāramitāṃ mātaraṃ tathāgatānāṃ bodhiprāptaye ca svayaṃ likhanādikaraṇāt pratipattyā cābhimukhyena yujyate samyagāśayena sarvajñatāyāṃ tadupāyapravartanāt sābhiprasthito veditavyaḥ // 4 //
yathā nirdiṣṭakāraṇasahitasyaiva darśanamārgasya vikalpāpratibhāsane sāmarthyam iti dṛṣṭāntapūrvakam āvedayann āha-na cetyādi / yathā naiva dharmadhātur ākāśadhātus tathatayātī(tathatāsva)rūpatvād upaiti sthānatvam atha vā sthāne / sarvopākhyā (?) sāmārthyavirahalakṣaṇe 'ntarīkṣanabhasi meghaḥ sattvakarmādhi[100b]patyena sthito bhavati / vidyādharaś ca yathā 'nilaṃ vāyumaṇḍalaṃ bhuvanābhiprāyo 'kālapuṣpadrumaṃ mantrabalenādhitiṣṭhati pratītyasamutpādadharmatābalam / tadvad evam anantaroktakāraṇasahitadarśanamārgam avagacchan vidvān paṇḍito bodhisattvo naiva buddhyamānaṃ padārthaṃ pravṛttipakṣādhiṣṭhānagrāhyavikalpasamāropitaṃ labhate nāpi ca sarvadharmān nivṛttipakṣādhiṣṭhānagrāhyavikalpavyavasthāpitān na ca deśakaṃ dravyasatpuruṣādhiṣṭhānagrāhakavikalpasamāropitaṃ nāpi ca paśyakaṃ prajñaptisatpuruṣādhiṣṭhān(na) grāhakavikalpāvasthitam / darśanamārgena(ṇa) yathoktacaturvikalpaprahāṇāt / ato dharmatāyāṃ pratītyasamutpādaniyāmatāyāṃ satyām apratiṣṭhitanirvāṇam icchatām ayaṃ vihāro yathoktakāraṇasahāyo darśanamārgo daśabalādiguṇe ratānāṃ jnatanayānāṃ santiṣṭhata iti bhāvaḥ // 5-6 //
bodhisattvamārgeṇa samān eva śrāvakāṇām ayaṃ vihāra iti ced āha-yāvantetyādi / tathāgatā[101a]nām arhatāṃ vimokṣavihāraṃ sthāpayitvā yāvantaḥ śrāvakāṇāṃ sapratyekabuddhānāṃ darśanādimārgalakṣaṇā vihārāḥ / kleśāvaraṇaprahāṇakāritvena śāntāḥ / cittaikāgratopaśamavasthāyāṃ dṛṣṭadharmasukhavihārākāritvāt sukhasaṃprayuktās teṣāṃ sarveṣām agro 'yaṃ vihāro 'dhikajñeyāvaraṇa[prahāṇa]kāritvena jinatanayā[nā]masādhāraṇadharmādhigamayogena niruttaraś ca syāt // 7 //
sarvaprativiśeṣṭatve kathaṃ na nirvāṇādigama iti ced āha-ākāśī(śo)tyādi / yathākāśe pakṣī viharati ākāśasya pātavibandhābhāve 'pi na ca patati svakramajanitapakṣadvayasāmārthyāt / yathā codakamadhye matsyo viharati na ca nirucchvāsatayā mriyate svakarmādhipatyena / evaṃ tatropāyakauśalalābhāt tathā dhyānabalapāramitāprāpto bodhisattvo māyopamadarśanamārgasaṃmukhīkaraṇāc chūnyatāvihārī san na ca nirvṛtiṃ prāpnoti / pūrvapraṇidhānāhitamahākaruṇāsāmarthyeneti bhāvaḥ // 8 //
tasmāt sa[101b]rvārtham adhigantukāmo(me)nāyam eva vihāraḥ sevya ity upasaṃharann āha-ya ityādi / yaḥ sarvasattvebhyo guṇair agratāṃ dharmakāyatām adhigantukāmo 'graṃ ca sambhogakāyaṃ spraṣṭukāmaḥ paramādbhutabuddhajñānam icchet / agraṃ ca nirmāṇakāyena dātuṃ yathākramaṃ svaparārthasampadyogād varam uttamadharmadānaṃ samyag imam agraṃ bhāvayatu vihāra(raṃ)hitakāriṇāṃ bodhisattvānām iti // 9 //
ratnaguṇasañcayagāthāvyākhyāyāṃ sāraparivartaḥ saptaviṃśatimaḥ // 

avakīrṇakusumaparivarto 'ṣṭaviṃśatitamaḥ
kā punar iyaṃ mahābodhau yadarthaṃ yathoktakāraṇasahāyo darśanamārgo '[bhi]preta iti mahābodheḥ svarūpaṃ kathayann āha-yāvantītyādi / yāvantyaḥ kāścic chakṣāś cittaotpādādikrameṇa paridīpitā jagatāṃ sārathibhāva(vā) nāyakena tāsāṃ śikṣāṇāṃ māyopamatvena kṣayānutpādābhāvatayā kṣayānutpādajñānātmitkāyāṃ mahābodhau śikṣeyaṃ viśiṣṭajñānaṃ prahāṇayogād yathākramam agrā nirutta[102a]rā ca syāt / ato yaḥ sarvaśikṣāṇāṃ vidvān icchati pāraṃ gantuṃ samyag imāṃ sa prajñāpāramitāṃ yathoktamārgasvabhāvāṃ buddhatvaśikṣāṃ śikṣitu bhāvayatv iti yāvat // 1 //
prasaṅgāgataṃ niva(vṛ)tyedānīṃ prakṛtam eva darśanamārgaṃ vaktum āha-agram ityādi / sarvānupalambhatvenāviparyāsatayā prāptakuśaladharmasaṃgrād agraṃ nidhānam / ayam ekakṣaṇiko mūrddhābhisamaye duḥkhe dharmajñānakṣāntisaṃgṛhīto dānāditrimaṇḍalaviśuddhaprabhāvitaṃ ṣaḍtriṃśadākāranirjāto darśanamārgo 'pūrvadharmopārjanād uttamo dharmakośaḥ / ataś ca buddhatvotpattyadhigamadharmotpādanāt buddhānāṃ gotrasya janakaḥ pramuditādidaśabhūminiṣpādanān sukhasaukhyaṃ(khya) [gaṃ]jaś ca syāt / tad evaṃ krameṇopadarśitanirvāṇatvād atikrāntā bhaviṣyatbuddhatvakaraṇād anāgatā daśasu dikṣu vartamānatvena jagadarthakaraṇāl lokanāthāś ca buddhā bhagavanto grāhyagrāhakacaturvikalpānāṃ prakarṣaparyantādhigamasvabhāvatvena daśamyā(myāṃ) bhūmau pra[102b]tibaddhamūrddhābhisamaye niyamena prahāṇādito darśanamārgād yathākramaṃ te sarve prasūtāḥ prasaviṣyanti prasavartti(nti) ca / na cāyaṃ kṣīyate sarvatathāgatair adhigamyamānatve 'pi śūnyatāsvabhāvatvena dharmadhātudarśanamārga iti yāvat // 2 //
ata evāyaṃ sarvaviparāsaprahāṇena sarvaguṇasampado hetur iti dṛṣṭāntapūrvakaṃ kathayann āha-yāvantyetyādi / yathā yāvanto loke puṣpavṛkṣāḥ phalavṛkṣā vanaspatayo vā sarve te medinīto 'pūrvaprādurbhāvāt samudgatās tathottarottaravṛddhiyogāt prādurbhūtā na ca medinī yathoktapramāṇato bhārātikrāntatayā kṣayam upaiti na cāpi vṛkṣādyupacaryā(yā)d vṛddhiṃ na ca khidyate pariśramābhāvāt na cāpy antardhīyate 'dṛśyatvābhāvāt / yataḥ sarvakalpavikalpābhāvāt nirvikalpāḥ / tathā yāvanto buddhābhagavanto 'rhantaḥ śrāvakāḥ pratyekabuddhāś ca devāḥ sarvaṃ ca jagad eṣāṃ yāvantaḥ sukhasaukhyadharmāḥ sāsravānāsravāḥ sarve te prajñāpārami[103a]tāto yathoktadarśanamārgaṃ(rgāt) tadbhāvakabodhisattvasya prasūtāḥ / tathaiva sarvakalpavikalpābhāvān naivaṃ kṣīyate / na ca vivardhate kadācit prajñā samyagdharmāvabodhau darśanamārga iti yāvat // 3-4 // 
darśanamārgam evam abhidhāya vipakṣaprahāṇādikam ādhārapratipattipūrvakaṃ subodham ity ādhāraṃ bhāvanāmārgaṃ tāvat sarvaġuṇasampado heurdṛṣṭāntapūrvakaṃ vaktum āha-yāvantetyādi / yathā yāvantaḥ sattvā hīnaguṇādiyogān mṛḍavo madhyadravyādisampattiyogāt madhyāḥ sarvotkṛṣṭakriyā[yogā]d utkṛṣṭā loke sambhavanti / sarve te nityakāra(nitya)tvādiniṣedhena pūrvaśubhakarmahetukatvāt saṃvṛtyāvidyā prabhavāḥ sugatenoktāḥ / tathā 'kṣopakakarmasāmagrīpratyayaḥ samākṣiptaṃ kālaṃ yāvatpravartayati pañcopādānaskandhayantraṃ na ca yantram avidyā kṣīyate na cāsyā vṛddhir pūrvasattvaprādubhāvena saṃvṛtyāpy anutpādād iti matiḥ / tathā yāvanto yānatraye jñānaviśeṣatvena jñānanayā yathākramaṃ[103b] mṛdumadhyādhimātratvād uttarottarārthaprāpakatvena dvāropāyabhūtāḥ (mūlāḥ) / sarve te prajñāpāramitāto bhāvanāmārgānta(t ta)d bhāvakabodhisattvasya saṃvṛtyā prasūtāḥ / tathākṣepakarmasāmagrīpratyayaḥ pravartayati yāvad āsaṃsāram anyonyasahāyatvena jñānayantraṃ na ca māyo[pa]matvena tattvataḥ prajñāpāramitābhyāsapatho varddhate kṣīyate vā // 5-6 //
kenākāreṇa sākṣātkṛto 'sau yathoktaguṇavāhaka ity āha / yotra( tū) pratītyādi yas tu bodhisattvaḥ pratītyasamutpādasyaiva māyopamatvena kṣayābhāvād akṣayārtham imāṃ prajñāpāramitām avaskandha(nda)samāpattilakṣaṇaṃ(ṇāṃ) bhāvanāmārgam akṣayatvenaiva buddhyate sa sūryo yathābhrapaṭalair mukto raśmibhir vidhūyāndhakāraṃ prabhavanti(ti) svayaṃ tadavidhūyāvidyāpaṭalaṃ svayambhūr bhagavān avakīrṇakusumanāmā tathāgatavad bhavatīti // 7 //
ratnaguṇasañcayagāthāvyākhyāyām avakīrṇakusumaparivarto 'ṣṭaviṃśatitamaḥ //

anugamaparivarta ekonatriṃśattamaḥ
bhāva[nā][104a]mārgam evam abhidhāya tatra praheyaś caturvidho grāhyagrāhakavikalpadvayaṃ praheyṃ tāva[t] vaktum āha-caturbhītyādi / svaparārthasampadbhedāt tathā saṃvṛtiparamārthabhedāc caturvidhaṃ dhyānam / itya(ye)bhiś catasṛbhiś cittaikāgratābhir navānupūrvavihārasamāpattilakṣaṇasya bhāvanāmārgasyānulomādikrameṇālambanād viharati grāhyavikalpadvayaprahāṇena prāptādhigamamahattvān mahānubhāvo na ca trāvasthānād ālayaṃ nāpi ca niśrayam avagrahād abhiniveśayogena karoti grāhyavikalpadvayaprahāṇāt / api tu khalu punar āśrayāḥ smbhāradvayahetutvād ime 'tra bhāvanāmārgālambena parāś catuṣprakārāś cittaikāgratābhiniveśā bhaviṣyanti / viśiṣṭajñānaprahāṇayogād uttamā yā śrāvakādibodhir utkṛṣṭatvāt varabodheḥ prāptyartham ebhir viharatīti bhāvaḥ // 1 //
ato 'nantara. grāhakavikalpadvayaṃ praheyaṃ nirdiśann āha-dhyāna ityādi / yo dhyāne[ ']na[104b]ntarokte 'tra sthito bhaved bodhisattvo grāhakavikalpadvayaprahāṇena bhāvanāmārgalābhād varaprajñāyā lābhī / yasmād ārūpyasamāpattayaś catasro rūpadhātudhyānasvabhāvatvād rūpisamādhayaś catvāraḥ / ca śabdān nirodhasamāpattiś caiketi / sarve te prajñopāyayogena vibhāvyamānatvāt samādhayaḥ śreṣṭhāḥ / samyag ime bhūyo bhūyo 'bhyasyamānatvād dhyānasvabhāvavarāgrabodhau tadanukūlatvād upakāribhūtā bhavanti / evam api kartavyaśeṣatvena buddhabhūmyāvaraṇaprahāṇe yatvā(yatnā)bhāvān na punar āstravakṣaye sa śikṣate bodhisattvaḥ // 2 // 
caturvikalpaprahāṇāt evaṃ sarvaguṇasampadām asau hetur i[ti nirdiśann āha-āścaryam i]tyādi / hetuma[ha]ttvād āścaryaṃ phalāhattvād adbhutam idaṃ caritaṃ sarvaguṇasampadām āśrayabhūtatvād guṇasañcayāṃ(yānāṃ) bodhisattvāṃ(ttvānāṃ) yad uta yathoktacatuṣprakāradhyānair adhigatena samādhibhāvanāpathena viharatādanta(tāṃ ta)dupalambhe 'pi tatrābhiniveśābhāvān nimittaṃ nāsti / tatrāpi bhāvanāpathe teṣāṃ sthitaḥ sanna (sthitānāṃ teṣāṃ) yadi pa[105a]ri [śi]ṣṭāvaraṇaprahāṇād bhajyate svātmabhāvaḥ tadā sarvathā vakṣyamāṇa(ṇā)rūpyadhātūpapattipratiṣedhena puna abhilaṣitatvāt kāmarūpadhātvor anyatare 'bhilaṣite dhātau kṛpāpāratantryād upapadyate yathābhiprāyaṃ kṣātriyādikule // 3 //
bhāvanāmārgānantaryasamādhyarthaṃ dṛṣṭāntapūrvakam āvedayann āha-yathetyādi / yathā jāmbūdvīpakā manuṣyā na kadācillabdhatvād alabhapūrvaṃ divyaṃ devaṃ(va)nikāyaparinirmitavaśavartyādikam uttarakuruṃ cānuprāpnuvanti / ṛddhyādigamanād dṛṣṭyā ca te viṣayāṃs tatropabhogāt parigṛhītavantaḥ santo 'pyāśritasattvārthakaraṇāt punar āgaccheyuḥ na cāvagrahaṃ tatrānantabhūtapūrvasukhahetau kuryuḥ / tathā te bhāvanāmārgādhigamād guṇadharās ta eva pūrvotkṛṣṭatvād varabodhisattvāḥ / dhyānenābhāvālambanena kuśa[la]dharmasmaraṇena cādhipatipratyayena vihṛtyānantaryasamādhau śāntākāreṇa prayuktayogāḥ / punar api kāmadhātāvārūpyadhātuvarjite kāmaśabdasyehābhi[105b]laṣitavācakasya grahaṇād abhilaṣite 'nyatare dhātau kṛpayā sattvārthakaraṇāt sthitā bhavanti / tadgatadoṣānupalepād anu[pa]liptāḥ padmānīva vāriṇi / ata evāniśritāḥ pṛthagjanadharmatvād dānādyupalambhadharme / atra ca sthāne duravagrāhatvād aviditabodhisattvopāyako(kau)śalānāṃ codyaparamparāprasarpiṇī vipratipattinirākartavyā // 4-5 //
tatra tāvat yady aniśritāḥ katham ālambanopapatty ādaya iti ced āha-anyatretyādi / dharmadeśanādinā sattvaparipācanāt svacittapariśodhanena buddhakṣetrapariśuddhaḥ vipakṣaprahāṇād āsāṃ dānādipāramitānāṃ paripūraṇaprayojanāc cānyatra mahātmāno bodhisattvā na niśritāḥ / kiṃ tarhy etad arthaṃ tasmādālambanopapattyādayo dhātudvaye ghaṭante 'taś cārūpyadhātau bhājanaprajñaptinirdeśamahāyānasūtrānusāreṇa rūpadhātor ūrddhvam ākāśānantyāyatanādisaṃjñake catuḥsthānasvabhāve svotpattiṃ na prārthayanti jina[ta]nayā yasmāc chamatho[106a]dbhūtatvena sarvasaṃjñānirodhād atiśayena bodhiguṇebhyaḥ pāramitābhyo hāniḥ syāt // 6 //
yadi tadgatadoṣānulepān na gṛddhāḥ kimarthaṃ tatra stithā bhavantīti dṛṣṭāntapūrvakaṃ pariharann āha-yathetyādi / yathā kaścit puruṣo ratnamayaṃ nidhānaṃ labhamānas tatra spṛhābuddhiṃ na saṃjanayati svaprayojanābhāvāt / parāviditatvād ekākī punas tannidhānaṃ gṛhītvāparasmin vā (kā)le svajñātibhyo vibhaktaṃ gṛhaṃ praviṣa(śa)tvy evaṃ na bhavati lubdho 'nyārthaṃ pravṛttatvāt / upāyakauśalabalena tathā yathoktadhyānaiś caturbhir eva samādhyanukūlatvāc chāntān vimokṣān labhamānāḥ prītisukhadān vidvāṃsaḥ vodhisattvās tatrāvagrahābhāvāt svaprārthalakṣaṇaṃ dhyānasukhaṃ saṃvṛtiparamārthabhedāt yathākramaṃ dhyānasamādhilābhaṃ cāvasṛjya punar api yathokte kāmadhātāv ātmabhāvasaṃdarśanāt praviśati(nti) mahākaruṇāvaśāj jagadanukampino 'taścāvasthānāt na tatra gṛddhā iti matiḥ // 7-8 //
e[106b]vaṃ tarhy asamāhitabhūmipraveśāt kathaṃ na vikṣepaḥ syād ityādi(ha) yadītyādi / yadi kāmadhātau sthito 'pi bodhisattvo viharati cittaikāgratālambanena samādhinā śūnyān(nyatā)mātramanasikaraṇād dhyānenārthatva(tve) pratyekabuddhatva(tve) ca spṛhābuddhiṃ sa janayati / sattvadhātu(to)r nairapakṣyāt tadā(da)bhimatārthalambanavirahād asamāhito bhavaty upalambhadoṣoddhatatvāt uddhatacitto mahāyānād bahirgatacittatvāt kṣiptacitto 'taś ca parihīno buddhaguṇebhyo nāvika iva jāle bhinnanaike 'rthebhyo na tv asamāpattitayānutpattimātreṇa(ṇā)samāhitaḥ prajñopāyasāmarthyād iti matiḥ // 9 //
tad eva kathayann āha-kiṃ cāpītyādi / yady api māyopa[ma]dharmabhāvanayā sattvasaṃgrahādiprayojanād vā rūpādipañcakāmaguṇeṣv abhiyukto bhavati śrāvakapratyekabuddhayāne spṛhācittavigato na tu śūnyatākruṇāgarbhe bodhicitte [ta]d eva satatam abhimatārthabhraṃśāt samāhito bhavadbhiḥ prajñātavyaḥ / śūro nirji[107a]tavipakṣatvena bodhisattvo bhavet / evaṃ prasaṅgapramparayā vipratipattinirākṛtety ukte mūrddhābhisamayaḥ / tathā coktam-
liṅgaṃ tasya vivṛddhiprati(ś ca ni)rūḍhā cittasaṃsthitiḥ /
caturddhā ca vi[kalpasya prati] pakṣaś caturvidhaḥ //
pratyekaṃ darśanākhye ca bhāvanākhye ca vartmani /
ānantaryaḥ(rya) samādhiś ca saha vipratipattibhiḥ // (abhi'. 1.15-17)
mūrddhābhisamaya iti // 10 //
prāptamūrddhābhisamayo vyastasamastatvenādhigatānarthān anupūrvīkṛtya sthirīkaraṇāya vibhāvayatīty anupūrvābhisamayārtham āha-paretyādi / parama(para)sattvānāṃ kuśalādivāsanābhiḥ pūryante galanti te pudgalānāṃ kāraṇād akhiladoṣā(ṣavi)gamena viśuddhacittāḥ santo dānādiṣaṭpāramitā buddhādyāḥ ṣaḍanusmṛtayaḥ sarvadharmābhāvasvabhāvaś ceti / evaṃ trayodaśaprakāradharmabhāvanayā vicaranti varavīryapāramitābhiyuktāḥ / tathā ythoktārthābhisamayādyarthā (?) nikṛṣṭakarmakaraṇāt kumbhadāsī svayamasvatantratvenāvaśā ma(sa)tī bharttu[ḥ] pratibandhatve[107b]na vaśā bhavati / tathā sarvasattvānām āyattavṛttitvena vaśatām upayānti sarvathākṣobhayitum aśakyatvād dhīrā bodhisattvā ity ukto 'nupūrvābhimayaḥ / tathā coktam-tredhā daśaddhā cānupūrvika" (abhi. a. 1.17) iti // 11 //
vibhāvitānupūrvābhisamayasya svabhyastīkaraṇāya teṣām eva kṣaṇenādhigama iti ekakṣaṇābhisambodhārthaṃ dṛṣṭāntapūrvakam āha-na cetyādi / yathā naiva svāminaḥ prativākyaṃ dadāsī(dadāti dāsī) tadaprādhāt tu(nu)rūpeṇāpriyābhidhānād ākruṣṭāpi daṇḍādinābhihatāpi kareṇa tāḍitā vā satī kiṃ tarhy ekāntena trastamanā[ḥ] paribhavena cābhibhūtā sama(bha)yā tiṣṭhati / mām eva mā sa (mām eva sa) punaḥ svāmī pratihanyāt prativacanakāraṇene(nai)vaṃ matveti śeṣaḥ / tathā varabodhau prasthito bodhisattvo 'vipākānāsravasarvadharmaikakṣaṇalakṣaṇaikakṣaṇābhisambodhādinā catuṣprakākrṇālayavijñāne sarvadharmāṇāṃ samāśritavāsanāyā dī(dā?)nādyanyatamānāsravadharmālambanādinā anyonyahetuphalabhāvād eka [108a] sāmagra(grya)dhīnatvenātiśayaviśiṣṭatākaru(kāra)ṇād ekakṣa.ādhigamena / tathā tiṣṭhet sarvasmin jagati akhilāvaraṇaprahāṇād yathā puṣya(preṣya)bhūtas tadārādhanatayā yenātaḥ sattvārādhanāt phalabhūtāyā bodher āgamo guṇānāṃ ca hetubhūtānāṃ paripūrir anyathā tṛṇakāṣṭhaprabhavo vahnir jvalito yathā dahati tad eva tṛṇakāṣṭham / tadvat sattvaprabhavād dharmā(dharmaṃ?) na kupitāḥ sattvā nāśayantīti matihḥ / ityukto 'yam ekakṣaṇābhisambodhaḥ / tathā coktam-ekakṣaṇābhisambodhau lakṣaṇena caturvidhaḥ (abhi. a. 1.17) iti // 12-13 //
vibhāvitaikakṣaṇābhisambodhasya dvitīye kṣaṇe dharmakāyābhisambodha iti tadartham āha-avasṛjetyādi / yathā mātā samyagekaputrake paricarantī śāṭhyādirahitatvād apyāśayenāvikhinnā samupatiṣṭhati tadvat svābhāvikādikāyacatuṣṭāsya karmaṇādhigamenān ālambanamahākaruṇādyā(mu)khibhāvād avasṛjyātmasukhatāṃ parasattvakārye 'bhiyukto 'ho rātraṃ tadupakārāpekṣā vai[108b]virahān niṣpratikāṃkṣacitto bhagavāṃs tathāgataḥ samupatiṣṭhati / ityukto dharmakāyābhisambodhaḥ / tathā coktam-
svābhāvikaḥ sasam(sāṃ)bhogo naimāṇiko 'paras tathā /
dharmakāyaḥ sakāritraś caturdhā samudīritaḥ // (abhi. a. 1.18)
ity ayaṃ paripūrṇa evāṣṭābhisamayo bālajanavyutpattaye piṇḍārthatayoktā vistarastvāryāṣṭasāhāsrikānibandhanād grāhyo 'tānyaiḥ (to 'nyaiḥ) śikṣitukāmatayā kvacitprabhedārthaprayojane 'pi sarvākāra(raṃ)prayojayitum aśakyatvād anyatra samāsto 'bhidhānān na kiñcid ekāntena samāsapakṣaḥ saṃgṛhītaḥ / ity avivakṣāpadasā(mā)rūḍhaṃ kevalaṃ vivakṣāpadaṃ nīyata iti na tanmatam upanyasya nirākṛtam iti // 14 //
ratnaguṇasañcayagāthāvyākhyāyām anugamaparivarta ekonnatriṃśattaṃaḥ //
yatho[ktā]ṣṭābhisamayasvabhāvāyā mātuḥ śrutādij+nānodayena prāptiṃ prati kalyāṇamitrānārādhanāya yādṛśī pratipattiḥ kāryā tāṃ kathayann āha-yo bodhītyādi / yo bodhisattvo dīrghakālaṃ saṃsa[109a9]raṇābhiprāyaḥ sattvārthe tathādhārādheyabhedād vidhibuddhakṣetrapariśodhane ca buddhānujñātayogatvena yuktayogī sanneva sahasāprāptau māyopamadharmabhāvanābalāt khedabuddhim aṇumātrām apy utpādayati / [sa prajñāpāramitādhigamena sattvālambanād arthakaraṇāditrividhavīryapāramitāyuktaḥ styānmiddharahito 'tandritaś ca bhavati // 1 //
khedabuddhir utpanne sati ko do.Saḥ? nidarśayann āha-sa cītyādi / yadi manyate kalpakoṭiṣv eva buddhair labhyate bodhiḥ tadā avijñaḥ bodhisattvaḥ tathāgatabodheḥ ciraṃ saṃjñām utpādya duḥkhasaṃjñayā ciraṃ duḥkhī bhavati /] upalambhābhiniveśād avagacchan dharmān evaṃ ca tato vīryapāramitāto bhraṣṭatvād dhīno 'taś ca kausīdyadharmasvabhāvo bhavet // 2 //
kathaṃ tarhi khedabuddhir na karaṇīyeti ced āha-prathamam ityādi / prathamam upādāya varabodhau cittotpādaṃ yāvad anuttaraṃ tāthāgataṃ śivam anuprāpnuyāt / tadānennopāyena khedabuddher apanayanād ārabdhavīryo vidvān paṇḍito veditavyaḥ // 3 //
samyakpravṛttatvena mārakṛtopadravaś ca syād ity āha-sa cītyādi / yadi kaścid evaṃ vadet sumeruṃ parvatarājam bhitvā yāsyaivaṃ cādhigāmiṣyasi tvam agrāṃ bodhim iti / tataḥ śrutvaivam [109b]śakyānuṣṭhānād yadi khedabuddhiṃ karoty eva sumeror aśīti yojanasahasrapramāṇāvabodhāt pramāṇaṃ buddhvā tadā kausīdyaprāpto bhavej jinaputro 'taś ca bodhiṃ nādhigacchati [iti] matiḥ // 4 //
kathaṃ tarhi tasyāvabodha iti ced āha-athetyādi / atha tasyotpādyate matir api tu viparītavāsanāsamutthitatvena samyagjñānodayād alpa(ṇu)mātraṃ sumeruṃ kṣaṇamātreṇa bhāsmatāpādanān nayāmi nāśām ity evam ārabdhavīryo bhaved vidur bodhisattvo 'taś cācireṇa varabodhiṃ prāpsyati / nāyakānāṃ bhagavatāṃ sambandhinīm iti yāvat // 5 //
apagatavipakṣe 'pi vīrye vastūpalambho doṣa ity āha-sa cītyādi / ṛddhyā deśanāprātihāryābhyāṃ paripācyā 'nuśāsanīpratihāryeṇa jagataḥ kariṣyāmy aham artham ity abhiprāyād yadi kāyena cittena vacasā cotsāhakaraṇāt parākramai tat (parākrameya) tadā kleśabāhulyāt kauśīdyaprāpto bhaved yataḥ parasaṃjñā vinā bhāvinyāṃ sthitaḥ svātmasaṃjñāyām ato saṃgā[110a]kleśodayena māyopamanairātmyabhāvanāyā vidūre bhavej jinaputro nabha ivābhāvalakṣaṇatvena bhāvalakṣaṇāyā bhūmer evaṃ ca na vīryavān i[ti] bhāvaḥ // 6 //
kathaṃ punar asau tad yukta ity āha-yasmin ityādi / yasmin māyopamatve na kāryo(yo) nāpi cittam asyopalakṣaṇatvaṃ na vaco nāpi vastūpalambhavirahāt sattvasaṃjñā / tatraitāḥ saṃjñā vivartya yadā sthito bhāvābhāvamanasikāravirahād advayadharmacārī tadāyam ākāṃkṣati sarvadoṣavaiṣamyābhāvāc chivām apratiṣṭhitanirvāṇatvenācyutām agrabodhiṃ jinaputro vīryapāramitayā yukto 'bhihito kāriṇā lokanāthena / evaṃ kalyāṇamitraparyeṣaṇādau pravṛttena kṣāntir abhyasanīyānyathāsamīhitārthāniṣpatter iti // 7 //
parāpakāramarṣaṇakṣāntiṃ dharmanidhyānakṣāntisahitāṃ kathayann āha-puruṣam ityādi / kleśotthaṃ sambhinnapralāpādi śrutvā vākyaṃ parato duruktaṃ kṣānter abhya[sa]nāt puṇyopārjanahetutvena kalyāṇamitratayā tasyā[110b]nubodhāt paritoṣam utpādayati / prasannamukhatvāt sumukho yo vidvān bodhisattvo yataḥ ko bhāṣate[ ']nantaraṃ vacaḥ kaḥ śṛṇoti kutas tadutpannaṃ kasya vā sa[mba]ndhi kena vākāreṇopalabhyata iti / api tu māyopamatvāt dharmāṇāṃ naiva kaścid bhāṣa ityādi pratyavekṣātaḥ sa vijño yuktaḥ kṣāntyā dharmanidhyānasahitaparāpakāramarṣaṇasvabhāvayā varapāramitayeti gāthārthaḥ // 8 //
kṣāntāv evaṃ ko guṇa ity āha-yo bodhītyādi / yo bodhisattvo 'nantaroditaṃ kṣāntidva[ya]m abhyasanāt kṣamate yathākramaṃ kṛpāprajñāyogād guṇadharmayukto yaś cānyo ratnaparipūrṇam eva trisāhasraṃ [mahāsāhasraṃ] lokadhātuṃ buddhebhyo lokavidbhyaḥ śrāvakebhyaḥ pratyekabuddhebhyaś ca dadyād evaṃ pūrvakasya bodhisattvasya puṇyam apekṣyānantarārthakārinikṛṣṭarūpatvāt kalāmātrapuṇyaṃ taddhetutvāt sa na bhaved iha dānaprabandhaḥ // 9 //
kuta etad iti ced āha-kṣāntītyādi / dvividhāyāṃ kṣāntau pratipattyā sthitasya prāsādikātmabhāvaparigrahaṇāt pariśuddhaye(ddho) cātmabhā[111a]vah / dvātriṃśtallakṣaṇavirājitagātratvena dvātriṃśallakṣaṇaprabhāvo 'śīty anuvyañjena(janena) yuktatvād anantapāraḥ / sattvāṃ" cāsecanakakāyatvena karmaphalābhisaṃpratyayontadharme(?) pratiṣṭhāpanān niśāmayati / kṣāntiś ca kurvan vijñaḥ sarvasmin jagati apagatāmitratvena priyo bhaved iti / yataḥ kṣāntipāramitāyāḥ sarvam etat phalaṃ na dānapāramitāyāḥ sambhavati / tasmāt pūrvoktagāthārtha eva sthitapakṣa iti bhāvaḥ // 10 //
idānīṃ duḥkhādhivāsanākṣāntiṃ dharmanidhyānakṣāntisahitāṃ kathayann āha-sa cītyādi / yadi kaścid ekaś candanapuṭaṃ gṛhītvā devadattādijano 'bhyavakired gurupremṇā bodhisattvaṃ dvitīyo 'pi kaścid agnirāśiṃ śirasi kṣipet tadāpyubhayanna dharmanairātmyabhāvanābalāt tulyamano 'gre bodhinimittam utpāṭa(da)yitavyam // 11 //
evaṃ yathoktakṣāntir vibhāvi(vyā) syāt tasyāṃ ca pariṇāmanaṃ vidheyam ity atitarāṃ phalakathanenāvedayann āha- evam ityādi / anantaroditakrameṇa kṣa[111b]māvān bhūtvā vidvān paṇḍito bodhisattvo yadā kṣāntisahagataṃ cittotpādaṃ pariṇāmayet sattvārthaṃ pratyagrabodhau tadā yāvatyaḥ kṣāntyo 'rhatāṃ pratyekabuddhānāṃ bodhisattvādisattvadhātoś ca tāḥ sarvāḥ samyagabhibhavati sarvasmin jagati / kṣāntiṃ (?) yathoktaṃ kurvāṇo 'nyaiḥ pariṇāmanādhikyenābhibhavitum aśakyatvāc chūro nirjitavipakṣa iti yāvat // 12 //
kathaṃ punaḥ parāpakārādikṣamaṇa(marṣaṇa)m upalambhe 'pi sati kriyata ity āha-kṣametyādi / kṣāntiṃ kurvataivaṃ punaś cittam utpādayitavyam / narakeṣu tiryaksu yamaloke cānekāni duḥkhāni anubhūtāni kāmaguṇahetor abhilaṣitārthākaraṇād akāmakarāṇi / kasmāt tv idānīm evaṃ vidhaklyāṇamitrādidharmaprāptaye na kṣāntiṃ karoti bodhau pradhānaṃ kāraṇam / kiṃ śa[bda]sya kṣepābhidhāyitvād api tu karomye(ty e)vety evaṃ prajñābalāt parāpakārādimarṣaṇaṃ syād iti bhāvaḥ // 13 // 
tad eva kathayann āha-kase(śe)ty ādi / yadā tu vetralatāditāḍanā[112a]tkaṣā(śā)vadho hiraṇyādyapakarṣaṇāḍ daṇḍavadhaḥ khaḍgādiprahārāc chastravadhaḥ / śṛṅkhalādidānād bandhanaṃ karādipiṭ(ḍa)nāt tāḍanam / śiraḥkarṇacaraṇādīnām panayanāt teṣāṃ ccheda ity evaṃ jātīyakāni yāvanti duḥkhāni jagati saṃvidyante tāny ahaṃ viśiṣṭadharmaprāptaye soḍhum utsaha iti / evaṃ yadā pratisaṃkhyānaṃ karoti tadā kṣāntipāramitāyāṃ yathoktasvabhāvāyāṃ tiṣṭhed bodhisattvaḥ sadāpraruditavad iti // 14 //
ratnaguṇasañcayagāthāvyākhyāyāṃ sadāpraruditaparivartas triṃśattamaḥ //

dharmodgataparivarta ekatriṃśaḥ
evaṃ vihitaparyeṣaṇāṃ kalyāṇamitrair adau sarvaguṇādhāratvāc chīle 'vavādo vidheya ity āha-śīletyādi / saṃvarādinā trividhena śīlena samādānakaraṇāt ye samudgatā bhavanti nirvāṇāśayena saṃvaragrahaṇāc chamābhikāṅkṣiṇas te yāvantīḥ saṃvaravyāpāratvāt saṃvarakriyāḥ / pratipattyā sampādanād anuvartayati(nti) / tāś ca sarvasattvānāṃ hitārthaṃ yadānuttarbodhaye niryātanā[112b]t pariṇāmayanti / tadā daśabalānāṃ sambandhitvād gocare sarvāpattirahitatvād akhaṇḍaśīle sthitā bhavantīti gāthārtho yojyaḥ // 1 //
amum evārthaṃ vyatirekapūrvakaṃ spaṣṭayann āha-sa cītyādi / sa cet pratyekabuddhānām arhatāṃś ca bodhau gṛhītasaṃvarapariṇāmanāt spṛhāṃ janayati / tadā mahāyānapra[tipa]ttivirahād duḥśīlas tathā gṛhītasaṃvaraparityāgena cchidracārī bhaved viduṣāṃ tathāgatānām / atha bodhāv uttamaśivāyāṃ gṛhītaśīlaṃ pariṇāmayati / evaṃ sthitā(taḥ) śīlapāramitāyāṃ gṛhītārthāparityāgāt kāmaguṇair api śīlāvirūddhair yuktaḥ // 2 //
kimartham evaṃ śīle prathamato 'vavāda iti ced āha-yo dharmetyādi / yasmād yo 'yaṃ svārthasampaddharmāṇām ubhayārthasampadbodheḥ parārthasampadguṇānāṃ ca pratilambhāt āgamo bodhisattvānāṃ sa śīlaprayojanenāpatsaṃrakṣaṇād guṇadharmasamanvitānāṃ bhavati / yā ca dharmabodhiguṇebhyaḥ parihāṇir hi[113a]takāriṇāṃ bodhisattvānāṃ duḥśīlatāyāḥ sambandhinīyaṃ prakāśitā nāyakena tasmāc chīla eva prathamato 'vavāda iti bhāvaḥ // 3 //
kiyatā śīle sthita ity āha-yadītyādi / yadi pañcakāmaguṇān api lokaprasiddhān bhuṅkte bodhisattvo 'ntasao(śo) ratnatrayaśaraṇaṃ ca yāvad ābodhimaṇḍagato bhaviṣyāmy ahaṃ buddho jagaddhitakārīti sarvajñatā cāsya manasi bhavet / etāv atāpi bodhicittasaṃvaragrahaṇāc chīlapāramitāyāṃ vijñaḥ sthito jñeyo 'nyatra mahāyānasūtrānteṣv atiśayena bodhisaṃvaraśīlādeḥ prācuryeṇa nirdeśāt // 4 //
saṃkṣepeṇa punaḥ sarvajñatāmanasikāravirahāt tu duḥśīla evetyāha-yadītyādi / yadi kalpakoṭiṃ prāṇātipātaviratyādibhir daśabhiḥ kuśalaiḥ karmapathaiś caran pratyekabuddhatve 'rhatve ca śīlapariṇāmanāt spṛhāṃ janayati tadā paurvavad dauśīlyayogāt khaṇḍaśīlas tathā [duḥ]śīlo 'pi bhavet / yasmād bodhicittotpādena buddhatve nimantrya tato nivartate na sattvāṇāṃ visaṃyā(vā)da[113b]nāt pārājikato mūlāpatter gurutaro 'yaṃ cittotpādaḥ śrāvakādispṛhāsahagataḥ // 5 //
samyagamanujñāte 'pi śīle kathaṃ vartitavyam ity āha-rakṣetyādi / yathoktaśīlaṃ rakṣat(n)samādānagrahaṇapūrvakaṃ pari[ṇa]mathyāgrabodhau yadā na ca tenaiva śīlena parān nindanād avamanyate / nāpi cātmānaṃ śīlavratābhimānād utkarṣati ataś cātmasaṃjñām upādeyatayā tathā heyatayā parasattvasaṃjñāṃ ca parivarjjya tadā yathoktaśīlapāramitāyāṃ sthita ity ucyate bodhisattvas tasmād evaṃ vartitavyam iti bhāvaḥ // 6 //
anyathā tu doṣa evety āha-yadītyādi / yadi bodhisattvaś caran jinānāṃ yathoktaśīlatvāt mārge 'mī śīlavanto duḥśīlā iti heyopādeyatayā vyavasthāpayati / sattvānāṃs tadā nānātvasaṃjñāyāṃ pravṛttau vastūpalambhena sarvākāratayā rakṣitum aśakyatvāt pūrvavat parayo(mo) duḥśīlas tathā cchidraśīlo 'pyata eva na tv asau pariśuddhaśīlaḥ syāt / evaṃ ca vastūpalambhe na vidheya iti bhāvaḥ // 7 //
anupalambhacā[114a]riṇaś cānāpattir ity āha-yasyo netyādi / yasya māyopamadharmatābalān nāsty ātmasaṃjñā na ca prasattvasaṃjñā tasya svaparavibhāgābhāvenānunayagratighavirahān nimittodgrahaṇavaimukhye sati niṣiddhavastvācaraṇābhāvān naivāsaṃvaro 'sti / evaṃ ca yasya na saṃvare śīlavrataparāmarṣadoṣatvān nāpy asaṃvare[ ']kuśalodayāvagraho 'sti / so 'yam aviparītapravṛttatvena śīlasaṃvarāt prakāśito nāyakena // 8 //
śīlānvitasyaivaṃ dāne pravṛttir ity āha-yo evetyādi / ya evānantaroktaśīlena saṃvṛtyā samanvāgataḥ paramārgena(rthena) ca niṣprapañco 'ta evāvagrahābhāvāt so 'napekṣako bhavati sarvasmin naiva priyāpriyavastūni / evaṃ cottamāṅgādīni tyajan līyamāne vastuni layābhāvād alīnacitto vidyamānārthatyāgāt sarvasvatyāgī satataṃ ca dānaphaleṣu nairapekṣyād alīno bhavet // 9 //
bāhyavastuparityāgābhāvāt kathaṃ sarvatyāgī ced āha-jñātvetyādi / yatra hi nāma prajñāpūrvakāritayā dharmāṇāṃ pra[114b]kṛtiṃ saṃvṛtyā hetupratibaddhodayatvād vaśikāṃ paramārthena svabhāvavirahān nirātmikāṃ ca jñātvā yadātmano māṃsādikam tyajan na līnacittaḥ / kiṃ punar bāhyaṃ vastu tadā na tyajed evaṃ cāsambhavo 'nna bāhye vastuny asau mātsaryaṃ kuryād iti // 10 //
nairātmyayogena kim arthaṃ dāne pravṛttir ity āha-ahetyādi / yady aham ity ātmani saṃjñāvastuni cātmīye mamatā bhaved anurāgo 'parityāgalakṣaṇas tadā naiva tyāgabuddhir bhaviṣyati upalambhatamasāvṛtatvena mūḍhānām / evaṃ ca te mātsaryāt pretabhavaneṣūpapadyante / athavā kathañcinmanuṣyeṣūpapadyante / tadā bhavanti dāridryaprāptāḥ / tataś ca yathoktanīty eva dāne pravṛttiḥ sthitam(tā) // 11 //
kimartham evaṃ dāne 'dhimuktir iti ced āha-tadetyādi / yademāṃ paśyati daridrān sattvāṃs tadā bodhisattvo dayāsampatyā yathokte dāne 'dhimuktaḥ san āgamādipramāṇopetatvena phalena saha sarvasvatyajanāt sadā yu(mu)ktatyāgī bhaved ataścaturo dvīpān saptaratnasamalaṅkṛtān tatra sa[115a]rvathāvagrahavirahāt khedatulyān trimaṇḍalapariśuddhiyogena datvā tadā saumanasyaprāpto bhaven na yathā dvīpān yathoktān labdhvā prāpyeti yāvat // 12 //
yathoktaṃ ca dānam akṣayārtham anuttarabodhau pariṇāmayitavyam ity āha-dānam ityādi / anantaroktakrameṇa dānaṃ datvā vidvān paṇḍito bodhisattvo yāvantaḥ sattvās tribhaveṣu vidyante tān samanvāhṛtya sarvebhyas tebhyo bhavatv idaṃ dānaṃ dattam ity evam āśayena tadyānam agrabhodhau pariṇāmayati jagadartham eva / bodheḥ sattvānāṃ cākṣayatvād dānam akṣayaṃ syād iti bhāvaḥ // 13 //
tatra tān abhi(tan nānabhi)niveśo(śa)phalam āvedayann āha-na cetyādi / deyadāyakapratigrāhakānupalambhād yo naiva vastv agrahaṃ karoti / datvā ca dānaṃ paramparānugrahabuddhyā tatphalābhilāṣān naiva kadācid vipākaṃ pratikāṅkṣati / evaṃ sa phalena saha sarvasvajanān tyaktvā bhaved vidvān sarvasvatyāgī svalpaṃ ca tyaktvopāyakauśalabalāl labhate[ ']saṃkhyāpramāṇābhyāṃ paricche[115b]ttum aśakyatvād bahum aprameyaṃ ca vipākam iti śeṣaḥ // 14 //
mātsaryanigrahāya ca dānapāramitāvadanumodanāpūrvakaḥ pariṇāmo 'bhyasanīya ityāha-yāvantetyādi / yāvantaḥ sattvāḥ kāmarūpārūpyalakṣaṇatribhave sarvākāśadhātvantargatatvān nikhile sambhavanti / te ca sarve dānaṃ dadanyatu(dadaty ananta)kalpān buddhebhyo lokavidbhyo 'rhadbhyaḥ pratyekabuddhebhyaś ca tathā cec chanti śrāvakaguṇā[n] tasyopalakṣaṇatavād buddhādiguṇāṃś ca / vastūpalambhayogena pravṛttatvāt parikalpasthāne sthitā iti bhāvaḥ / yaś cānyaḥ samyagupāyakuśalo  vidvān bodhisattvas teṣāṃ tatpuṇyakriyāvastvanummodya sattvārthaṃ pratyagrabodhau pariṇāmayed evaṃ cāsau mātsaryanigrahād abhibhavet sarvaṃ jagat // 15-16 //
pūrvoktaṃ yathoktapariṇāmayet(yan) / kim ivety āha-kācasyetyādi / yathā kācasya maṇiratnasya rāśayaḥ syur mahāntastān sarvān vaiḍūryaratnam ekaṃ mūlyaprabhāvābhyāṃ mahatvād abhibhavet / [116a] tathā sarvasmin jagati pūrvokte yāvān pṛthudānaskandhaḥ taṃ sarvam abhibhaved anumodanāpūrvakam anantaroktakrameṇa pariṇāmako bodhisattvaḥ // 17 //
vistareṇa pāramitādvaye(yaṃ) nirdiśyaivaṃ pariśiṣṭapāramitāsva[va]vādaṃ kathayann āha-yadītyādi / yadā bodhisattvo 'vaśiṣṭapāramitāparipālanena dedīyamāno jagataḥ sambandhitvena dānaṃ tāsām eva pariśodhanaṃ (paripālanaṃ) kartur upalambhātmasattvaṃ(?) na tatra karoti / kriyākarmān avabodhāc ca na vastu snehaṃ tadā varddhate kuśalair mahānubhāvaś candra ivānabhraḥ prabhāmaṇḍalaiḥ śuklapakṣa ity etāv aśiṣṭapāramitāvavādenākhilārthāvavādo dharmodgatabodhisattvavatkalyāṇamitreṇa vidheya iti // 18 //
ratnaguṇasañcayagāthāvyākhyāyāṃ dharmodgataparivarta ekatriṃśattamaḥ //

parīndanāparivarto dvātriṃśaḥ 
evam labdhāvādānāṃ cittotpādādikrameṇa pramuditādibhūmyadhigamād dānādipāramitānāṃ mukhyato vyāpāra[116b]māvedayānn āha-dānetyādi / tatra tāvat mukhyataḥ pramuditāyāṃ bodhisattvabhūmau sthito mātsaryaprahāṇād dānena sarvathā pretagatimātmanaḥ sarvasattvānāṃ ca [mātsaryaṃ] cchināti bodhisattvas tathā dāridryaṃ tathā tatpratibaddhāṃś cāsāṃya? duḥkhādīn sarvakleśān devādigatāvapanayati / bhogāṃś ca prakārabhedād anantān audāryād vipulān labhate / bodhisattvacārikāṃ caratrato dānena sattvān bodhicittādau pratiṣṭhāpanāt paripācayet kṛtsnaprāptāṃs tathā vimalāyāṃ sthitaḥ sarvadauḥśīlyavigamād yathoktena śīlena tiryakgatim anekarūpām aṣṭau cākṣaṇān atiprasiddhān varjayati / manuṣyatvādikṣaṇān viśiṣṭārthakāriṇo labhate ca nityam / prabhākaryāṃ sarvavyāpādavigamāt kṣāntyā rūpaṃ labhate [la]kṣaṇādyalaṃkṛtatvāt / paramam abhi(ti)vaipulyād udārastambha(raṃ tapta)hāṭakasadṛśatvāt suvarṇacchavirmanonukūlatvāt priyo 'secanakakāyatvāj jaga[117a]taś cādīkṣaṇīyo bhavet / arciṣmatyāṃ sarvakauśīdyavigamādvīryeṇa śuklaguṇebhyo na parihāṇim abhyupeti jñānaṃ ca viṣayānantyād anantam / buddhatvaparamadhanasañcayātmakatvāt jinakośagañjāṃ prāpnoti / sudurjayāyāṃ sarvavikṣepaprahāṇād dhyānena kāmaguṇān vikṣepahetubhūtān doṣāka[a]ratvān nindanīyān sarvathā parityāgād utsṛjati / viśiṣṭasatyābhisambodhipañcābhijñasvabhāvatvād yathākramaṃ vidyākramabhijñaḥ / sū(śū)raṅgamādisamādhī(dhe)ścotpādanād abhinirharati / ābhimukhyāṃ ca sarvadoṣprajña(?)vigamāt prajñāyā dharmāṇāṃ parkṛtaṃ māyopamatvādirūpāṃ(paṃ) parijñāya traidhātukebhyo 'pāyebhyo viparyāsabandhanebhyaḥ samyag atikramet / nirmāṇameghena ca prathamato dharmacakraratnaṃ pravarttya tathāgatānāṃ paścāt krameṇa deśayati dharm'm triyāne saṃgṛhītaṃ sattvaloke viparyāsaduḥkhavinivṛttaye / dūraṅgaṃāyāṃ upāyabalāt paripūryam ā[117b][ṇā]neva dānādīn dharmān pāramitāsvabhāvena sa bodhisattvo 'calāyāṃ praṇidhānasāmarthyāt suvarṇādimayabhūbhāganiṣpādanād ādhārabuddhakṣetrapariśuddhiṃ jighatsādyabhāvād ādheyabuddhakṣetrasattvaśuddhiṃ ca parigṛhṇāti / tathā sādhumatyāṃ balasāmarthyena sattvadhātor buddhakṣe[tra]pratiṣṭhāpanād buddhavaṃśam api parigṛhṇāti / tathā dharmameghāyāṃ daśamyāṃ bhūmau jñānabalena dharmadeśanāprabandhād dharmavaṃśaṃ tathāvicchinnabodhisa[ttva]paramparāniṣpādanāt saṃghavaṃśaṃ ca praigṛhṇāti / evaṃ kramād ekādaśyāṃ samantaprabhāyāṃ ca buddhabhūmau savāsanasarvābha(va)raṇaprahāṇād aviparītadharmāvabodhena parigṛhṇāti sarvadharmān // 1-5 //
vistareṇa mātaraṃ nirdiśyaivaṃ cirasthitaye pratyayann āha-vaidyottamo jagatītyādi / yathātiśayena lakṣyalakṣaṇaparijapāṃ(jñeyān) vaidyottamo jagati jvarādirogān apanayakārī kathito 'nvarthasaṃjñayā ca cittotpādādiguṇavannānā(ratnānāṃ)sañca[ya]rūpatvād ratnaguṇasyñcayaḥ / [118a]padyabandhena nirdiṣṭatvād gāthāsvabhāvaḥ / taṃ sarvasattvā yathemam bhāvanopadeśakrameṇa sattvā(tyā)dvayakathanāt mārgam anuprāptaya(prāptā)s tathā bhavadbhiḥ kāryam ity āryānandaprabhṛtibhyaḥ pratyarpitavān iti boddhavyam / evaṃ śatasāhasrikāyāṃ bhagavatyāṃ paryante 'bhidhānāt / tatrāyaṃ bhāvanopadeśakramo 'bhisaṃpratyayakārī yadutādau tāvacchubhe deśe kṛtāvasthitir deśakaṃ bhagavantaṃ śākyādhirājaṃ siṃhāsanasthaṃ dharmacakramudrayā yuktaṃ yathāvat pūjāpūrvakaṃ buddhabodhisattvādibhiḥ parivṛtaṃ vibhāvya praṇamet / tato vajraparyaṅkam āpūrya ṛjuṃ kāyaṃ praṇidhāya samādhiyogena sthitvā jihvātālugatāṃ kṛtvā nāsikāgre dṛṣṭim avasthāpya daśasu dikṣu buddhabodhisattvālambanapūrvakaṃ tebhyaḥ samu[pa]deśamādāya prajñāpāramitānayaṃ sarvadharmanairātmya[118b]d dyotakaṃ mūlacittena nāmataḥ samālambya tasyaiva padaprabhedaṃ parivartādibhedād anucaracittena nirūpayet / tato 'ṣṭābhisamayāvasthābhedena saṃkhyāgahaṇāt gaṇanayā pratyabhisamayasvarūpaniścayāt tulanayādhyāropāpavādābhāvāt mīmāṃsayā pratyakṣānumānapramāṇopapannatvāt pratyavekṣaṇatayevaṃ prajñāpāramitārthaṃ caturbhir ākārair vyañjanāni tu vyastasamastāni yathākramaṃ nirarthakasadarthatayety evam ākārābhyāṃ vicāraṇāc cittena vicārayet / tadā tu yathā vicāritaṃ nimittam idam eva satyaṃ moho 'nya ity avadhāraṇācittenāvadhrṭya yathā vicāritam evārthaṃ nimittanāmālambake mūlacitte sakalacittena(?) prakṣipyānuttarasamyaksambuddhatvacchandasahagatena śāsti cittena / prajñācakṣuṣā māyopamatvena sarvadharmāṇāṃ samyagjñānālokenādarśanād avikalpayan hetuphalabhāvavirahāt śūnyā / tataḥ svasāmānyanimittavaikalyād animittānataḥ prārthayitavyavastvanupalambhād apraṇihi[119a]tān / evaṃ ca prakṛtiprabhāsvaravimokṣamukhasamādhinā cittotpādāni(di)krameṇa dharmatattvāparijñānād viparyāsabandhanena saṃsāracārake baddhān sattvadhātūn abhyuddhartuṃ mahākaruṇācittena bhāvanāṃ kuryāt / tatra ca samādhau kauśīdyam ālambanasaṃpramoṣo layauddhatye tathā saṃbhogaḥ punar ābhoga iti ṣaṭ doṣāṇāṃ yathāvasaram utpāde tatpratipakṣeṇa cāṣṭau prahāṇasaṃsakārān yathāyogaṃ vibhāvayet / tathā hi samādhiguṇeṣv abhisaṃpratyayalakṣaṇayā śraddhayā yoginaḥ chandaḥ samutpadyate / tataś chandabalādvīryam ārabhate / tato vīryabalena kāye cittaprasrabdhim āsādayati / prasrabdhakāyacetasaḥ kauśīdyaṃ vā(vyā)varttate / tasmāc chraddhādayaś catvāraḥ kauśīdyaprahāṇāya bhavanti / smṛtir ālambanasaṃpramoṣasya pratipakṣas tayā samyagālambanāvasthānāt saṃprajanyam / layauddhatyayoḥ pratipakṣas tena prāmodyavastu buddhādiguṇamanasikārāt layasaṃvegavastu anityatā[119b]di mansikārādauddhatyasya prahāṇaṃ bhavati / layauddhatyapraśamanakāle cānābhogadoṣas tatpratipakṣeṇa cetanābhyasanīyā layauddhatyapraśame sati yadā cittam ālambanane niṣprakampam anabhisaṃskāravāhipravṛttaṃ bhavati tadā punar ābhogo doṣas tena cittacikṣepād atas tatpratipakṣeṇopekṣā bhāvanīyety evaṃ krameṇa vibhāvya vyutthānapūrvakaṃ saṃgītikāraśrīvajradhararūpādhimokṣeṇa bodhisattvādīnāhūya prajñāpāramitādeśanayā dharmadānaṃ dattvā tat sarvam anabhiniveśayogena sarvasattvārtham anuttarasamyaksambodhau pariṇāmayed evaṃ catussattvādha(sandhyā)ya(yā)m iti // 6 //
ratnaguṇasañcayagāthāvyākhyāyāṃ parīndanā parivarto dvātriṃśattamaḥ //
māme(te)yaṃ gamitā na yogavidhibhiḥ kaiścit purāprāgibhir vijñāyāstasamastamohatamasā nāthena yā bhavi(ṣi)tā /
tāṃ vyākhyāya suyuktisaṃgatapadaiḥ puṇyaṃ mayā vāpi yat tenemāṃ guṇaratnasañcayavartī prapnotu śīghraṃ janaḥ // [120a]
yo 'laṅkāro 'bhisamaye tat piṇḍārthaprakāśikā /
prajñāpāramitāvyākhyāsamāpteyaṃ śubhodayā //
anuṣṭupcchandasaikatraślokānāṃ parisaṃkhyayā /
[śa]tādhikam idaṃ jñeyaṃ sa[hasra]dvayasammitam iti //
kṛtir iyam ācāryaharibhadrapādānām iti //



